export const norwayParentalBenefitTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"የኖርዌይ የወላጅ ጥቅም እና ፈቃድ እቅድ አውጪ","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"የኖርዌይ የወላጅ ፈቃድ እቅድ አውጪ 2026 - ሳምንታት፣ ኮታዎች እና የቀን መቁጠሪያ","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"ለመወለድ ወይም ለማደጎ የኖርዌይ የወላጅ-ጥቅማ ጥቅሞች ሳምንታት ያቅዱ። 80% እና 100% ሽፋንን ያወዳድሩ, የእያንዳንዱን ወላጅ ኮታ ይመድቡ, ከፊል እረፍት ያዘጋጁ እና የግል የቀን መቁጠሪያ ፋይል ይላኩ.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"ቀኖችን፣ ኮታዎችን እና ከስራ የራቀ ጊዜን በማነጻጸር ተግባራዊ የሆነ የኖርዌይ የወላጅ-ጥቅማ ጥቅም እቅድ አውጪ። ለበይነገጽ ቋንቋ ይምረጡ; ከታች ያሉት ደንቦች የኖርዌይ NAV ደንቦች ይቀራሉ.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ይሰራል። ቀኖች እና የቤተሰብ እቅድ ዝርዝሮች ወደ አገልጋይ አይላኩም ወይም በዚህ መሳሪያ አይቀመጡም።","Example":"ለምሳሌ","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"በ 1 ህዳር 2026 ላይ ለተወለደ አንድ ልጅ, ሁለቱም ወላጆች ብቁ የሚሆኑበት መደበኛ የ NAV ጊዜ 49 ሳምንታት በ 100% ወይም 61 ሳምንታት እና 1 ቀን በ 80% ነው. የ 80% ምርጫ በአጠቃላይ ረዘም ላለ ጊዜ ክፍያዎችን ያሰራጫል; NAV ጠቅላላ ክፍያ በግምት እኩል ነው ይላል.","How the planner works":"እቅድ አውጪው እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"በመጀመሪያ ለተመረጠው የክስተት ቀን፣የክስተት አይነት፣የልጆች ብዛት እና ሽፋን ይፋዊውን የጊዜ ሰንጠረዥ ያወዳድሩ። ከዚያ የራስዎን የእረፍት ጊዜያቶች ያክሉ። የሳምንቱ ቀናት የጥቅማጥቅሞችን ቀናት ይበላሉ; ከፊል መውጣት በሳምንት ቀን ጥቅም ላይ የሚውሉትን ቀናት ይቀንሳል እና የቀን መቁጠሪያውን ያራዝመዋል. ክፍተቶች ያለ ጥቅማጥቅሞች ሥራን ወይም ዕረፍትን ሊያመለክቱ ይችላሉ።","Common questions":"የተለመዱ ጥያቄዎች","Scope and limits":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"ኖርዌይ ብቻ። ይህ የዕቅድ ዕርዳታ እንጂ የብቃት ውሳኔ፣ የጥቅማጥቅም ክፍያ ስሌት፣ የአሰሪ ፈቃድ ወይም የ NAV ማመልከቻ አይደለም። መደበኛው ሰንጠረዥ ሁለቱም ወላጆች መብት እንዳገኙ ይገምታል. የእንቅስቃሴ ሕጎች፣ የአንድ ወላጅ ጉዳዮች፣ ያለዕድሜ መወለድ፣ ሕመም፣ በአንድ ጊዜ የዕረፍት ጊዜ ልዩነቶች፣ ድንበር ተሻጋሪ ማስተባበር እና የግለሰብ የገቢ ስሌቶች ውጤቱን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ። ለእነዚያ ጉዳዮች NAV ያረጋግጡ.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች ብቻ · የ NAV የጊዜ ሰንጠረዥ ታይቷል 17 ጥቅምት 2026 · ቋንቋ አገሩን ወይም ደንቦችን አይለውጥም.","Family event":"የቤተሰብ ክስተት","Birth":"ልደት","Adoption":"ጉዲፈቻ","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"የሚጠበቀው የልደት ወይም የእንክብካቤ-የማስተላለፊያ ቀን","Number of children":"የልጆች ብዛት","One child":"አንድ ልጅ","Two children":"ሁለት ልጆች","Three or more children":"ሦስት ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ልጆች","Coverage choice":"የሽፋን ምርጫ","100% coverage":"100% ሽፋን","80% coverage":"80% ሽፋን","Add a leave period":"የእረፍት ጊዜ ጨምር","Parent taking leave":"ወላጅ እረፍት መውሰድ","Mother":"እናት","Other parent":"ሌላ ወላጅ","Benefit quota used":"የጥቅም ኮታ ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል","Prenatal quota":"ቅድመ ወሊድ ኮታ","Mother quota":"የእናት ኮታ","Other-parent quota":"የሌላ-ወላጅ ኮታ","Shared period":"የተጋራ ጊዜ","First date":"የመጀመሪያ ቀን","Last date":"የመጨረሻ ቀን","Benefit withdrawal, %":"ጥቅማጥቅም መውጣት፣%","Calendar label":"የቀን መቁጠሪያ መለያ","Add period to plan":"ለእቅድ ጊዜ ጨምር","Remove":"አስወግድ","Check plan":"ዕቅዱን ያረጋግጡ","Clear plan":"ዕቅድ አጽዳ","Download calendar (.ics)":"የማውረጃ የቀን መቁጠሪያ (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"የኖርዌይ እቅድ ማጠቃለያ","Total NAV period":"ጠቅላላ NAV ጊዜ","Before birth":"ከመወለዱ በፊት","benefit days":"የጥቅም ቀናት","weeks":"ሳምንታት","Unscheduled quota remaining":"ያልተያዘ ኮታ ይቀራል","Total days not yet assigned":"ጠቅላላ ቀናት ገና አልተመደቡም።","Your dated periods":"ያለባቸው ጊዜያት","Parent":"ወላጅ","Quota":"ኮታ","Calendar dates":"የቀን መቁጠሪያ ቀኖች","Withdrawal":"መውጣት","Benefit days used":"ጥቅም ቀናት ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"የቀረውን ኮታ እና የቀን መቁጠሪያ ለማየት የቀነባቸው ወቅቶችን ይጨምሩ።","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"የክስተቱን ዝርዝሮች ይምረጡ እና ለማነጻጸር የሚፈልጉትን ማንኛውንም ክፍለ ጊዜ ይጨምሩ።","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ እቅድ ታይቷል። NAV የግለሰብ መብቶችን ይወስናል።","Period added to the plan.":"በዕቅዱ ላይ የተጨመረበት ጊዜ።","Period removed.":"ጊዜ ተወግዷል።","Plan cleared.":"ዕቅድ ጸድቷል።","Calendar file created on this device.":"የቀን መቁጠሪያ ፋይል በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ተፈጥሯል።","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"ቀኖቹን፣ ወላጅ፣ ኮታ እና የመውጣት መቶኛን ይገምግሙ።","Compare the two coverage choices":"ሁለቱን የሽፋን ምርጫዎች ያወዳድሩ","Total period":"ጠቅላላ ጊዜ","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"የሽፋን ምርጫው ለሁለቱም ወላጆች አንድ ነው እና በኋላ ሊቀየር አይችልም። አሃዞቹ የጊዜ ርዝማኔዎች እንጂ የክፍያ ግምት አይደሉም።","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"የእርስዎ ግቤቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ትር ውስጥ ይቆያሉ። አውርድን በሚመርጡበት ጊዜ የቀን መቁጠሪያ ወደ ውጭ መላክ ይፈጠራል።","Assumptions used":"ያገለገሉ ግምቶች","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"የጥቅም ቀናት ከሰኞ እስከ አርብ ይቆጠራሉ። የህዝብ በዓላት ተለይተው አይገለሉም.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"የከፊል-መውጣት መቶኛ ረዘም ያለ መርሐግብር እና የቀነሰ የጥቅማ ጥቅሞችን ቀንሷል። ትክክለኛውን የስራ መቶኛ ከአሰሪው ጋር ይስማሙ እና NAV ያረጋግጡ።","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"የተጣመረ በአንድ ጊዜ መውጣት በዚህ መደበኛ እቅድ አውጪ ውስጥ በ 100% የተገደበ ነው; ልዩ የበርካታ ልደት ልዩነቶች ከዚህ ቼክ ውጭ ናቸው።","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV ክፍለ ጊዜዎች በመደበኛነት ልጁ ሦስት ዓመት ሳይሞላው ወይም በሦስት ዓመት ጊዜ ውስጥ ለጉዲፈቻ እንክብካቤ ከተላለፈ በኋላ ጥቅም ላይ መዋል አለበት።","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · የወላጅ ጥቅማ ጥቅሞች ደንቦች እና የጊዜ ሠንጠረዦች","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · ብሔራዊ ኢንሹራንስ መሠረታዊ መጠን (ጂ)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · ይፋዊ የወላጅ ጥቅም ዕቅድ አውጪ","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"ከዚህ እቅድ አውጪ ውጭ ለሆኑ ጉዳዮች የNAV መመሪያን ይክፈቱ","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"ይህ ክስተት ቀን እዚህ ከተካተቱት የ NAV ሰንጠረዦች ውጪ ነው። ለሚመለከተው ደንብ ስሪት የ NAV መመሪያን ይክፈቱ።","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"ይህ እትም ሁለቱም ወላጆች መብት ያገኙበትን መደበኛ መያዣ ሞዴል ነው። ለሌሎች የቤተሰብ ሁኔታዎች NAV ይጠቀሙ።","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"የገጹን ቋንቋ መቀየር ደንቦቹን ይለውጣል?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"ቁ. በይነገጹ በተለያዩ ቋንቋዎች ሊነበብ ይችላል፣ ነገር ግን ይህ እቅድ አውጪ ሁልጊዜ የተጠቀሰውን የኖርዌይ NAV የጊዜ ሰንጠረዥን ይተገበራል።","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"ይህ NAV የይገባኛል ጥያቄዬን ያፀድቀው እንደሆነ ይነግረኛል?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"ቁ. ብቁነት እና ክፍያ ከግል መዛግብትዎ በNAV ይወሰናል። ይህ እቅድ አውጪ እርስዎ የሚያስገቧቸውን መደበኛ የጊዜ ሰንጠረዥ እና ቀኖች ብቻ ያወዳድራል።","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"ሁለቱም ወላጆች ጥቅማ ጥቅሞችን በአንድ ጊዜ መውሰድ ይችላሉ?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"አንዳንድ ዝግጅቶች ሊደራረቡ ይችላሉ፣ነገር ግን መደበኛ ዕቅድ አውጪው ጥምር መውጣትን እስከ 100% ይገድባል። ልዩ ብዙ መወለድ እና ሌሎች ልዩ ሁኔታዎች በNAV መረጋገጥ አለባቸው።"},"ar":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"مخطط استحقاقات الوالدين والإجازات في النرويج","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"مخطط إجازة الوالدين في النرويج 2026 — الأسابيع والحصص والتقويم","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"التخطيط لأسابيع إعانة الوالدين النرويجية للولادة أو التبني. قارن تغطية 80% و100%، وقم بتعيين حصص كل من الوالدين، وجدولة الإجازة الجزئية، وتصدير ملف تقويم خاص.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"مخطط عملي لمزايا الوالدين النرويجية للعائلات يقارن التواريخ والحصص والوقت بعيدًا عن العمل. اختر لغة للواجهة؛ تظل القواعد الواردة أدناه هي قواعد الملاحة البحرية النرويجية.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"يعمل على هذا الجهاز. لا يتم إرسال التواريخ وتفاصيل الخطة العائلية إلى الخادم أو حفظها بواسطة هذه الأداة.","Example":"مثال","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"بالنسبة لطفل واحد ولد في 1 نوفمبر 2026، فإن فترة صافي قيمة الأصول القياسية عندما يتأهل كلا الوالدين هي 49 أسبوع عند 100% أو 61 أسبوع و1 يوم عند 80%. يقوم خيار 80% عمومًا بتوزيع المدفوعات على مدى فترة زمنية أطول؛ يقول صافي قيمة الأصول أن إجمالي الدفعة متساوٍ تقريبًا.","How the planner works":"كيف يعمل المخطط","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"قم أولاً بمقارنة جدول الفترة الرسمي لتاريخ الحدث المحدد ونوع الحدث وعدد الأطفال والتغطية. ثم قم بإضافة فترات الإجازة المؤرخة الخاصة بك. أيام الأسبوع تستهلك أيام الاستفادة؛ يؤدي السحب الجزئي إلى تقليل الأيام المستخدمة في أيام الأسبوع وتوسيع التقويم. يمكن أن تمثل الفجوات العمل أو الإجازة دون سحب المزايا.","Common questions":"الأسئلة الشائعة","Scope and limits":"النطاق والحدود","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"النرويج فقط. هذه مساعدة في التخطيط، وليست قرار أهلية، أو حساب دفع المزايا، أو تحديد حقوق إجازة صاحب العمل أو طلب صافي قيمة الأصول. يفترض الجدول القياسي أن كلا الوالدين قد حصلا على حق. قواعد النشاط، وحالات الوالد الواحد، والولادة المبكرة، والمرض، واستثناءات الإجازة المتزامنة، والتنسيق عبر الحدود وحسابات الدخل الفردي يمكن أن تغير النتيجة؛ تحقق من NAV لتلك الحالات.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"القواعد النرويجية فقط · تم تحديد الجدول الزمني لـ NAV 17 أكتوبر 2026 · لا تغير اللغة البلد أو القواعد.","Family event":"حدث عائلي","Birth":"الولادة","Adoption":"الاعتماد","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"الولادة المتوقعة أو تاريخ نقل الرعاية","Number of children":"عدد الأطفال","One child":"طفل واحد","Two children":"طفلان","Three or more children":"ثلاثة أطفال أو أكثر","Coverage choice":"اختيار التغطية\nتغطية","100% coverage":"100%\nتغطية","80% coverage":"80%","Add a leave period":"إضافة فترة إجازة","Parent taking leave":"أخذ الوالد إجازة","Mother":"الأم","Other parent":"والد آخر","Benefit quota used":"حصة الفوائد المستخدمة","Prenatal quota":"حصة ما قبل الولادة","Mother quota":"الحصة الأم","Other-parent quota":"الحصة النسبية للأصول الأخرى","Shared period":"الفترة المشتركة","First date":"التاريخ الأول","Last date":"آخر تاريخ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"سحب المنفعة، %","Calendar label":"ملصق التقويم","Add period to plan":"إضافة فترة للخطة","Remove":"إزالة","Check plan":"التحقق من الخطة","Clear plan":"خطة واضحة","Download calendar (.ics)":"تنزيل التقويم (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"ملخص خطة النرويج","Total NAV period":"إجمالي فترة صافي قيمة الأصول","Before birth":"قبل الولادة","benefit days":"أيام الاستفادة","weeks":"أسابيع","Unscheduled quota remaining":"الحصة المتبقية غير المجدولة","Total days not yet assigned":"إجمالي الأيام لم يتم تعيينه بعد","Your dated periods":"دورتك الشهرية","Parent":"الأصل","Quota":"الحصة","Calendar dates":"تواريخ التقويم","Withdrawal":"الانسحاب","Benefit days used":"أيام الاستفادة المستخدمة","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"أضف فترات زمنية لرؤية الحصة المتبقية والتقويم.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"اختر تفاصيل الحدث وأضف أي فترات تريد مقارنتها.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"تم التحقق من الخطة على هذا الجهاز. NAV يقرر الحقوق الفردية.","Period added to the plan.":"الفترة المضافة إلى الخطة.","Period removed.":"تمت إزالة الفترة.","Plan cleared.":"تم مسح الخطة.","Calendar file created on this device.":"ملف التقويم الذي تم إنشاؤه على هذا الجهاز.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"راجع التواريخ والأصل والحصة ونسب السحب.","Compare the two coverage choices":"قارن بين خياري التغطية","Total period":"الفترة الإجمالية","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"اختيار التغطية هو نفسه لكلا الوالدين ولا يمكن تغييره لاحقًا. الأرقام هي أطوال الفترات، وليست تقديرات للدفع.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"تبقى إدخالاتك في علامة تبويب المتصفح هذه. يتم إنشاء تصدير التقويم محليًا عند اختيار تنزيل.","Assumptions used":"الافتراضات المستخدمة","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"يتم احتساب أيام المزايا من الاثنين إلى الجمعة؛ لا يتم استبعاد العطلات الرسمية بشكل منفصل.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"تمثل النسبة المئوية للسحب الجزئي جدولًا زمنيًا أطول واستخدامًا أقل ليوم الاستفادة. قم بالاتفاق على نسبة العمل الفعلية مع صاحب العمل والتحقق من صافي قيمة الأصول.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"يقتصر السحب المتزامن المجمع على 100% في هذا المخطط القياسي؛ الاستثناءات الخاصة بتعدد الولادات تقع خارج هذا الفحص.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"يجب استخدام فترات NAV عادةً قبل أن يبلغ الطفل سن الثالثة، أو خلال ثلاث سنوات بعد نقل الرعاية للتبني.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · قواعد منفعة الوالدين وجداول الفترة","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · المبلغ الأساسي للتأمين الوطني (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · المخطط الرسمي لاستحقاقات الوالدين","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"افتح إرشادات التنقل للحالات خارج هذا المخطط","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"تاريخ الحدث هذا خارج جداول صافي قيمة الأصول المؤرخة المضمنة هنا. افتح إرشادات NAV لإصدار القاعدة المعمول به.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"يمثل هذا الإصدار الحالة القياسية حيث حصل كلا الوالدين على حق. استخدم NAV في المواقف العائلية الأخرى.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"هل تغيير لغة الصفحة يغير القواعد؟","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"رقم. يمكن قراءة الواجهة بلغات مختلفة، لكن هذا المخطط يطبق دائمًا الجدول الزمني المذكور لقيمة NAV النرويجية.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"هل يخبرني هذا ما إذا كانت قيمة صافي قيمة الأصول (NAV) ستوافق على مطالبتي؟","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"رقم. يتم تحديد الأهلية والدفع بواسطة NAV من سجلاتك الفردية. يقوم هذا المخطط بمقارنة جدول الفترة القياسية والتواريخ التي تدخلها فقط.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"هل يمكن للوالدين الحصول على المزايا في نفس الوقت؟","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"يمكن أن تتداخل بعض الترتيبات، لكن المخطط القياسي يحد من السحب المجمع بنسبة 100%. يجب التحقق من الاستثناءات الخاصة للولادات المتعددة والاستثناءات الأخرى باستخدام NAV."},"bg":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Норвегия Планиране на родителски обезщетения и отпуск","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Норвегия Планиране на родителски отпуск 2026 — Седмици, квоти и календар","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Планирайте норвежки седмици за родителски обезщетения за раждане или осиновяване. Сравнете 80% и 100% покритие, задайте квоти на всеки родител, насрочете частичен отпуск и експортирайте файл с личен календар.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Практичен норвежки план за родителски надбавки за семейства, които сравняват дати, квоти и време извън работа. Изберете език за интерфейса; правилата по-долу остават норвежките правила за NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Работи на това устройство. Датите и подробностите за семейния план не се изпращат до сървър или се запазват от този инструмент.","Example":"Пример","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"За едно дете, родено на 1 ноември 2026, стандартният NAV период, когато и двамата родители отговарят на условията, е 49 седмици при 100% или 61 седмици и 1 ден при 80%. Изборът 80% обикновено разпределя плащанията за по-дълго време; NAV казва, че общото плащане е приблизително равно.","How the planner works":"Как работи планерът","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Първо сравнете официалната периодична таблица за избраната дата на събитието, тип събитие, брой деца и покритие. След това добавете свои собствени датирани периоди на отпуск. Делничните дни консумират дни за обезщетения; частичното оттегляне намалява дните, използвани за ден от седмицата, и разширява календара. Пропуските могат да представляват работа или ваканция без изтегляне на обезщетения.","Common questions":"Често срещани въпроси","Scope and limits":"Обхват и ограничения","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Само за Норвегия. Това е помощ за планиране, а не решение за допустимост, изчисляване на изплащане на обезщетение, определяне на права за отпуск от работодател или кандидатстване за NAV. Стандартната таблица предполага, че и двамата родители са спечелили право. Правилата за дейност, случаи с един родител, ранно раждане, болест, изключения за едновременен отпуск, трансгранична координация и индивидуализирани изчисления на доходите могат да променят резултата; проверете NAV за тези случаи.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Само норвежки правила · NAV таблица с периоди е проверена 17 октомври 2026 · езикът не променя страната или правилата.","Family event":"Семейно събитие","Birth":"Раждане","Adoption":"Осиновяване","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Очаквана дата на раждане или прехвърляне на грижа","Number of children":"Брой деца","One child":"Едно дете","Two children":"Две деца","Three or more children":"Три или повече деца","Coverage choice":"Избор на покритие","100% coverage":"100% покритие","80% coverage":"80% покритие","Add a leave period":"Добавете период на отпуск","Parent taking leave":"Родител в отпуск","Mother":"Майка","Other parent":"Друг родител","Benefit quota used":"Използвана квота за предимства","Prenatal quota":"Пренатална квота","Mother quota":"Майчинска квота","Other-parent quota":"Друга родителска квота","Shared period":"Споделен период","First date":"Първа среща","Last date":"Последна дата","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Теглене на ползи, %","Calendar label":"Етикет на календара","Add period to plan":"Добавяне на период към плана","Remove":"Премахване","Check plan":"Проверете плана","Clear plan":"Ясен план","Download calendar (.ics)":"Изтегляне на календар (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Резюме на плана на Норвегия","Total NAV period":"Общ период на NAV","Before birth":"Преди раждането","benefit days":"дни за обезщетения","weeks":"седмици","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Оставаща непланирана квота","Total days not yet assigned":"Общ брой дни, които все още не са определени","Your dated periods":"Вашите датирани периоди","Parent":"Родител","Quota":"Квота","Calendar dates":"Календарни дати","Withdrawal":"Теглене","Benefit days used":"Използвани дни за обезщетение","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Добавете датирани периоди, за да видите оставащата квота и календар.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Изберете подробности за събитието и добавете периоди, които искате да сравните.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Планът е проверен на това устройство. NAV решава индивидуалните права.","Period added to the plan.":"Периодът е добавен към плана.","Period removed.":"Точката е премахната.","Plan cleared.":"Планът е изчистен.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Календарен файл, създаден на това устройство.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Преглед на датите, родителя, квотата и процентите на теглене.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Сравнете двата варианта на покритие","Total period":"Общ период","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Изборът на покритие е еднакъв за двамата родители и не може да бъде променен по-късно. Цифрите са продължителност на периода, а не прогноза за изплащане.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Вашите записи остават в този раздел на браузъра. Експортирането на календар се създава локално, когато изберете Изтегляне.","Assumptions used":"Използвани предположения","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Дните за обезщетения се броят от понеделник до петък; официалните празници не са изключени отделно.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Процентът на частично теглене моделира по-дълъг график и намалено използване на ден на печалба. Съгласете действителния процент на работа с работодателя и проверете NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Комбинираното едновременно теглене е ограничено до 100% в този стандартен плановик; специалните изключения за многократно раждане са извън тази проверка.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV периодите обикновено трябва да се използват преди детето да навърши три години или в рамките на три години след прехвърляне на грижи за осиновяване.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · правила за родителски обезщетения и периодични таблици","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Основна сума на националното осигуряване (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · официален план за родителски надбавки","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Отворете насоки за NAV за случаи извън този плановик","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Тази дата на събитието е извън датираните NAV таблици, включени тук. Отворете ръководството за NAV за приложимата версия на правилото.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Тази версия моделира стандартния случай, при който и двамата родители са спечелили право. Използвайте NAV за други семейни ситуации.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Промяната на езика на страницата променя ли правилата?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Бр. Интерфейсът може да се чете на различни езици, но този плановик винаги прилага посочената норвежка периодична таблица на NAV.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Това казва ли ми дали NAV ще одобри искането ми?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Бр. Допустимостта и плащането се решават от NAV от вашите индивидуални записи. Този плановик сравнява само стандартната периодична таблица и въведените от вас дати.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Могат ли и двамата родители да вземат помощи едновременно?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Някои договорености могат да се припокриват, но стандартният плановик ограничава комбинираното теглене до 100%. Специални многократни раждания и други изключения трябва да бъдат проверени с NAV."},"bn":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"নরওয়ে প্যারেন্টাল বেনিফিট এবং লিভ প্ল্যানার","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"নরওয়ে প্যারেন্টাল লিভ প্ল্যানার 2026 — সপ্তাহ, কোটা এবং ক্যালেন্ডার","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"জন্ম বা দত্তক নেওয়ার জন্য নরওয়েজিয়ান প্যারেন্টাল-বেনিফিট সপ্তাহের পরিকল্পনা করুন। 80% এবং 100% কভারেজ তুলনা করুন, প্রতিটি পিতামাতার কোটা নির্ধারণ করুন, আংশিক ছুটির সময়সূচী করুন এবং একটি ব্যক্তিগত ক্যালেন্ডার ফাইল রপ্তানি করুন৷","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"একটি বাস্তব নরওয়েজিয়ান পিতামাতা-সুবিধা পরিকল্পনাকারী পরিবারগুলির জন্য তারিখ, কোটা এবং কাজের থেকে দূরে সময়ের তুলনা করে৷ ইন্টারফেসের জন্য একটি ভাষা চয়ন করুন; নীচের নিয়মগুলি নরওয়েজিয়ান এনএভি নিয়মগুলি থেকে যায়৷","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"এই ডিভাইসে চলে। তারিখ এবং পরিবার-পরিকল্পনার বিবরণ একটি সার্ভারে পাঠানো হয় না বা এই টুল দ্বারা সংরক্ষিত হয় না।","Example":"উদাহরণ","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"জন্মগ্রহণকারী একটি সন্তানের জন্য1নভেম্বর2026, মানক NAV সময়কাল যখন পিতামাতা উভয়ই যোগ্যতা অর্জন করে49সপ্তাহে100% বা61সপ্তাহ এবং1দিন80% দ80% পছন্দ সাধারণত দীর্ঘ সময়ের মধ্যে পেমেন্ট ছড়িয়ে দেয়; NAV বলছে মোট পেমেন্ট প্রায় সমান।","How the planner works":"পরিকল্পনাকারী কিভাবে কাজ করে","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"প্রথমে নির্বাচিত ইভেন্টের তারিখ, ইভেন্টের ধরন, শিশুদের সংখ্যা এবং কভারেজের জন্য অফিসিয়াল পিরিয়ড টেবিলের তুলনা করুন। তারপর আপনার নিজস্ব তারিখের ছুটির সময়কাল যোগ করুন। সপ্তাহের দিনগুলি উপকারী দিনগুলি গ্রাস করে; আংশিক প্রত্যাহার প্রতি সপ্তাহের দিনে ব্যবহৃত দিনগুলিকে হ্রাস করে এবং ক্যালেন্ডারকে প্রসারিত করে। ফাঁকগুলি সুবিধা প্রত্যাহার ছাড়াই কাজ বা ছুটির প্রতিনিধিত্ব করতে পারে।","Common questions":"সাধারণ প্রশ্ন","Scope and limits":"পরিধি এবং সীমা","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"শুধু নরওয়ে। এটি একটি পরিকল্পনা সহায়তা, যোগ্যতার সিদ্ধান্ত, সুবিধা-প্রদানের গণনা, নিয়োগকর্তার ছুটি-অধিকার নির্ধারণ বা NAV আবেদন নয়। আদর্শ সারণী অনুমান করে যে পিতামাতা উভয়ই একটি অধিকার অর্জন করেছেন। কার্যকলাপের নিয়ম, এক-পিতামাতার ক্ষেত্রে, প্রাথমিক জন্ম, অসুস্থতা, একযোগে ছুটির ব্যতিক্রম, আন্তঃসীমান্ত সমন্বয় এবং ব্যক্তিগতকৃত আয়ের গণনা ফলাফল পরিবর্তন করতে পারে; এই ক্ষেত্রে NAV চেক করুন।","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"শুধু নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম · NAV পিরিয়ড টেবিল চেক করা হয়েছে 17 অক্টোবর 2026 · ভাষা দেশ বা নিয়ম পরিবর্তন করে না।","Family event":"পারিবারিক ইভেন্ট","Birth":"জন্ম","Adoption":"দত্তক","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"প্রত্যাশিত জন্ম বা যত্ন-স্থানান্তর তারিখ","Number of children":"শিশুদের সংখ্যা","One child":"একটি শিশু","Two children":"দুটি শিশু","Three or more children":"তিন বা তার বেশি শিশু","Coverage choice":"কভারেজ পছন্দ","100% coverage":"100% কভারেজ","80% coverage":"80% কভারেজ","Add a leave period":"একটি ছুটির সময়কাল যোগ করুন","Parent taking leave":"অভিভাবক ছুটি নিচ্ছেন","Mother":"মা","Other parent":"অন্যান্য অভিভাবক","Benefit quota used":"বেনিফিট কোটা ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Prenatal quota":"প্রসবপূর্ব কোটা","Mother quota":"মাদার কোটা","Other-parent quota":"অন্যান্য-অভিভাবক কোটা","Shared period":"ভাগ করা সময়কাল","First date":"প্রথম তারিখ","Last date":"শেষ তারিখ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"বেনিফিট প্রত্যাহার, %","Calendar label":"ক্যালেন্ডার লেবেল","Add period to plan":"প্ল্যানে সময়কাল যোগ করুন","Remove":"সরান","Check plan":"প্ল্যান চেক করুন","Clear plan":"পরিষ্কার পরিকল্পনা","Download calendar (.ics)":"ক্যালেন্ডার ডাউনলোড করুন (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"নরওয়ে পরিকল্পনার সারাংশ","Total NAV period":"মোট NAV সময়কাল","Before birth":"জন্মের আগে","benefit days":"সুবিধা দিন","weeks":"সপ্তাহ","Unscheduled quota remaining":"অনির্ধারিত কোটা অবশিষ্ট আছে","Total days not yet assigned":"মোট দিন এখনও বরাদ্দ করা হয়নি","Your dated periods":"আপনার তারিখের সময়কাল","Parent":"অভিভাবক","Quota":"কোটা","Calendar dates":"ক্যালেন্ডার তারিখ","Withdrawal":"প্রত্যাহার","Benefit days used":"বেনিফিট দিন ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"বাকী কোটা এবং ক্যালেন্ডার দেখতে তারিখ যুক্ত করুন।","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"ইভেন্টের বিশদ বিবরণ চয়ন করুন এবং আপনি তুলনা করতে চান এমন কোনো সময়কাল যোগ করুন।","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"এই ডিভাইসে প্ল্যান চেক করা হয়েছে। NAV ব্যক্তিগত অধিকার নির্ধারণ করে।","Period added to the plan.":"পিরিয়ড প্ল্যানে যোগ করা হয়েছে।","Period removed.":"পিরিয়ড সরানো হয়েছে।","Plan cleared.":"প্ল্যান সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Calendar file created on this device.":"এই ডিভাইসে ক্যালেন্ডার ফাইল তৈরি করা হয়েছে।","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"তারিখ, অভিভাবক, কোটা এবং প্রত্যাহারের শতাংশ পর্যালোচনা করুন।","Compare the two coverage choices":"দুটি কভারেজ পছন্দ তুলনা করুন","Total period":"মোট সময়কাল","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"কভারেজ পছন্দ উভয় পিতামাতার জন্য একই এবং পরে পরিবর্তন করা যাবে না। পরিসংখ্যান সময়কালের দৈর্ঘ্য, একটি পেআউট অনুমান নয়।","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"আপনার এন্ট্রিগুলি এই ব্রাউজার ট্যাবে থাকে৷ আপনি যখন ডাউনলোড চয়ন করেন তখন স্থানীয়ভাবে ক্যালেন্ডার রপ্তানি তৈরি হয়৷","Assumptions used":"অনুমান ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"সুবিধা দিনগুলি সোমবার থেকে শুক্রবার গণনা করা হয়; সরকারী ছুটির দিনগুলি আলাদাভাবে বাদ দেওয়া হয় না।","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"একটি আংশিক-প্রত্যাহার শতাংশের মডেল একটি দীর্ঘ সময়সূচী এবং কম সুবিধা-দিনের ব্যবহার। নিয়োগকর্তার সাথে প্রকৃত কাজের শতাংশের সাথে সম্মত হন এবং NAV চেক করুন।","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"এই স্ট্যান্ডার্ড প্ল্যানারে সম্মিলিত যুগপত প্রত্যাহার 100% পর্যন্ত সীমাবদ্ধ; বিশেষ একাধিক-জন্ম ব্যতিক্রম এই চেকের বাইরে।","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV পিরিয়ডগুলি সাধারণত শিশুর বয়স তিন বছর হওয়ার আগে বা দত্তক নেওয়ার জন্য যত্ন স্থানান্তরের তিন বছরের মধ্যে ব্যবহার করতে হবে।","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · পিতামাতার সুবিধার নিয়ম এবং পিরিয়ড টেবিল","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · জাতীয় বীমা মৌলিক পরিমাণ (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · অফিসিয়াল প্যারেন্টাল বেনিফিট প্ল্যানার","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"এই পরিকল্পনাকারীর বাইরের ক্ষেত্রে NAV নির্দেশিকা খুলুন","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"এই ইভেন্টের তারিখটি এখানে অন্তর্ভুক্ত তারিখের NAV টেবিলের বাইরে। প্রযোজ্য নিয়ম সংস্করণের জন্য NAV নির্দেশিকা খুলুন।","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"এই সংস্করণটি আদর্শ ক্ষেত্রে মডেল করে যেখানে পিতামাতা উভয়ই একটি অধিকার অর্জন করেছেন। অন্যান্য পারিবারিক পরিস্থিতির জন্য NAV ব্যবহার করুন।","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"পৃষ্ঠার ভাষা পরিবর্তন করলে কি নিয়ম পরিবর্তন হয়?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"না। ইন্টারফেসটি বিভিন্ন ভাষায় পড়া যায়, তবে এই পরিকল্পনাকারী সর্বদা উল্লিখিত নরওয়েজিয়ান NAV পিরিয়ড টেবিল প্রয়োগ করে।","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"এটি কি আমাকে বলে যে NAV আমার দাবি অনুমোদন করবে কিনা?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"না। যোগ্যতা এবং অর্থ প্রদান আপনার ব্যক্তিগত রেকর্ড থেকে NAV দ্বারা নির্ধারিত হয়। এই পরিকল্পনাকারী শুধুমাত্র স্ট্যান্ডার্ড পিরিয়ড সারণী এবং আপনার প্রবেশ করা তারিখগুলির তুলনা করে।","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"বাবা-মা উভয়েই কি একই সময়ে সুবিধা নিতে পারেন?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"কিছু ব্যবস্থা ওভারল্যাপ করতে পারে, কিন্তু স্ট্যান্ডার্ড প্ল্যানার যৌথ প্রত্যাহারকে 100% পর্যন্ত সীমাবদ্ধ করে। বিশেষ বহু-জন্ম এবং অন্যান্য ব্যতিক্রমগুলি অবশ্যই NAV দিয়ে চেক করতে হবে।"},"ca":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Planificador d'excedències i prestacions parentals de Noruega","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Planificador de permís parental de Noruega 2026 — Setmanes, quotes i calendari","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planifica les setmanes de benefici parental noruecs per al naixement o l'adopció. Compareu la cobertura 80% i 100%, assigneu les quotes de cada pare, programeu les vacances parcials i exporteu un fitxer de calendari privat.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Un pràctic planificador noruec de beneficis parentals per a famílies que compara dates, quotes i temps fora de la feina. Trieu un idioma per a la interfície; les regles següents segueixen sent les normes NAV de Noruega.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"S'executa en aquest dispositiu. Les dates i els detalls del pla familiar no s'envien a un servidor ni es guarden amb aquesta eina.","Example":"Exemple","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Per a un nen nascut a1novembre2026, el període de NAV estàndard quan els dos progenitors compleixen els requisits49setmanes a les100% o61setmanes i1dia a les80%. El80% d'elecció generalment distribueix els pagaments durant més temps; NAV diu que el pagament total és aproximadament igual.","How the planner works":"Com funciona el planificador","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Primer compareu la taula de períodes oficial per a la data de l'esdeveniment seleccionat, el tipus d'esdeveniment, el nombre de nens i la cobertura. A continuació, afegiu els vostres propis períodes de baixa datats. Els dies laborables consumeixen dies de benefici; la retirada parcial redueix els dies utilitzats per dia feiner i amplia el calendari. Els buits poden representar feina o vacances sense la retirada de beneficis.","Common questions":"Preguntes habituals","Scope and limits":"Àmbit i límits","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Només a Noruega. Es tracta d'una ajuda de planificació, no d'una decisió d'elegibilitat, càlcul de pagament de beneficis, determinació de drets d'excedència de l'empresari o sol·licitud de NAV. La taula estàndard suposa que els dos pares s'han guanyat un dret. Les regles d'activitat, els casos monoparentals, el part precoç, la malaltia, les excepcions de permís simultània, la coordinació transfronterera i els càlculs individualitzats d'ingressos poden modificar el resultat; comproveu NAV en aquests casos.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Només regles noruegues · Taula de períodes NAV verificada 17 Octubre 2026 · L'idioma no canvia el país ni les regles.","Family event":"Esdeveniment familiar","Birth":"Naixement","Adoption":"Adopció","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Data prevista de naixement o de transferència d'atenció","Number of children":"Nombre de nens","One child":"Un fill","Two children":"Dos fills","Three or more children":"Tres o més nens","Coverage choice":"Elecció de cobertura","100% coverage":"100% de cobertura","80% coverage":"80% de cobertura","Add a leave period":"Afegiu un període de baixa","Parent taking leave":"Pares prenent permís","Mother":"Mare","Other parent":"Un altre pare","Benefit quota used":"Quota de beneficis utilitzada","Prenatal quota":"Quota prenatal","Mother quota":"Quota mare","Other-parent quota":"Quota d'altres pares","Shared period":"Període compartit","First date":"Primera data","Last date":"Última data","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Retirada del benefici, %","Calendar label":"Etiqueta del calendari","Add period to plan":"Afegir un període al pla","Remove":"Eliminar","Check plan":"Comprovar el pla","Clear plan":"Pla clar","Download calendar (.ics)":"Baixa el calendari (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Resum del pla de Noruega","Total NAV period":"Període NAV total","Before birth":"Abans del naixement","benefit days":"dies de benefici","weeks":"setmanes","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Quota no programada restant","Total days not yet assigned":"Total de dies encara no assignats","Your dated periods":"Els vostres períodes amb data","Parent":"Pare","Quota":"Quota","Calendar dates":"Dates del calendari","Withdrawal":"Retirada","Benefit days used":"Dies de benefici utilitzats","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Afegiu períodes datats per veure la quota i el calendari restants.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Trieu els detalls de l'esdeveniment i afegiu els períodes que vulgueu comparar.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan comprovat en aquest dispositiu. NAV decideix els drets individuals.","Period added to the plan.":"Període afegit al pla.","Period removed.":"Període eliminat.","Plan cleared.":"Pla esborrat.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Fitxer de calendari creat en aquest dispositiu.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Reviseu les dates, els pares, la quota i els percentatges de retirada.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Compareu les dues opcions de cobertura","Total period":"Període total","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"L'opció de cobertura és la mateixa per als dos pares i no es pot canviar més endavant. Les xifres són períodes, no una estimació de pagament.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Les teves entrades es mantenen en aquesta pestanya del navegador. L'exportació del calendari es crea localment quan trieu Baixa.","Assumptions used":"Hipotecs utilitzats","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Els dies de benefici es compten de dilluns a divendres; no s'exclouen per separat els dies festius.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Un percentatge de retirada parcial modela un horari més llarg i un ús reduït de dies de benefici. Acordeu el percentatge de treball real amb l'empresari i comproveu el NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"La retirada simultània combinada està limitada a 100% en aquest planificador estàndard; les excepcions especials de naixement múltiple estan fora d'aquest control.\nEls períodes","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV normalment s'han d'utilitzar abans que el nen compleixi tres anys, o dins dels tres anys posteriors a la transferència de la cura per a l'adopció.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · regles de beneficis parentals i taules de períodes","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Import bàsic de l'assegurança nacional (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · planificador oficial de beneficis parentals","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Obrir la guia NAV per a casos fora d'aquest planificador","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Aquesta data d'esdeveniment està fora de les taules NAV datades que s'inclouen aquí. Obriu la guia NAV per a la versió de la regla aplicable.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Aquesta versió modela el cas estàndard en què els dos pares s'han guanyat un dret. Utilitzeu NAV per a altres situacions familiars.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Canviar l'idioma de la pàgina canvia les regles?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Núm. La interfície es pot llegir en diferents idiomes, però aquest planificador sempre aplica la taula de períodes NAV noruec indicada.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Això em diu si NAV aprovarà la meva reclamació?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Núm. L'elegibilitat i el pagament els decideix NAV a partir dels vostres registres individuals. Aquest planificador només compara la taula de períodes estàndard i les dates que introduïu.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Poden els dos pares rebre beneficis al mateix temps?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Alguns arranjaments es poden solapar, però el planificador estàndard limita la retirada combinada a 100%. Les excepcions especials de part múltiple i altres s'han de comprovar amb NAV."},"de":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norwegen Elterngeld- und Urlaubsplaner","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norwegen-Elternurlaubsplaner 2026 – Wochen, Kontingente und Kalender","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planen Sie norwegische Elterngeldwochen für Geburt oder Adoption. Vergleichen Sie die Abdeckung von 80 % und 100 %, weisen Sie die Quoten jedes Elternteils zu, planen Sie Teilurlaub und exportieren Sie eine private Kalenderdatei.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Ein praktischer norwegischer Elterngeldplaner für Familien, der Termine, Quoten und Abwesenheitszeiten vergleicht. Wählen Sie eine Sprache für die Benutzeroberfläche. Die nachstehenden Regeln bleiben die norwegischen NAV-Regeln.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Läuft auf diesem Gerät. Daten und Details zum Familienplan werden von diesem Tool nicht an einen Server gesendet oder gespeichert.","Example":"Beispiel","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Für ein Kind, das am 1 November 2026 geboren wurde, beträgt der Standard-NAV-Zeitraum, in dem beide Elternteile Anspruch haben, 49 Wochen bei 100 % oder 61 Wochen und 1 Tag bei 80 %. Die Option 80% verteilt Zahlungen im Allgemeinen über einen längeren Zeitraum. Laut NAV ist die Gesamtzahlung ungefähr gleich.","How the planner works":"So funktioniert der Planer","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Vergleichen Sie zunächst die offizielle Periodentabelle für das ausgewählte Veranstaltungsdatum, die Veranstaltungsart, die Anzahl der Kinder und die Abdeckung. Fügen Sie dann Ihre eigenen datierten Urlaubszeiträume hinzu. Wochentage verbrauchen Leistungstage; Durch die Teilentnahme werden die genutzten Tage pro Wochentag reduziert und der Kalender verlängert. Lücken können Arbeit oder Urlaub ohne Leistungsbezug darstellen.","Common questions":"Häufige Fragen","Scope and limits":"Umfang und Grenzen","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Nur Norwegen. Hierbei handelt es sich um eine Planungshilfe, nicht um eine Entscheidung über die Anspruchsberechtigung, keine Berechnung der Leistungszahlung, keine Bestimmung des Urlaubsanspruchs des Arbeitgebers oder keinen NAV-Antrag. Die Standardtabelle geht davon aus, dass beide Elternteile einen Anspruch erworben haben. Aktivitätsregeln, Alleinerziehende, Frühgeburt, Krankheit, gleichzeitige Urlaubsausnahmen, grenzüberschreitende Koordination und individuelle Einkommensberechnungen können das Ergebnis verändern; Überprüfen Sie den NAV für diese Fälle.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Nur norwegische Regeln · NAV-Periodentabelle überprüft 17 Oktober 2026 · Sprache ändert weder das Land noch die Regeln.","Family event":"Familienveranstaltung","Birth":"Geburt","Adoption":"Annahme","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Erwartetes Geburts- oder Pflegeübertragungsdatum","Number of children":"Anzahl der Kinder","One child":"Ein Kind","Two children":"Zwei Kinder","Three or more children":"Drei oder mehr Kinder","Coverage choice":"Abdeckungsauswahl","100% coverage":"100% Abdeckung","80% coverage":"80% Abdeckung","Add a leave period":"Fügen Sie einen Urlaubszeitraum hinzu","Parent taking leave":"Eltern nehmen Urlaub","Mother":"Mutter","Other parent":"Anderes übergeordnetes Element","Benefit quota used":"Leistungskontingent verwendet","Prenatal quota":"Pränatale Quote","Mother quota":"Mutterkontingent","Other-parent quota":"Kontingent für andere übergeordnete Elemente","Shared period":"Gemeinsamer Zeitraum","First date":"Erstes Date","Last date":"Letztes Datum","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Leistungsbezug, %","Calendar label":"Kalenderetikett","Add period to plan":"Zeitraum zum Plan hinzufügen","Remove":"Entfernen","Check plan":"Plan prüfen","Clear plan":"Klarer Plan","Download calendar (.ics)":"Kalender herunterladen (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Zusammenfassung des Plans für Norwegen","Total NAV period":"Gesamt-NAV-Zeitraum","Before birth":"Vor der Geburt","benefit days":"Leistungstage","weeks":"Wochen","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Ungeplantes Kontingent verbleibt","Total days not yet assigned":"Gesamtzahl der Tage noch nicht zugewiesen","Your dated periods":"Ihre Datumsperioden","Parent":"Übergeordnet","Quota":"Kontingent","Calendar dates":"Kalenderdaten","Withdrawal":"Rückzug","Benefit days used":"Genutzte Leistungstage","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Fügen Sie datierte Zeiträume hinzu, um das verbleibende Kontingent und den Kalender anzuzeigen.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Wählen Sie die Ereignisdetails aus und fügen Sie alle Zeiträume hinzu, die Sie vergleichen möchten.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan auf diesem Gerät überprüft. NAV entscheidet über individuelle Rechte.","Period added to the plan.":"Zeitraum zum Plan hinzugefügt.","Period removed.":"Zeitraum entfernt.","Plan cleared.":"Plan gelöscht.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Kalenderdatei auf diesem Gerät erstellt.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Überprüfen Sie die Daten, Eltern-, Kontingent- und Auszahlungsprozentsätze.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Vergleichen Sie die beiden Abdeckungsoptionen","Total period":"Gesamtzeitraum","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Die Deckungsauswahl ist für beide Eltern gleich und kann später nicht geändert werden. Bei den Zahlen handelt es sich um Periodenlängen und nicht um eine Auszahlungsschätzung.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Ihre Einträge bleiben in diesem Browser-Tab. Der Kalenderexport wird lokal erstellt, wenn Sie „Herunterladen“ wählen.","Assumptions used":"Verwendete Annahmen","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Leistungstage werden von Montag bis Freitag gezählt; Feiertage sind nicht gesondert ausgeschlossen.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Ein teilweiser Entzugsprozentsatz modelliert einen längeren Zeitplan und eine reduzierte Nutzung am Leistungstag. Vereinbaren Sie den tatsächlichen Arbeitsanteil mit dem Arbeitgeber und überprüfen Sie den Nettoinventarwert.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Die kombinierte gleichzeitige Auszahlung ist in diesem Standardplaner auf 100 % beschränkt; Besondere Ausnahmen bei Mehrlingsgeburten fallen nicht unter diese Prüfung.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV-Zeiträume müssen normalerweise genutzt werden, bevor das Kind drei Jahre alt wird, oder innerhalb von drei Jahren nach der Übernahme der Pflege zur Adoption.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · Elterngeldregeln und Periodentabellen","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Grundbetrag der Sozialversicherung (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · offizieller Elterngeldplaner","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Öffnen Sie die NAV-Anleitung für Fälle außerhalb dieses Planers","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Dieses Ereignisdatum liegt außerhalb der hier enthaltenen datierten NAV-Tabellen. Öffnen Sie die NAV-Anleitung für die entsprechende Regelversion.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Diese Version modelliert den Standardfall, in dem beide Elternteile ein Recht erworben haben. Nutzen Sie NAV für andere Familiensituationen.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Ändert das Ändern der Seitensprache die Regeln?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No. Die Benutzeroberfläche kann in verschiedenen Sprachen gelesen werden, dieser Planer verwendet jedoch immer die angegebene norwegische NAV-Periodentabelle.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Erzählt mir das, ob NAV meinen Anspruch genehmigen wird?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Nr. Über die Berechtigung und Zahlung entscheidet der NAV anhand Ihrer individuellen Unterlagen. Dieser Planer vergleicht nur die Standard-Periodentabelle und die von Ihnen eingegebenen Daten.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Können beide Elternteile gleichzeitig Leistungen beziehen?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Einige Vereinbarungen können sich überschneiden, aber der Standardplaner begrenzt die kombinierte Auszahlung auf 100 %. Spezielle Mehrlingsgeburten und andere Ausnahmen müssen mit NAV abgeklärt werden."},"el":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Σχεδιαστής γονικών παροχών και αδειών Νορβηγίας","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Σχεδιασμός γονικής άδειας Νορβηγίας 2026 — Εβδομάδες, ποσοστώσεις και ημερολόγιο","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Σχεδιάστε Νορβηγικές εβδομάδες γονικών παροχών για γέννηση ή υιοθεσία. Συγκρίνετε την κάλυψη 80% και 100%, εκχωρήστε τις ποσοστώσεις κάθε γονέα, προγραμματίστε μερική άδεια και εξάγετε ένα ιδιωτικό αρχείο ημερολογίου.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Ένας πρακτικός νορβηγικός προγραμματιστής γονικών παροχών για οικογένειες που συγκρίνει ημερομηνίες, ποσοστώσεις και χρόνο μακριά από την εργασία. Επιλέξτε μια γλώσσα για τη διεπαφή. οι παρακάτω κανόνες παραμένουν οι νορβηγικοί κανόνες NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Εκτελείται σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. Οι ημερομηνίες και οι λεπτομέρειες του οικογενειακού προγράμματος δεν αποστέλλονται σε διακομιστή ούτε αποθηκεύονται από αυτό το εργαλείο.","Example":"Παράδειγμα","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Για ένα παιδί που γεννήθηκε στις 1 Νοεμβρίου 2026, η τυπική περίοδος NAV όταν πληρούν τις προϋποθέσεις και οι δύο γονείς είναι 49 εβδομάδες σε 100% ή 61 εβδομάδες και 1 ημέρα σε 80%. Η επιλογή 80% γενικά κατανέμει τις πληρωμές σε μεγαλύτερο χρονικό διάστημα. Η NAV λέει ότι η συνολική πληρωμή είναι περίπου ίση.","How the planner works":"Πώς λειτουργεί ο σχεδιαστής","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Συγκρίνετε πρώτα τον επίσημο πίνακα περιόδου για την επιλεγμένη ημερομηνία εκδήλωσης, τον τύπο της εκδήλωσης, τον αριθμό των παιδιών και την κάλυψη. Στη συνέχεια, προσθέστε τις δικές σας χρονολογημένες περιόδους άδειας. Οι καθημερινές καταναλώνουν ημέρες οφέλους. Η μερική απόσυρση μειώνει τις ημέρες που χρησιμοποιούνται ανά εβδομάδα και επεκτείνει το ημερολόγιο. Τα κενά μπορεί να αντιπροσωπεύουν εργασία ή διακοπές χωρίς απόσυρση παροχών.","Common questions":"Συνήθεις ερωτήσεις","Scope and limits":"Εύρος και όρια","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Μόνο Νορβηγία. Πρόκειται για ενίσχυση προγραμματισμού, όχι για απόφαση επιλεξιμότητας, για υπολογισμό παροχών-πληρωμών, για προσδιορισμό δικαιωμάτων άδειας εργοδότη ή αίτηση ΚΑΕ. Ο τυπικός πίνακας υποθέτει ότι και οι δύο γονείς έχουν κερδίσει ένα δικαίωμα. Κανόνες δραστηριότητας, μονογονεϊκές περιπτώσεις, πρόωρη γέννηση, ασθένεια, εξαιρέσεις ταυτόχρονης άδειας, διασυνοριακός συντονισμός και εξατομικευμένοι υπολογισμοί εισοδήματος μπορούν να αλλάξουν το αποτέλεσμα. ελέγξτε το NAV για αυτές τις περιπτώσεις.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Μόνο για νορβηγικούς κανόνες · Ο πίνακας περιόδου NAV ελέγχθηκε 17 Οκτώβριος 2026 · η γλώσσα δεν αλλάζει τη χώρα ή τους κανόνες.","Family event":"Οικογενειακή εκδήλωση","Birth":"Γέννηση","Adoption":"Υιοθεσία","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Αναμενόμενη ημερομηνία γέννησης ή μεταφοράς φροντίδας","Number of children":"Αριθμός παιδιών","One child":"Ένα παιδί","Two children":"Δύο παιδιά","Three or more children":"Τρία ή περισσότερα παιδιά","Coverage choice":"Επιλογή κάλυψης","100% coverage":"100% κάλυψη","80% coverage":"80% κάλυψη","Add a leave period":"Προσθέστε μια περίοδο άδειας","Parent taking leave":"Γονέας που παίρνει άδεια","Mother":"Μητέρα","Other parent":"Άλλος γονέας","Benefit quota used":"Χρησιμοποιήθηκε το όριο παροχών","Prenatal quota":"Προγεννητικό όριο","Mother quota":"Μητέρα ποσόστωση","Other-parent quota":"Ποσόστωση άλλου γονέα","Shared period":"Κοινή περίοδος","First date":"Πρώτο ραντεβού","Last date":"Τελευταία ημερομηνία","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Ανάληψη οφέλους, %","Calendar label":"Ετικέτα ημερολογίου","Add period to plan":"Προσθήκη περιόδου στο σχέδιο","Remove":"Αφαίρεση","Check plan":"Ελέγξτε το σχέδιο","Clear plan":"Σαφές σχέδιο","Download calendar (.ics)":"Λήψη ημερολογίου (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Σύνοψη σχεδίου Νορβηγίας","Total NAV period":"Συνολική περίοδος NAV","Before birth":"Πριν τη γέννηση","benefit days":"ημέρες οφέλους","weeks":"εβδομάδες","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Απομένει μη προγραμματισμένο όριο","Total days not yet assigned":"Συνολικές ημέρες δεν έχουν εκχωρηθεί ακόμη","Your dated periods":"Οι χρονολογημένες περίοδοι σας","Parent":"Γονικός","Quota":"Ποσοστ","Calendar dates":"Ημερομηνίες ημερολογίου","Withdrawal":"Ανάληψη","Benefit days used":"Χρησιμοποιούνται ημέρες οφέλους","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Προσθέστε χρονολογημένες περιόδους για να δείτε το υπόλοιπο όριο και το ημερολόγιο.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Επιλέξτε τις λεπτομέρειες του συμβάντος και προσθέστε τυχόν περιόδους που θέλετε να συγκρίνετε.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Το σχέδιο ελέγχθηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. Η NAV αποφασίζει τα ατομικά δικαιώματα.","Period added to the plan.":"Περίοδος προστέθηκε στο πρόγραμμα.","Period removed.":"Η περίοδος καταργήθηκε.","Plan cleared.":"Το σχέδιο εκκαθαρίστηκε.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Το αρχείο ημερολογίου δημιουργήθηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Ελέγξτε τις ημερομηνίες, γονικό, όριο και ποσοστά ανάληψης.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Συγκρίνετε τις δύο επιλογές κάλυψης","Total period":"Συνολική περίοδος","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Η επιλογή κάλυψης είναι ίδια και για τους δύο γονείς και δεν μπορεί να αλλάξει αργότερα. Τα στοιχεία είναι διάρκεια περιόδου και όχι εκτίμηση πληρωμών.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Οι καταχωρίσεις σας παραμένουν σε αυτήν την καρτέλα του προγράμματος περιήγησης. Η εξαγωγή ημερολογίου δημιουργείται τοπικά όταν επιλέγετε Λήψη.","Assumptions used":"Υποθέσεις που χρησιμοποιούνται","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Οι ημέρες ωφελημάτων υπολογίζονται από Δευτέρα έως Παρασκευή. δεν εξαιρούνται χωριστά οι επίσημες αργίες.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Ένα ποσοστό μερικής απόσυρσης μοντελοποιεί μεγαλύτερο χρονοδιάγραμμα και μειωμένη χρήση της ημέρας οφέλους. Συμφωνήστε το πραγματικό ποσοστό εργασίας με τον εργοδότη και ελέγξτε το NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Η συνδυασμένη ταυτόχρονη ανάληψη περιορίζεται σε 100% σε αυτόν τον τυπικό προγραμματιστή. Οι ειδικές εξαιρέσεις πολλαπλών γεννήσεων είναι εκτός αυτού του ελέγχου.\nΟι περίοδοι","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV πρέπει κανονικά να χρησιμοποιούνται πριν το παιδί κλείσει τα τρία ή εντός τριών ετών μετά τη μεταφορά φροντίδας για υιοθεσία.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · κανόνες γονικών παροχών και πίνακες περιόδου","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Βασικό ποσό Εθνικής Ασφάλισης (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · επίσημος προγραμματιστής γονικών παροχών","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Ανοίξτε την καθοδήγηση NAV για περιπτώσεις εκτός αυτού του προγράμματος σχεδιασμού","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Αυτή η ημερομηνία εκδήλωσης είναι εκτός των πίνακες με ημερομηνία NAV που περιλαμβάνονται εδώ. Ανοίξτε την καθοδήγηση NAV για την ισχύουσα έκδοση κανόνα.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Αυτή η έκδοση μοντελοποιεί την τυπική περίπτωση όπου και οι δύο γονείς έχουν κερδίσει ένα δικαίωμα. Χρησιμοποιήστε το NAV για άλλες οικογενειακές καταστάσεις.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Η αλλαγή της γλώσσας της σελίδας αλλάζει τους κανόνες;","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Αρ. Η διεπαφή μπορεί να διαβαστεί σε διαφορετικές γλώσσες, αλλά αυτό το πρόγραμμα σχεδιασμού εφαρμόζει πάντα τον δηλωμένο πίνακα περιόδου NAV της Νορβηγίας.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Μου λέει αυτό αν η NAV θα εγκρίνει την αξίωσή μου;","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Αρ. Η καταλληλότητα και η πληρωμή αποφασίζονται από την NAV από τα ατομικά σας αρχεία. Αυτό το πρόγραμμα σχεδιασμού συγκρίνει μόνο τον τυπικό πίνακα περιόδου και τις ημερομηνίες που εισάγετε.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Μπορούν και οι δύο γονείς να επωφεληθούν ταυτόχρονα;","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Ορισμένες ρυθμίσεις μπορεί να αλληλεπικαλύπτονται, αλλά ο τυπικός προγραμματιστής περιορίζει τη συνδυασμένη ανάληψη σε 100%. Ειδικές εξαιρέσεις πολλαπλών γεννήσεων και άλλες εξαιρέσεις πρέπει να ελέγχονται με το NAV."},"es":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Planificador de licencias y prestaciones parentales de Noruega","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Planificador de licencia parental en Noruega 2026 — Semanas, cuotas y calendario","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planifique semanas noruegas de prestación parental por nacimiento o adopción. Compare la cobertura de 80% y 100%, asigne las cuotas de cada padre, programe licencias parciales y exporte un archivo de calendario privado.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Un práctico planificador noruego de prestaciones parentales para familias que compara fechas, cuotas y tiempo fuera del trabajo. Elija un idioma para la interfaz; Las reglas siguientes siguen siendo las reglas NAV noruegas.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Se ejecuta en este dispositivo. Esta herramienta no envía las fechas ni los detalles del plan familiar a un servidor ni los guarda.","Example":"Ejemplo","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Para un niño nacido en 1 noviembre 2026, el período NAV estándar cuando ambos padres califican es 49 semanas al 100% o 61 semanas y 1 días al 80%. La opción 80% generalmente distribuye los pagos a lo largo de un período más largo; NAV dice que el pago total es aproximadamente igual.","How the planner works":"Cómo funciona el planificador","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Primero compare la tabla de períodos oficial para la fecha del evento seleccionado, tipo de evento, número de niños y cobertura. Luego agregue sus propios períodos de licencia con fecha. Los días laborables consumen días de beneficios; El retiro parcial reduce los días utilizados por día laborable y amplía el calendario. Las brechas pueden representar trabajo o vacaciones sin retiro de beneficios.","Common questions":"Preguntas comunes","Scope and limits":"Alcance y límites","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Solo Noruega. Esta es una ayuda de planificación, no una decisión de elegibilidad, un cálculo de pago de beneficios, una determinación de los derechos de licencia del empleador o una solicitud de NAV. La tabla estándar supone que ambos padres se han ganado un derecho. Las normas de actividad, los casos monoparentales, los nacimientos prematuros, las enfermedades, las excepciones a las licencias simultáneas, la coordinación transfronteriza y el cálculo individualizado de los ingresos pueden cambiar el resultado; verifique NAV para esos casos.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Solo reglas noruegas · Tabla de períodos NAV verificada 17 Octubre 2026 · El idioma no cambia el país ni las reglas.","Family event":"Evento familiar","Birth":"Nacimiento","Adoption":"Adopción","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Fecha prevista de nacimiento o transferencia de cuidados","Number of children":"Número de niños","One child":"Un niño","Two children":"Dos niños","Three or more children":"Tres o más niños","Coverage choice":"Elección de cobertura","100% coverage":"100% de cobertura","80% coverage":"80% de cobertura","Add a leave period":"Agregar un período de licencia","Parent taking leave":"Padre tomando licencia","Mother":"Madre","Other parent":"Otro padre","Benefit quota used":"Cuota de beneficios utilizada","Prenatal quota":"Cuota prenatal","Mother quota":"Cuota materna","Other-parent quota":"Cuota de otros padres","Shared period":"Periodo compartido","First date":"Primera cita","Last date":"Última fecha","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Retiro de beneficios, %","Calendar label":"Etiqueta de calendario","Add period to plan":"Agregar período al plan","Remove":"Quitar","Check plan":"Consultar plan","Clear plan":"Plan claro","Download calendar (.ics)":"Descargar calendario (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Resumen del plan de Noruega","Total NAV period":"Periodo NAV total","Before birth":"Antes del nacimiento","benefit days":"días de beneficio","weeks":"semanas","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Cuota restante no programada","Total days not yet assigned":"Total de días aún no asignados","Your dated periods":"Tus períodos fechados","Parent":"Padre","Quota":"Cuota","Calendar dates":"Fechas del calendario","Withdrawal":"Retiro","Benefit days used":"Días de beneficio utilizados","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Agregue períodos con fecha para ver la cuota restante y el calendario.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Elija los detalles del evento y agregue los períodos que desee comparar.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan marcado en este dispositivo. NAV decide los derechos individuales.","Period added to the plan.":"Período agregado al plan.","Period removed.":"Período eliminado.","Plan cleared.":"Plan borrado.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Archivo de calendario creado en este dispositivo.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Revisar las fechas, matriz, cuota y porcentajes de retiro.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Compare las dos opciones de cobertura","Total period":"Periodo total","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"La elección de cobertura es la misma para ambos padres y no se puede cambiar más adelante. Las cifras son la duración de los períodos, no una estimación de pagos.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Sus entradas permanecen en esta pestaña del navegador. La exportación del calendario se crea localmente cuando elige Descargar.","Assumptions used":"Supuestos utilizados","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Los días de beneficio se cuentan de lunes a viernes; Los días festivos no se excluyen por separado.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Un porcentaje de retiro parcial modela un cronograma más largo y un uso reducido del día de beneficios. Acuerde el porcentaje de trabajo real con el empleador y verifique el NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"El retiro simultáneo combinado está limitado a 100% en este planificador estándar; Las excepciones especiales de nacimientos múltiples quedan fuera de este control.\nLos períodos","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV normalmente deben usarse antes de que el niño cumpla tres años, o dentro de los tres años posteriores a la transferencia del cuidado para adopción.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · reglas de prestaciones parentales y tablas de períodos","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Importe básico de la Seguridad Social (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · planificador oficial de prestaciones parentales","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Abrir guía NAV para casos fuera de este planificador","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"La fecha de este evento está fuera de las tablas NAV con fecha incluidas aquí. Abra la guía NAV para la versión de regla aplicable.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Esta versión modela el caso estándar en el que ambos padres se han ganado un derecho. Utilice NAV para otras situaciones familiares.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"¿Cambiar el idioma de la página cambia las reglas?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No. La interfaz se puede leer en diferentes idiomas, pero este planificador siempre aplica la tabla de períodos NAV noruego indicada.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"¿Esto me dice si NAV aprobará mi reclamo?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"No. El NAV decide la elegibilidad y el pago a partir de sus registros individuales. Este planificador solo compara la tabla de períodos estándar y las fechas que ingresa.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"¿Pueden ambos padres recibir beneficios al mismo tiempo?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Algunos acuerdos pueden superponerse, pero el planificador estándar limita el retiro combinado a 100%. Las excepciones especiales por nacimiento múltiple y otras excepciones deben consultarse con NAV."},"fa":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"برنامه ریز مزایای والدین و مرخصی نروژ","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"برنامه ریز مرخصی والدین نروژ 2026 — هفته ها، سهمیه ها و تقویم","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"برای تولد یا فرزندخواندگی هفته های حمایت از والدین نروژی را برنامه ریزی کنید. پوشش 80٪ و 100٪ را مقایسه کنید، سهمیه های هر یک از والدین را تعیین کنید، مرخصی جزئی را برنامه ریزی کنید و یک فایل تقویم خصوصی را صادر کنید.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"یک برنامه ریز عملی نروژی برای مزایای والدین برای خانواده هایی که تاریخ ها، سهمیه ها و زمان دوری از کار را مقایسه می کنند. یک زبان برای رابط انتخاب کنید. قوانین زیر قوانین NAV نروژی باقی می مانند.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"روی این دستگاه اجرا می شود. تاریخ ها و جزئیات طرح خانواده به سرور ارسال نمی شود یا توسط این ابزار ذخیره نمی شود.","Example":"مثال","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"برای یک کودک متولد شده در 1 نوامبر 2026، دوره استاندارد NAV که هر دو والدین واجد شرایط هستند، 49 هفته در 100٪ یا 61 هفته و 1 روز در 80 است. انتخاب 80% به طور کلی پرداخت ها را در مدت زمان طولانی تری پخش می کند. NAV می گوید کل پرداخت تقریباً برابر است.","How the planner works":"نحوه کار برنامه ریز","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"ابتدا جدول دوره رسمی را برای تاریخ رویداد انتخابی، نوع رویداد، تعداد فرزندان و پوشش مقایسه کنید. سپس دوره های مرخصی تاریخی خود را اضافه کنید. روزهای هفته، روزهای سودمند را مصرف می کنند. برداشت نسبی، روزهای استفاده شده در هفته را کاهش می دهد و تقویم را افزایش می دهد. شکاف ها می توانند نشان دهنده کار یا تعطیلات بدون برداشت مزایا باشند.","Common questions":"سوالات رایج","Scope and limits":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"فقط نروژ. این یک کمک برنامه ریزی است، نه یک تصمیم واجد شرایط بودن، محاسبه مزایا-پرداخت، تعیین حقوق مرخصی کارفرما یا درخواست NAV. جدول استاندارد فرض می کند که هر دو والدین حقی را به دست آورده اند. قوانین فعالیت، موارد تک‌والدین، تولد زودرس، بیماری، استثنائات مرخصی همزمان، هماهنگی فرامرزی و محاسبه درآمد فردی می‌تواند نتیجه را تغییر دهد. NAV را برای آن موارد بررسی کنید.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"فقط قوانین نروژی · جدول دوره NAV بررسی شد 17 اکتبر 2026 · زبان کشور یا قوانین را تغییر نمی دهد.","Family event":"رویداد خانوادگی","Birth":"تولد","Adoption":"پذیرش","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"تاریخ مورد انتظار تولد یا انتقال مراقبت","Number of children":"تعداد فرزندان","One child":"یک فرزند","Two children":"دو فرزند","Three or more children":"سه فرزند یا بیشتر","Coverage choice":"انتخاب پوشش","100% coverage":"100% پوشش","80% coverage":"80% پوشش","Add a leave period":"یک دوره مرخصی اضافه کنید","Parent taking leave":"والدین در حال مرخصی","Mother":"مادر","Other parent":"والدین دیگر","Benefit quota used":"سهمیه سود استفاده شده","Prenatal quota":"سهمیه قبل از تولد","Mother quota":"سهمیه مادر","Other-parent quota":"سهمیه پدر و مادر دیگر","Shared period":"دوره مشترک","First date":"اولین تاریخ","Last date":"آخرین تاریخ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"برداشت سود، %","Calendar label":"برچسب تقویم","Add period to plan":"دوره را به برنامه اضافه کنید","Remove":"حذف","Check plan":"بررسی طرح","Clear plan":"پلان واضح","Download calendar (.ics)":"دانلود تقویم (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"خلاصه طرح نروژ","Total NAV period":"دوره کل NAV","Before birth":"قبل از تولد","benefit days":"روزهای سود","weeks":"هفته","Unscheduled quota remaining":"سهمیه برنامه ریزی نشده باقی مانده است","Total days not yet assigned":"مجموع روزهای تعیین نشده است","Your dated periods":"دوره های تاریخی شما","Parent":"والد","Quota":"سهمیه","Calendar dates":"تاریخ تقویم","Withdrawal":"انصراف","Benefit days used":"روزهای سود استفاده شده","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"دوره های تاریخ را اضافه کنید تا سهمیه و تقویم باقیمانده را ببینید.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"جزئیات رویداد را انتخاب کنید و دوره هایی را که می خواهید مقایسه کنید اضافه کنید.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"برنامه در این دستگاه بررسی شد. NAV حقوق فردی را تعیین می کند.","Period added to the plan.":"دوره اضافه شده به طرح.","Period removed.":"دوره حذف شد.","Plan cleared.":"طرح پاک شد.","Calendar file created on this device.":"فایل تقویم در این دستگاه ایجاد شده است.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"تاریخ، والدین، سهمیه و درصد برداشت را مرور کنید.","Compare the two coverage choices":"دو انتخاب پوشش را مقایسه کنید","Total period":"دوره کل","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"انتخاب پوشش برای هر دو والدین یکسان است و بعداً قابل تغییر نیست. ارقام طول دوره هستند، نه تخمین پرداخت.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"ورودی های شما در این برگه مرورگر باقی می مانند. با انتخاب دانلود، صادرات تقویم به صورت محلی ایجاد می شود.","Assumptions used":"فرض های مورد استفاده","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"روزهای سود از دوشنبه تا جمعه محاسبه می‌شود. تعطیلات رسمی به طور جداگانه مستثنی نیستند.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"درصد برداشت جزئی برنامه‌ریزی طولانی‌تر و کاهش استفاده در روز سود را مدل‌سازی می‌کند. درصد واقعی کار را با کارفرما به توافق برسانید و NAV را بررسی کنید.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"برداشت همزمان ترکیبی به 100٪ در این برنامه‌ریز استاندارد محدود شده است. استثناهای ویژه چند قلویی خارج از این بررسی هستند.\nدوره‌های","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV معمولاً باید قبل از سه سالگی یا ظرف سه سال پس از انتقال مراقبت برای فرزندخواندگی استفاده شود.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · قوانین مزایای والدین و جداول دوره","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · مبلغ پایه بیمه ملی (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · برنامه ریز رسمی مزایای والدین","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"راهنمای NAV را برای موارد خارج از این برنامه‌ریز باز کنید","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"این تاریخ رویداد خارج از جداول NAV با تاریخ موجود در اینجا است. راهنمای NAV را برای نسخه قانون قابل اجرا باز کنید.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"این نسخه نمونه استانداردی است که هر دو والدین حقی را کسب کرده اند. از NAV برای سایر موقعیت های خانوادگی استفاده کنید.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"آیا تغییر زبان صفحه قوانین را تغییر می دهد؟","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"شماره. رابط را می توان به زبان های مختلف خواند، اما این برنامه ریز همیشه جدول دوره NAV نروژی را اعمال می کند.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"آیا این به من می گوید که آیا NAV ادعای من را تأیید می کند؟","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"شماره. واجد شرایط بودن و پرداخت توسط NAV از سوابق فردی شما تعیین می شود. این برنامه ریز فقط جدول دوره استاندارد و تاریخ هایی را که وارد می کنید مقایسه می کند.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"آیا هر دو والدین می توانند همزمان از مزایای استفاده کنند؟","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"برخی ترتیبات ممکن است همپوشانی داشته باشند، اما برنامه‌ریز استاندارد برداشت ترکیبی را به 100 محدود می‌کند. چند تولد خاص و سایر استثناها باید با NAV بررسی شوند."},"fr":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Planificateur de prestations parentales et de congés en Norvège","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Planificateur de congé parental en Norvège 2026 — Semaines, quotas et calendrier","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planifiez des semaines norvégiennes de prestations parentales en cas de naissance ou d'adoption. Comparez la couverture 80% et 100%, attribuez les quotas de chaque parent, planifiez un congé partiel et exportez un fichier de calendrier privé.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Un planificateur norvégien pratique d'allocations parentales pour les familles comparant les dates, les quotas et les heures d'absence du travail. Choisissez une langue pour l'interface ; les règles ci-dessous restent les règles norvégiennes de la NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"S'exécute sur cet appareil. Les dates et les détails du forfait familial ne sont pas envoyés à un serveur ni enregistrés par cet outil.","Example":"Exemple","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Pour un enfant né le 1 novembre 2026, la période NAV standard pendant laquelle les deux parents sont admissibles est de 49 semaines à 100% ou 61 semaines et 1 jour à 80%. Le choix 80% étale généralement les paiements sur une période plus longue ; NAV indique que le paiement total est à peu près égal.","How the planner works":"Fonctionnement du planificateur","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Comparez d'abord le tableau des périodes officiel pour la date de l'événement sélectionné, le type d'événement, le nombre d'enfants et la couverture. Ajoutez ensuite vos propres périodes de congés datées. Les jours de semaine consomment des jours de prestations ; le retrait partiel réduit les jours utilisés par jour de la semaine et allonge le calendrier. Les écarts peuvent représenter un travail ou des vacances sans retrait des prestations.","Common questions":"Questions courantes","Scope and limits":"Portée et limites","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Norvège uniquement. Il s’agit d’une aide à la planification et non d’une décision d’éligibilité, d’un calcul de prestations, d’une détermination des droits de congé de l’employeur ou d’une demande de NAV. Le tableau standard suppose que les deux parents ont acquis un droit. Les règles d'activité, les cas de monoparentalité, les naissances précoces, la maladie, les exceptions de congés simultanés, la coordination transfrontalière et le calcul individualisé des revenus peuvent changer le résultat ; vérifiez NAV pour ces cas.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Règles norvégiennes uniquement · Table de périodes NAV vérifiée 17 octobre 2026 · la langue ne modifie pas le pays ni les règles.","Family event":"Événement familial","Birth":"Naissance","Adoption":"Adoption","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Date prévue de naissance ou de transfert de soins","Number of children":"Nombre d'enfants","One child":"Un enfant","Two children":"Deux enfants","Three or more children":"Trois enfants ou plus","Coverage choice":"Choix de couverture","100% coverage":"100% de couverture","80% coverage":"80% de couverture","Add a leave period":"Ajouter une période de congé","Parent taking leave":"Parent taking leave","Mother":"Mère","Other parent":"Autre parent","Benefit quota used":"Benefit quota used","Prenatal quota":"Prenatal quota","Mother quota":"Quota mère","Other-parent quota":"Other-parent quota","Shared period":"Période partagée","First date":"Premier rendez-vous","Last date":"Dernière date","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Retrait des prestations, %","Calendar label":"Calendar label","Add period to plan":"Add period to plan","Remove":"Supprimer","Check plan":"Vérifier le plan","Clear plan":"Plan clair","Download calendar (.ics)":"Download calendar (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Norway plan summary","Total NAV period":"Total NAV period","Before birth":"Avant la naissance","benefit days":"journées de prestations","weeks":"semaines","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Quota non planifié restant","Total days not yet assigned":"Total days not yet assigned","Your dated periods":"Your dated periods","Parent":"Parent","Quota":"Quota","Calendar dates":"Calendar dates","Withdrawal":"Retrait","Benefit days used":"Benefit days used","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Ajoutez des périodes datées pour voir le quota et le calendrier restants.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Choisissez les détails de l'événement et ajoutez les périodes que vous souhaitez comparer.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan vérifié sur cet appareil. NAV décide des droits individuels.","Period added to the plan.":"Période ajoutée au plan.","Period removed.":"Période supprimée.","Plan cleared.":"Plan effacé.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Fichier de calendrier créé sur cet appareil.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Vérifiez les dates, le parent, le quota et les pourcentages de retrait.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Comparez les deux choix de couverture","Total period":"Période totale","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Le choix de couverture est le même pour les deux parents et ne peut être modifié ultérieurement. Les chiffres correspondent à des durées de période et non à une estimation des paiements.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Vos entrées restent dans cet onglet du navigateur. L'exportation du calendrier est créée localement lorsque vous choisissez Télécharger.","Assumptions used":"Hypothèses utilisées","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Les jours de prestations sont comptés du lundi au vendredi ; les jours fériés ne sont pas exclus séparément.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Un pourcentage de retrait partiel modélise un horaire plus long et une utilisation réduite des prestations. Convenez du pourcentage de travail réel avec l'employeur et vérifiez le NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Le retrait simultané combiné est limité à 100% dans ce planificateur standard ; les exceptions spéciales liées aux naissances multiples ne sont pas couvertes par ce contrôle.\nLes périodes","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV doivent normalement être utilisées avant que l'enfant n'atteigne l'âge de trois ans, ou dans les trois ans suivant le transfert des soins en vue d'une adoption.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · règles de prestations parentales et tableaux de règles","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Montant de base de l'Assurance Nationale (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · planificateur officiel des prestations parentales","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Guide NAV ouvert pour les tickets en dehors de ce planificateur","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"La date de cet événement se situe en dehors des tableaux NAV datés inclus ici. Ouvrir les instructions NAV pour la version de règle applicable.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Cette version modélise le cas standard dans lequel les deux parents ont acquis un droit. Utilisez NAV pour d’autres situations familiales.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"La modification de la langue de la page modifie-t-elle les règles ?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Non. L'interface peut être lue dans différentes langues, mais ce planificateur applique toujours le tableau des périodes Norwegian NAV indiqué.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Est-ce que cela m'indique si NAV approuvera ma demande ?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Non. L'éligibilité et le paiement sont décidés par NAV à partir de vos dossiers individuels. Ce planificateur compare uniquement le tableau de périodes standard et les dates que vous saisissez.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Les deux parents peuvent-ils percevoir des prestations en même temps ?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Certaines dispositions peuvent se chevaucher, mais le planificateur standard limite le retrait combiné à 100%. Les cas particuliers de naissances multiples et autres exceptions doivent être vérifiés auprès de NAV."},"gu":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"નોર્વે પેરેંટલ બેનિફિટ અને લીવ પ્લાનર","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"નોર્વે પેરેંટલ લીવ પ્લાનર 2026 — અઠવાડિયા, ક્વોટા અને કેલેન્ડર","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"જન્મ અથવા દત્તક લેવા માટે નોર્વેજીયન પેરેંટલ-બેનિફિટ અઠવાડિયાની યોજના બનાવો. 80% અને 100% કવરેજની તુલના કરો, દરેક માતાપિતાના ક્વોટા સોંપો, આંશિક રજા શેડ્યૂલ કરો અને ખાનગી કૅલેન્ડર ફાઇલની નિકાસ કરો.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"કામથી દૂર તારીખો, ક્વોટા અને સમયની તુલના કરતા પરિવારો માટે એક વ્યવહારુ નોર્વેજીયન પેરેંટલ-બેનિફિટ પ્લાનર. ઇન્ટરફેસ માટે ભાષા પસંદ કરો; નીચેના નિયમો નોર્વેજીયન NAV નિયમો રહે છે.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર ચાલે છે. તારીખો અને ફેમિલી-પ્લાન વિગતો સર્વર પર મોકલવામાં આવતી નથી અથવા આ સાધન દ્વારા સાચવવામાં આવતી નથી.","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"પર જન્મેલા એક બાળક માટે1નવેમ્બર2026, બંને માતા-પિતા લાયક હોય ત્યારે પ્રમાણભૂત NAV સમયગાળો છે49ખાતે અઠવાડિયા100% અથવા61અઠવાડિયા અને1દિવસે80%. આ80% પસંદગી સામાન્ય રીતે લાંબા સમય સુધી ચૂકવણીને ફેલાવે છે; NAV કહે છે કે કુલ ચુકવણી લગભગ સમાન છે.","How the planner works":"આયોજક કેવી રીતે કાર્ય કરે છે","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"પહેલા પસંદ કરેલ ઇવેન્ટની તારીખ, ઇવેન્ટનો પ્રકાર, બાળકોની સંખ્યા અને કવરેજ માટે અધિકૃત પીરિયડ ટેબલની તુલના કરો. પછી તમારી પોતાની તારીખની રજાના સમયગાળા ઉમેરો. અઠવાડિયાના દિવસો લાભના દિવસોનો વપરાશ કરે છે; આંશિક ઉપાડ દર અઠવાડિયે વપરાતા દિવસો ઘટાડે છે અને કૅલેન્ડર લંબાય છે. ગાબડા લાભ ઉપાડ વિના કામ અથવા વેકેશનનું પ્રતિનિધિત્વ કરી શકે છે.","Common questions":"સામાન્ય પ્રશ્નો","Scope and limits":"અવકાશ અને મર્યાદા","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"ફક્ત નોર્વે. આ એક આયોજન સહાય છે, યોગ્યતાનો નિર્ણય, લાભ-ચુકવણીની ગણતરી, એમ્પ્લોયર રજા-અધિકાર નિર્ધારણ અથવા NAV અરજી નથી. માનક કોષ્ટક ધારે છે કે બંને માતાપિતાએ અધિકાર મેળવ્યો છે. પ્રવૃત્તિના નિયમો, એક-માતા-પિતાના કિસ્સાઓ, પ્રારંભિક જન્મ, માંદગી, એક સાથે રજા અપવાદો, ક્રોસ-બોર્ડર સંકલન અને વ્યક્તિગત આવકની ગણતરીઓ પરિણામ બદલી શકે છે; તે કેસો માટે NAV તપાસો.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"ફક્ત નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો · NAV પીરિયડ ટેબલ ચેક કરેલ 17 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 · ભાષા દેશ અથવા નિયમોને બદલતી નથી.","Family event":"કૌટુંબિક ઇવેન્ટ","Birth":"જન્મ","Adoption":"એડોપ્શન","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"અપેક્ષિત જન્મ અથવા સંભાળ-ટ્રાન્સફર તારીખ","Number of children":"બાળકોની સંખ્યા","One child":"એક બાળક","Two children":"બે બાળકો","Three or more children":"ત્રણ કે તેથી વધુ બાળકો","Coverage choice":"કવરેજ પસંદગી","100% coverage":"100% કવરેજ","80% coverage":"80% કવરેજ","Add a leave period":"રજાનો સમયગાળો ઉમેરો","Parent taking leave":"માતા-પિતા રજા લઈ રહ્યા છે","Mother":"માતા","Other parent":"અન્ય માતાપિતા","Benefit quota used":"લાભનો ક્વોટા વપરાયો","Prenatal quota":"પ્રેનેટલ ક્વોટા","Mother quota":"મધર ક્વોટા","Other-parent quota":"અન્ય-પિતૃ ક્વોટા","Shared period":"શેર કરેલ સમયગાળો","First date":"પ્રથમ તારીખ","Last date":"છેલ્લી તારીખ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"લાભ ઉપાડ, %","Calendar label":"કૅલેન્ડર લેબલ","Add period to plan":"યોજનામાં સમયગાળો ઉમેરો","Remove":"દૂર કરો","Check plan":"પ્લાન તપાસો","Clear plan":"પ્લાન સાફ કરો","Download calendar (.ics)":"કેલેન્ડર ડાઉનલોડ કરો (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"નોર્વે પ્લાન સારાંશ","Total NAV period":"કુલ NAV અવધિ","Before birth":"જન્મ પહેલાં","benefit days":"લાભના દિવસો","weeks":"અઠવાડિયા","Unscheduled quota remaining":"અનુસૂચિત ક્વોટા બાકી છે","Total days not yet assigned":"કુલ દિવસો હજુ સુધી સોંપવામાં આવ્યા નથી","Your dated periods":"તમારા તારીખના સમયગાળા","Parent":"પિતૃ","Quota":"ક્વોટા","Calendar dates":"કેલેન્ડર તારીખો","Withdrawal":"ઉપસી","Benefit days used":"લાભના દિવસો વપરાયા","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"બાકીના ક્વોટા અને કૅલેન્ડર જોવા માટે તારીખના સમયગાળા ઉમેરો.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"ઇવેન્ટની વિગતો પસંદ કરો અને તમે જેની સરખામણી કરવા માંગો છો તે કોઈપણ સમયગાળા ઉમેરો.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર પ્લાન ચેક કર્યો. NAV વ્યક્તિગત અધિકારો નક્કી કરે છે.","Period added to the plan.":"પીરિયડ પ્લાનમાં ઉમેરાયો.","Period removed.":"કાળ દૂર કર્યો.","Plan cleared.":"પ્લાન ક્લિયર.","Calendar file created on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર કૅલેન્ડર ફાઇલ બનાવવામાં આવી છે.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"તારીખો, પિતૃ, ક્વોટા અને ઉપાડની ટકાવારીની સમીક્ષા કરો.","Compare the two coverage choices":"બે કવરેજ પસંદગીઓની સરખામણી કરો","Total period":"કુલ સમયગાળો","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"કવરેજ પસંદગી બંને માતાપિતા માટે સમાન છે અને પછીથી બદલી શકાશે નહીં. આંકડાઓ સમયગાળાની લંબાઈ છે, ચૂકવણીનો અંદાજ નથી.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"તમારી એન્ટ્રીઓ આ બ્રાઉઝર ટેબમાં રહે છે. જ્યારે તમે ડાઉનલોડ પસંદ કરો છો ત્યારે કેલેન્ડર નિકાસ સ્થાનિક રીતે બનાવવામાં આવે છે.","Assumptions used":"ઉપયોગી ધારણાઓ","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"લાભના દિવસો સોમવારથી શુક્રવાર ગણવામાં આવે છે; જાહેર રજાઓ અલગથી બાકાત નથી.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"આંશિક-ઉપાડની ટકાવારી મોડલ લાંબુ શેડ્યૂલ અને લાભ-દિવસનો ઉપયોગ ઘટાડે છે. એમ્પ્લોયર સાથે વાસ્તવિક કાર્ય ટકાવારી સાથે સંમત થાઓ અને NAV તપાસો.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"આ પ્રમાણભૂત પ્લાનરમાં સંયુક્ત એક સાથે ઉપાડ 100% સુધી મર્યાદિત છે; વિશેષ બહુવિધ-જન્મ અપવાદો આ તપાસની બહાર છે.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV પીરિયડ્સનો ઉપયોગ સામાન્ય રીતે બાળક ત્રણ વર્ષનો થાય તે પહેલાં અથવા દત્તક લેવા માટે કેર ટ્રાન્સફર પછી ત્રણ વર્ષની અંદર થવો જોઈએ.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · પેરેંટલ બેનિફિટ નિયમો અને પીરિયડ કોષ્ટકો","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · રાષ્ટ્રીય વીમા મૂળભૂત રકમ (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · અધિકૃત પેરેંટલ બેનિફિટ પ્લાનર","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"આ પ્લાનરની બહારના કેસ માટે NAV માર્ગદર્શન ખોલો","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"આ ઇવેન્ટની તારીખ અહીં સમાવિષ્ટ NAV કોષ્ટકોની બહારની છે. લાગુ પડતા નિયમ સંસ્કરણ માટે NAV માર્ગદર્શન ખોલો.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"આ સંસ્કરણ પ્રમાણભૂત કેસનું મોડેલ કરે છે જ્યાં બંને માતાપિતાએ અધિકાર મેળવ્યો હોય. અન્ય કૌટુંબિક પરિસ્થિતિઓ માટે NAV નો ઉપયોગ કરો.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"શું પૃષ્ઠની ભાષા બદલવાથી નિયમો બદલાય છે?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"નં. ઇન્ટરફેસ વિવિધ ભાષાઓમાં વાંચી શકાય છે, પરંતુ આ પ્લાનર હંમેશા જણાવેલ નોર્વેજીયન NAV પીરિયડ ટેબલ લાગુ કરે છે.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"શું આ મને જણાવે છે કે NAV મારા દાવાને મંજૂર કરશે કે કેમ?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"નં. પાત્રતા અને ચુકવણી તમારા વ્યક્તિગત રેકોર્ડમાંથી NAV દ્વારા નક્કી કરવામાં આવે છે. આ પ્લાનર માત્ર પ્રમાણભૂત પીરિયડ ટેબલ અને તમે દાખલ કરેલ તારીખોની તુલના કરે છે.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"શું બંને માતાપિતા એક જ સમયે લાભ લઈ શકે છે?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"કેટલીક વ્યવસ્થાઓ ઓવરલેપ થઈ શકે છે, પરંતુ પ્રમાણભૂત પ્લાનર સંયુક્ત ઉપાડને 100% સુધી મર્યાદિત કરે છે. વિશિષ્ટ બહુવિધ જન્મ અને અન્ય અપવાદો NAV સાથે તપાસવા આવશ્યક છે."},"ha":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Amfanin Iyaye na Norway da Mai Tsara Bari","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Mai Tsare Tsare Tsaren Iyaye na Norway 2026 - Makonni, Ƙidaya da Kalanda","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Shirya makonnin fa'idar iyaye na Norwegian don haihuwa ko ɗauka. Kwatanta 80% da 100% ɗaukar hoto, sanya adadin kowane iyaye, tsara jadawalin hutu da fitarwa fayil ɗin kalanda mai zaman kansa.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Mai tsara tsarin fa'ida na iyaye na ƙasar Norway don iyalai yana kwatanta kwanan wata, ƙayyadaddun ƙididdiga da lokaci daga aiki. Zaɓi harshe don dubawa; dokokin da ke ƙasa sun kasance dokokin NAV na Norwegian.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Yana gudana akan wannan na'urar. Ba a aika bayanan kwanan wata da bayanan tsarin iyali zuwa sabar ko adana ta wannan kayan aiki.","Example":"Misali","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Don yaro daya da aka haifa akan1Nuwamba2026, daidaitaccen lokacin NAV lokacin da iyaye biyu suka cancanta shine49makonni a100% ko61makonni da1rana a80%. The80% zabi gabaɗaya yana yada biyan kuɗi na tsawon lokaci; NAV ta ce jimlar biyan kusan daidai ne.","How the planner works":"Yadda mai tsarawa ke aiki","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Da farko kwatanta tebur na lokaci na ranar taron da aka zaɓa, nau'in taron, adadin yara da ɗaukar hoto. Sannan ƙara kwanakin hutun kwanan ku. Kwanakin mako suna cinye kwanakin fa'ida; janyewar wani ɓangare yana rage kwanakin da ake amfani da su a kowace rana ta mako kuma yana ƙara kalanda. Gaps na iya wakiltar aiki ko hutu ba tare da cire fa'ida ba.","Common questions":"Tambayoyi gama gari","Scope and limits":"Mai iyaka da iyaka","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Norway kawai. Wannan taimakon tsari ne, ba shawarar cancanta ba, lissafin biyan fa'ida, ƙayyadaddun haƙƙin haƙƙin ma'aikata ko aikace-aikacen NAV. Teburin ma'auni yana ɗauka duka iyaye biyu sun sami haƙƙi. Dokokin ayyuka, shari'o'in iyaye ɗaya, haihuwa da wuri, rashin lafiya, keɓantawar izinin lokaci guda, haɗin kan iyaka da lissafin kuɗin shiga na mutum ɗaya na iya canza sakamakon; duba NAV ga wadancan lokuta.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Dokokin Norway kawai · Teburin lokacin NAV da aka duba 17 Oktoba 2026 · harshe baya canza ƙasa ko ƙa'idodi.","Family event":"Wakilin iyali","Birth":"Haihuwa","Adoption":"Ɗaukaka","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Kwanan da aka sa ran haihuwa ko kulawa","Number of children":"Yawan yara","One child":"Yaro ɗaya","Two children":"Yara biyu","Three or more children":"Yara uku ko fiye","Coverage choice":"Zaɓin ɗaukar hoto","100% coverage":"100% ɗaukar hoto","80% coverage":"80% ɗaukar hoto","Add a leave period":"Ƙara lokacin hutu","Parent taking leave":"Iyaye shan hutu","Mother":"Uwa","Other parent":"Sauran iyaye","Benefit quota used":"Ƙidayar fa'ida da aka yi amfani da ita","Prenatal quota":"Yaɗin kai na haihuwa","Mother quota":"Yakin uwa","Other-parent quota":"Ƙidayar Iyaye","Shared period":"Lokacin rabawa","First date":"kwana ta farko","Last date":"Kwanan wata ta ƙarshe","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Cire fa'ida, %","Calendar label":"Tambarin Kalanda","Add period to plan":"Ƙara lokaci don tsarawa","Remove":"Cire","Check plan":"Duba shirin","Clear plan":"Tsarin Tsare-tsare","Download calendar (.ics)":"Zazzage kalanda (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Takaitacciyar shirin Norway","Total NAV period":"Jimlar lokacin NAV","Before birth":"Kafin haihuwa","benefit days":"kwanakin fa'ida","weeks":"makonni","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Ya rage adadin da ba a tsara ba","Total days not yet assigned":"Jimillar kwanaki har yanzu ba a sanya su ba","Your dated periods":"Lokacin kwanakin ku","Parent":"Iyaye","Quota":"Ƙidaya","Calendar dates":"Kwanakin kalanda","Withdrawal":"Janyewa","Benefit days used":"An yi amfani da kwanakin fa'ida","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Ƙara kwanakin kwanan wata don ganin ragowar adadin da kalanda.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Zaɓi cikakkun bayanan taron kuma ƙara kowane lokaci da kuke son kwatantawa.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"An duba shirin akan wannan na'urar. NAV tana yanke haƙƙoƙin mutum ɗaya.","Period added to the plan.":"Lokaci ƙara zuwa shirin.","Period removed.":"An cire lokaci.","Plan cleared.":"An share shirin.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Fayil ɗin Kalanda da aka ƙirƙira akan wannan na'urar.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Bita kwanakin, iyaye, kaso da kaso na cirewa.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Kwatanta zaɓin ɗaukar hoto guda biyu","Total period":"jimlar lokacin","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Zaɓin ɗaukar hoto iri ɗaya ne ga iyaye biyu kuma ba za a iya canzawa daga baya ba. Alkaluman tsayin lokaci ne, ba kimanta biya ba.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Ana ƙirƙira fitarwa na kalanda a gida lokacin da kuka zaɓi Zazzagewa.","Assumptions used":"Zato da aka yi amfani da su","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Ana ƙidaya kwanakin fa'ida daga Litinin zuwa Juma'a; Ba a keɓance bukukuwan jama'a daban-daban.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Ƙimar kashi-kashi na janyewar juzu'i mai tsayi mai tsayi da rage amfanin ranar fa'ida. Yarda da ainihin adadin aikin tare da mai aiki kuma duba NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Haɗin cirewar lokaci guda yana iyakance zuwa 100% a cikin wannan daidaitaccen mai tsarawa; keɓancewar haihuwa da yawa suna wajen wannan cak.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"Lokacin NAV dole ne a yi amfani da shi akai-akai kafin yaro ya cika shekaru uku, ko cikin shekaru uku bayan canja wurin kulawa don ɗauka.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · Dokokin fa'idar iyaye da jadawalin lokaci","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Asalin Inshorar Kasa (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · hukuma mai tsara fa'idar iyaye","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Buɗe jagorar NAV don lokuta wajen wannan mai tsarawa","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Wannan ranar taron baya bayan jadawalin NAV da aka haɗa a nan. Bude jagorar NAV don sigar ƙa'idar da ta dace.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Wannan sigar ta ƙirƙiri daidaitaccen yanayin inda iyaye biyu suka sami haƙƙi. Yi amfani da NAV don sauran yanayin iyali.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Shin canza yaren shafi yana canza dokoki?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No. Za a iya karanta keɓancewa a cikin yaruka daban-daban, amma wannan mai tsarawa koyaushe yana amfani da jadawalin lokacin NAV na Norwegian.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Wannan ya gaya mani ko NAV za ta amince da da'awata?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"A'a. NAV ce ta yanke cancanta da biyan kuɗi daga bayananku ɗaya. Wannan mai tsarawa kawai yana kwatanta daidaitaccen tebur na lokaci da kwanakin da kuka shigar.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Iyaye biyu za su iya cin moriyar lokaci guda?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Wasu shirye-shirye na iya haɗuwa, amma daidaitaccen mai tsarawa yana iyakance haɗakar cirewa zuwa 100%. Haihuwa na musamman da sauran keɓantawa dole ne a bincika tare da NAV."},"hi":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"नॉर्वे अभिभावकीय लाभ और अवकाश योजनाकार","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"नॉर्वे पेरेंटल लीव प्लानर 2026 — सप्ताह, कोटा और कैलेंडर","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"जन्म या गोद लेने के लिए नॉर्वेजियन अभिभावक-लाभ सप्ताह की योजना बनाएं। 80% और 100% कवरेज की तुलना करें, प्रत्येक माता-पिता का कोटा निर्दिष्ट करें, आंशिक छुट्टी शेड्यूल करें और एक निजी कैलेंडर फ़ाइल निर्यात करें।","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"दिनांक, कोटा और काम से दूर समय की तुलना करने वाले परिवारों के लिए एक व्यावहारिक नॉर्वेजियन अभिभावक-लाभ योजनाकार। इंटरफ़ेस के लिए एक भाषा चुनें; नीचे दिए गए नियम नॉर्वेजियन एनएवी नियम बने रहेंगे।","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"इस डिवाइस पर चलता है। दिनांक और परिवार-योजना विवरण किसी सर्वर पर नहीं भेजे जाते हैं या इस टूल द्वारा सहेजे नहीं जाते हैं।","Example":"उदाहरण","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"1 नवंबर 2026 को जन्म लेने वाले एक बच्चे के लिए, मानक NAV अवधि जब माता-पिता दोनों अर्हता प्राप्त करते हैं तो 100% पर 49 सप्ताह या 61 सप्ताह और 80% पर 1 दिन होता है। 80% विकल्प आम तौर पर भुगतान को लंबे समय तक फैलाता है; एनएवी का कहना है कि कुल भुगतान लगभग बराबर है।","How the planner works":"प्लानर कैसे काम करता है","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"पहले चयनित ईवेंट तिथि, ईवेंट प्रकार, बच्चों की संख्या और कवरेज के लिए आधिकारिक अवधि तालिका की तुलना करें। फिर अपनी दिनांकित अवकाश अवधि जोड़ें। सप्ताह के दिनों में लाभ के दिनों का उपभोग होता है; आंशिक निकासी से प्रति सप्ताह उपयोग किए जाने वाले दिन कम हो जाते हैं और कैलेंडर का विस्तार हो जाता है। अंतराल लाभ वापसी के बिना काम या छुट्टी का प्रतिनिधित्व कर सकता है।","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Scope and limits":"दायरा और सीमाएँ","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"केवल नॉर्वे। यह एक नियोजन सहायता है, पात्रता निर्णय, लाभ-भुगतान गणना, नियोक्ता अवकाश-अधिकार निर्धारण या एनएवी आवेदन नहीं। मानक तालिका मानती है कि माता-पिता दोनों ने अधिकार अर्जित किया है। गतिविधि नियम, एक-अभिभावक मामले, प्रारंभिक जन्म, बीमारी, एक साथ छुट्टी अपवाद, सीमा पार समन्वय और व्यक्तिगत आय गणना परिणाम बदल सकते हैं; उन मामलों के लिए एनएवी जांचें।","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"केवल नॉर्वेजियन नियम · NAV अवधि तालिका की जाँच की गई 17 अक्टूबर 2026 · भाषा देश या नियम नहीं बदलती।","Family event":"पारिवारिक कार्यक्रम","Birth":"जन्म","Adoption":"दत्तक ग्रहण","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"अपेक्षित जन्म या देखभाल-स्थानांतरण तिथि","Number of children":"बच्चों की संख्या","One child":"एक बच्चा","Two children":"दो बच्चे","Three or more children":"तीन या अधिक बच्चे","Coverage choice":"कवरेज विकल्प","100% coverage":"100% कवरेज","80% coverage":"80% कवरेज","Add a leave period":"छुट्टी की अवधि जोड़ें","Parent taking leave":"माता-पिता छुट्टी ले रहे हैं","Mother":"माँ","Other parent":"अन्य अभिभावक","Benefit quota used":"लाभ कोटा का उपयोग किया गया","Prenatal quota":"प्रसवपूर्व कोटा","Mother quota":"माँ कोटा","Other-parent quota":"अन्य-अभिभावक कोटा","Shared period":"साझा अवधि","First date":"पहली तारीख","Last date":"अंतिम तिथि","Benefit withdrawal, %":"लाभ निकासी, %","Calendar label":"कैलेंडर लेबल","Add period to plan":"योजना में अवधि जोड़ें","Remove":"निकालें","Check plan":"योजना जांचें","Clear plan":"स्पष्ट योजना","Download calendar (.ics)":"कैलेंडर डाउनलोड करें (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"नॉर्वे योजना सारांश","Total NAV period":"कुल एनएवी अवधि","Before birth":"जन्म से पहले","benefit days":"लाभ दिवस","weeks":"सप्ताह","Unscheduled quota remaining":"अनिर्धारित कोटा शेष","Total days not yet assigned":"कुल दिन अभी तक निर्दिष्ट नहीं किए गए हैं","Your dated periods":"आपकी दिनांकित अवधि","Parent":"अभिभावक","Quota":"कोटा","Calendar dates":"कैलेंडर तिथियां","Withdrawal":"निकासी","Benefit days used":"उपयोग किए गए लाभ दिवस","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"शेष कोटा और कैलेंडर देखने के लिए दिनांकित अवधि जोड़ें।","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"ईवेंट विवरण चुनें और कोई भी अवधि जोड़ें जिसकी आप तुलना करना चाहते हैं।","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"इस डिवाइस पर योजना की जाँच की गई। एनएवी व्यक्तिगत अधिकार तय करता है.","Period added to the plan.":"योजना में अवधि जोड़ी गई।","Period removed.":"अवधि हटा दी गई।","Plan cleared.":"योजना स्वीकृत।","Calendar file created on this device.":"इस डिवाइस पर कैलेंडर फ़ाइल बनाई गई।","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"तिथि, मूल, कोटा और निकासी प्रतिशत की समीक्षा करें।","Compare the two coverage choices":"दो कवरेज विकल्पों की तुलना करें","Total period":"कुल अवधि","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"कवरेज विकल्प माता-पिता दोनों के लिए समान है और इसे बाद में नहीं बदला जा सकता है। आंकड़े अवधि अवधि के हैं, भुगतान अनुमान नहीं।","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"आपकी प्रविष्टियाँ इस ब्राउज़र टैब में रहती हैं। जब आप डाउनलोड चुनते हैं तो कैलेंडर निर्यात स्थानीय रूप से बनाया जाता है।","Assumptions used":"प्रयुक्त धारणाएँ","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"लाभ के दिन सोमवार से शुक्रवार तक गिने जाते हैं; सार्वजनिक छुट्टियों को अलग से बाहर नहीं रखा गया है।","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"आंशिक-निकासी प्रतिशत एक लंबी अनुसूची और कम लाभ-दिन के उपयोग को दर्शाता है। नियोक्ता के साथ वास्तविक कार्य प्रतिशत पर सहमति बनाएं और NAV की जांच करें।","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"इस मानक योजनाकार में संयुक्त एक साथ निकासी 100% तक सीमित है; विशेष बहु-जन्म अपवाद इस जाँच के बाहर हैं।","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"एनएवी अवधि का उपयोग आम तौर पर बच्चे के तीन साल का होने से पहले, या गोद लेने के लिए देखभाल हस्तांतरण के तीन साल के भीतर किया जाना चाहिए।","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · अभिभावकीय लाभ नियम और अवधि सारणी","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · राष्ट्रीय बीमा मूल राशि (जी)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · आधिकारिक अभिभावकीय लाभ योजनाकार","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"इस प्लानर के बाहर के मामलों के लिए ओपन एनएवी मार्गदर्शन","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"यह घटना दिनांक यहां शामिल दिनांकित NAV तालिकाओं के बाहर है। लागू नियम संस्करण के लिए एनएवी मार्गदर्शन खोलें।","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"यह संस्करण मानक मामले को मॉडल करता है जहां माता-पिता दोनों ने अधिकार अर्जित किया है। अन्य पारिवारिक स्थितियों के लिए NAV का उपयोग करें।","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"क्या पृष्ठ भाषा बदलने से नियम बदल जाते हैं?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"नहीं। इंटरफ़ेस को विभिन्न भाषाओं में पढ़ा जा सकता है, लेकिन यह योजनाकार हमेशा बताई गई नॉर्वेजियन एनएवी अवधि तालिका को लागू करता है।","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"क्या इससे मुझे पता चलता है कि NAV मेरे दावे को स्वीकार करेगा या नहीं?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"नहीं। पात्रता और भुगतान आपके व्यक्तिगत रिकॉर्ड से एनएवी द्वारा तय किया जाता है। यह योजनाकार केवल मानक अवधि तालिका और आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई तारीखों की तुलना करता है।","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"क्या माता-पिता दोनों एक ही समय में लाभ ले सकते हैं?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"कुछ व्यवस्थाएं ओवरलैप हो सकती हैं, लेकिन मानक योजनाकार संयुक्त निकासी को 100% तक सीमित करता है। विशेष बहु-जन्म और अन्य अपवादों की जांच NAV से की जानी चाहिए।"},"id":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Perencana Tunjangan dan Cuti Orang Tua Norwegia","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Perencana Cuti Orang Tua Norwegia 2026 — Minggu, Kuota, dan Kalender","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Rencanakan minggu-minggu tunjangan orang tua di Norwegia untuk kelahiran atau adopsi. Bandingkan cakupan 80% dan 100%, tetapkan kuota masing-masing orang tua, jadwalkan cuti sebagian, dan ekspor file kalender pribadi.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Perencana tunjangan orang tua Norwegia yang praktis untuk keluarga yang membandingkan tanggal, kuota, dan waktu tidak bekerja. Pilih bahasa untuk antarmuka; aturan di bawah ini tetap menjadi aturan NAV Norwegia.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berjalan di perangkat ini. Tanggal dan detail paket keluarga tidak dikirim ke server atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Untuk satu anak yang lahir pada 1 November 2026, periode NAV standar ketika kedua orang tua memenuhi syarat adalah 49 minggu pada 100% atau 61 minggu dan 1 hari pada 80%. Pilihan 80% umumnya menyebarkan pembayaran dalam waktu yang lebih lama; NAV mengatakan total pembayarannya kira-kira sama.","How the planner works":"Cara kerja perencana","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Pertama bandingkan tabel periode resmi untuk tanggal acara yang dipilih, jenis acara, jumlah anak dan cakupan. Kemudian tambahkan periode cuti Anda sendiri. Hari kerja menggunakan hari manfaat; penarikan sebagian mengurangi hari yang digunakan per hari kerja dan memperpanjang kalender. Kesenjangan dapat mewakili pekerjaan atau liburan tanpa penarikan manfaat.","Common questions":"Pertanyaan umum","Scope and limits":"Cakupan dan batasan","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Khusus Norwegia. Ini merupakan bantuan perencanaan, bukan keputusan kelayakan, penghitungan pembayaran tunjangan, penentuan hak cuti pemberi kerja atau permohonan NAV. Tabel standar mengasumsikan kedua orang tua berhak. Aturan aktivitas, kasus dengan orang tua tunggal, kelahiran dini, penyakit, pengecualian cuti serentak, koordinasi lintas batas, dan perhitungan pendapatan individual dapat mengubah hasil; periksa NAV untuk kasus tersebut.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Hanya aturan Norwegia · Tabel periode NAV diperiksa 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara atau aturan.","Family event":"Acara keluarga","Birth":"Kelahiran","Adoption":"Adopsi","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Tanggal lahir atau pemindahan perawatan yang diharapkan","Number of children":"Jumlah anak","One child":"Satu anak","Two children":"Dua anak","Three or more children":"Tiga anak atau lebih","Coverage choice":"Pilihan cakupan\nCakupan","100% coverage":"100%.\nCakupan","80% coverage":"80%.","Add a leave period":"Tambahkan masa cuti","Parent taking leave":"Orang tua sedang mengambil cuti","Mother":"Ibu","Other parent":"Induk lainnya","Benefit quota used":"Kuota manfaat terpakai","Prenatal quota":"Kuota prenatal","Mother quota":"Kuota ibu","Other-parent quota":"Kuota orang tua lainnya","Shared period":"Periode bersama","First date":"Kencan pertama","Last date":"Tanggal terakhir","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Penarikan manfaat, %","Calendar label":"Label kalender","Add period to plan":"Tambahkan periode ke rencana","Remove":"Hapus","Check plan":"Periksa paket","Clear plan":"Rencana yang jelas","Download calendar (.ics)":"Unduh kalender (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Ringkasan rencana Norwegia","Total NAV period":"Total periode NAV","Before birth":"Sebelum lahir","benefit days":"hari manfaat","weeks":"minggu","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Sisa kuota tidak terjadwal","Total days not yet assigned":"Total hari belum ditetapkan","Your dated periods":"Periode tanggal Anda","Parent":"Orangtua","Quota":"Kuota","Calendar dates":"Tanggal kalender","Withdrawal":"Penarikan","Benefit days used":"Manfaat hari yang digunakan","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Tambahkan periode tanggal untuk melihat sisa kuota dan kalender.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Pilih detail acara dan tambahkan periode yang ingin Anda bandingkan.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Rencana diperiksa pada perangkat ini. NAV menentukan hak-hak individu.","Period added to the plan.":"Periode ditambahkan ke rencana.","Period removed.":"Periode dihapus.","Plan cleared.":"Rencana selesai.","Calendar file created on this device.":"File kalender dibuat di perangkat ini.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Tinjau tanggal, induk, kuota, dan persentase penarikan.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Bandingkan dua pilihan cakupan","Total period":"Jumlah periode","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Pilihan cakupan sama untuk kedua orang tua dan tidak dapat diubah di kemudian hari. Angka-angka tersebut adalah jangka waktu periode, bukan perkiraan pembayaran.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Entri Anda tetap berada di tab browser ini. Ekspor kalender dibuat secara lokal ketika Anda memilih Unduh.","Assumptions used":"Asumsi yang digunakan","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Hari manfaat dihitung Senin sampai Jumat; hari libur nasional tidak dikecualikan secara terpisah.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Persentase penarikan sebagian memodelkan jadwal yang lebih panjang dan penggunaan hari manfaat yang lebih rendah. Setujui persentase pekerjaan sebenarnya dengan pemberi kerja dan periksa NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Penarikan simultan gabungan dibatasi hingga 100% dalam perencana standar ini; pengecualian kelahiran ganda khusus berada di luar pemeriksaan ini.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV periode biasanya harus digunakan sebelum anak berusia tiga tahun, atau dalam waktu tiga tahun setelah transfer pengasuhan untuk adopsi.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · aturan tunjangan orang tua dan tabel periode","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Besaran pokok Asuransi Nasional (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · perencana tunjangan resmi orang tua","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Panduan NAV terbuka untuk kasus di luar perencana ini","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Tanggal kejadian ini berada di luar tabel tanggal NAV yang disertakan di sini. Buka panduan NAV untuk versi aturan yang berlaku.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Versi ini memodelkan kasus standar di mana kedua orang tua berhak mendapatkan hak. Gunakan NAV untuk situasi keluarga lainnya.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Apakah mengubah bahasa halaman mengubah aturan?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Tidak. Antarmukanya dapat dibaca dalam berbagai bahasa, namun perencana ini selalu menerapkan tabel periode NAV Norwegia yang dinyatakan.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Apakah ini memberitahu saya apakah NAV akan menyetujui klaim saya?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Tidak. Kelayakan dan pembayaran ditentukan oleh NAV dari catatan pribadi Anda. Perencana ini hanya membandingkan tabel periode standar dan tanggal yang Anda masukkan.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Bisakah kedua orang tua mengambil manfaat sekaligus?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Beberapa pengaturan mungkin tumpang tindih, namun perencana standar membatasi penarikan gabungan hingga 100%. Kelahiran kembar khusus dan pengecualian lainnya harus diperiksa dengan NAV."},"it":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Pianificatore di congedi e benefici parentali in Norvegia","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Pianificatore del congedo parentale in Norvegia 2026 — Settimane, quote e calendario","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Pianifica settimane norvegesi di sussidi parentali per nascita o adozione. Confronta la copertura 80% e 100%, assegna le quote di ciascun genitore, pianifica il congedo parziale ed esporta un file di calendario privato.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Un pratico pianificatore norvegese di benefici parentali per le famiglie che confronta date, quote e tempo lontano dal lavoro. Scegli una lingua per l'interfaccia; le regole seguenti rimangono le regole NAV norvegesi.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Funziona su questo dispositivo. Le date e i dettagli del piano familiare non vengono inviati a un server o salvati da questo strumento.","Example":"Esempio","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Per un bambino nato il 1 novembre 2026, il periodo NAV standard in cui entrambi i genitori sono idonei è 49 settimane al 100% o 61 settimane e 1 giorno al 80%. La scelta 80% generalmente dilaziona i pagamenti su tempi più lunghi; Il NAV afferma che il pagamento totale è approssimativamente uguale.","How the planner works":"Come funziona l'agenda","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Confronta innanzitutto la tabella periodica ufficiale per la data dell'evento selezionato, il tipo di evento, il numero di bambini e la copertura. Quindi aggiungi i tuoi periodi di ferie datati. I giorni feriali consumano giorni di beneficio; il ritiro parziale riduce i giorni utilizzati per ogni giorno feriale e allunga il calendario. Le lacune possono rappresentare lavoro o ferie senza ritiro dei benefici.","Common questions":"Domande comuni","Scope and limits":"Ambito e limiti","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Solo Norvegia. Si tratta di un aiuto alla pianificazione, non di una decisione di ammissibilità, di un calcolo del pagamento delle indennità, di una determinazione dei diritti di congedo del datore di lavoro o di una richiesta di NAV. La tabella standard presuppone che entrambi i genitori abbiano maturato un diritto. Le regole sull’attività, i casi monoparentali, la nascita prematura, la malattia, le eccezioni ai congedi simultanei, il coordinamento transfrontaliero e il calcolo individualizzato del reddito possono modificare il risultato; controlla il NAV per questi casi.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Solo regole norvegesi · Tabella del periodo NAV controllata 17 Ottobre 2026 · la lingua non cambia il paese o le regole.","Family event":"Evento familiare","Birth":"Nascita","Adoption":"Adozione","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Data prevista di nascita o trasferimento dell'assistenza","Number of children":"Numero di bambini","One child":"Un bambino","Two children":"Due bambini","Three or more children":"Tre o più figli","Coverage choice":"Scelta della copertura","100% coverage":"100% di copertura","80% coverage":"80% di copertura","Add a leave period":"Aggiungi un periodo di ferie","Parent taking leave":"Genitore in congedo","Mother":"Madre","Other parent":"Altro genitore","Benefit quota used":"Quota vantaggio utilizzata","Prenatal quota":"Quota prenatale","Mother quota":"Quota madre","Other-parent quota":"Quota dell'altro genitore","Shared period":"Periodo condiviso","First date":"Primo appuntamento","Last date":"Ultima data","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Recesso del beneficio, %","Calendar label":"Etichetta calendario","Add period to plan":"Aggiungi periodo al piano","Remove":"Rimuovi","Check plan":"Controlla il piano","Clear plan":"Piano chiaro","Download calendar (.ics)":"Scarica calendario (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Riepilogo del piano Norvegia","Total NAV period":"Periodo NAV totale","Before birth":"Prima della nascita","benefit days":"giorni di beneficio","weeks":"settimane","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Quota non pianificata rimanente","Total days not yet assigned":"Giorni totali non ancora assegnati","Your dated periods":"I tuoi periodi datati","Parent":"Genitore","Quota":"Quota","Calendar dates":"Date del calendario","Withdrawal":"Ritiro","Benefit days used":"Giorni di benefit utilizzati","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Aggiungi periodi con data per visualizzare la quota e il calendario rimanenti.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Scegli i dettagli dell'evento e aggiungi eventuali periodi che desideri confrontare.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Piano controllato su questo dispositivo. NAV decide i diritti individuali.","Period added to the plan.":"Periodo aggiunto al piano.","Period removed.":"Punto rimosso.","Plan cleared.":"Piano cancellato.","Calendar file created on this device.":"File calendario creato su questo dispositivo.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Rivedi le date, l'elemento principale, la quota e le percentuali di prelievo.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Confronta le due scelte di copertura","Total period":"Periodo totale","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"La scelta della copertura è la stessa per entrambi i genitori e non può essere modificata successivamente. Le cifre rappresentano la durata del periodo, non una stima del pagamento.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Le tue voci rimangono in questa scheda del browser. L'esportazione del calendario viene creata localmente quando scegli Scarica.","Assumptions used":"Presupposti utilizzati","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"I giorni di beneficio vengono conteggiati dal lunedì al venerdì; i giorni festivi non sono esclusi separatamente.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Una percentuale di ritiro parziale modella un programma più lungo e un utilizzo ridotto dei giorni di beneficio. Concordare la percentuale di lavoro effettiva con il datore di lavoro e controllare il NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Il prelievo simultaneo combinato è limitato al 100% in questo pianificatore standard; le eccezioni speciali relative alle nascite multiple non rientrano in questo controllo.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"I periodi NAV normalmente devono essere utilizzati prima che il bambino compia tre anni o entro tre anni dal trasferimento in adozione.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · regole sui benefici parentali e tabelle periodiche","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Importo base della Previdenza Sociale (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · pianificatore ufficiale dei benefici per i genitori","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Apri la guida NAV per i casi esterni a questo pianificatore","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Questa data dell'evento non è inclusa nelle tabelle NAV con data incluse qui. Guida Open NAV per la versione della regola applicabile.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Questa versione modella il caso standard in cui entrambi i genitori hanno guadagnato un diritto. Usa il NAV per altre situazioni familiari.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"La modifica della lingua della pagina modifica le regole?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"N. L'interfaccia può essere letta in diverse lingue, ma questo pianificatore applica sempre la tabella periodica del NAV norvegese indicata.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Mi dice se NAV approverà la mia richiesta?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"N. L'idoneità e il pagamento vengono decisi dal NAV in base ai tuoi record individuali. Questo pianificatore confronta solo la tabella periodica standard e le date inserite.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Entrambi i genitori possono usufruire delle prestazioni contemporaneamente?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Alcuni accordi possono sovrapporsi, ma il pianificatore standard limita il prelievo combinato a 100%. Nascite multiple speciali e altre eccezioni devono essere verificate con NAV."},"ja":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"ノルウェーの育児手当および休暇プランナー","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"ノルウェーの育児休暇プランナー 2026 — 週、ノルマ、カレンダー","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"出生または養子縁組のためにノルウェーの両親手当週間を計画します。 80% と 100% の適用範囲を比較し、各保護者の割り当てを割り当て、部分休暇をスケジュールし、プライベート カレンダー ファイルをエクスポートします。","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"日付、ノルマ、仕事から離れた時間を比較する家族向けの実用的なノルウェーの親手当プランナー。インターフェースの言語を選択します。以下のルールはノルウェーの NAV ルールのままです。","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"このデバイスで実行されます。日付とファミリー プランの詳細は、このツールによってサーバーに送信されたり保存されたりしません。","Example":"例","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"1 11 月 2026 に生まれた 1 人の子供の場合、両親が条件を満たす場合の標準 NAV 期間は、100% で 49 週、または 61 週と 80% で 1 日です。 80% を選択すると、通常、支払いが長期間にわたって分散されます。 NAVは支払総額はほぼ同額だとしている。","How the planner works":"プランナーの仕組み","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"まず、選択したイベントの日付、イベントの種類、子供の数、および対象範囲について、公式の期間表を比較します。次に、独自の日付付き休暇期間を追加します。平日は給付日を消費します。部分的に撤退すると、平日あたりの使用日数が減り、カレンダーが延長されます。ギャップは、給付金の引き出しのない仕事または休暇を表す場合があります。","Common questions":"よくある質問","Scope and limits":"範囲と制限","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"ノルウェーのみ。これは計画支援であり、適格性の決定、給付金の計算、雇用主の休暇権の決定、または NAV の申請ではありません。標準的な表では、両親が両方とも権利を獲得していることを前提としています。活動ルール、ひとり親の場合、早産、病気、同時休暇の例外、国境を越えた調整、個別の収入計算などにより、結果が変わる可能性があります。そのような場合にはNAVをチェックしてください。","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"ノルウェーのルールのみ · NAV 期間テーブルがチェックされました 17 10 月 2026 · 言語によって国やルールは変更されません。","Family event":"家族のイベント","Birth":"誕生","Adoption":"採用","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"出産予定日または介護移転予定日","Number of children":"子供の数","One child":"子供 1 人","Two children":"子供 2 人","Three or more children":"3 人以上の子供","Coverage choice":"補償範囲の選択","100% coverage":"100% カバレッジ","80% coverage":"80% カバレッジ","Add a leave period":"休暇期間を追加する","Parent taking leave":"休暇をとる親","Mother":"母","Other parent":"他の親","Benefit quota used":"特典割り当てが使用されました","Prenatal quota":"出生前割り当て","Mother quota":"マザー クォータ","Other-parent quota":"その他の親クォータ","Shared period":"共有期間","First date":"初デート","Last date":"最後の日付","Benefit withdrawal, %":"給付金の引き出し、%","Calendar label":"カレンダー ラベル","Add period to plan":"計画に期間を追加","Remove":"削除","Check plan":"計画を確認する","Clear plan":"明確な計画","Download calendar (.ics)":"カレンダーをダウンロード (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"ノルウェーの計画の概要","Total NAV period":"合計 NAV 期間","Before birth":"出産前","benefit days":"特典日数","weeks":"週間","Unscheduled quota remaining":"予定外のクォータが残っています","Total days not yet assigned":"合計日数はまだ割り当てられていません","Your dated periods":"あなたの日付の生理","Parent":"親","Quota":"クォータ","Calendar dates":"カレンダーの日付","Withdrawal":"撤退","Benefit days used":"使用された特典日数","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"日付付きの期間を追加して、残りのクォータとカレンダーを表示します。","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"イベントの詳細を選択し、比較したい期間を追加します。","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"このデバイスでプランがチェックされました。 NAV は個人の権利を決定します。","Period added to the plan.":"期間が計画に追加されました。","Period removed.":"ピリオドが削除されました。","Plan cleared.":"計画はクリアされました。","Calendar file created on this device.":"このデバイスでカレンダー ファイルが作成されました。","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"日付、親、割り当て、および引き出しの割合を確認します。","Compare the two coverage choices":"2 つの適用範囲の選択肢を比較する","Total period":"合計期間","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"補償範囲の選択は両方の親で同じであり、後で変更することはできません。この数字は期間の長さであり、支払額の見積もりではありません。","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"エントリはこのブラウザ タブに残ります。 [ダウンロード] を選択すると、カレンダーのエクスポートがローカルに作成されます。","Assumptions used":"使用される仮定","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"給付日数は月曜日から金曜日までカウントされます。祝日は別途除外されません。","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"部分引き出し率は、より長いスケジュールと給付日の利用の減少をモデル化します。実際の労働割合を雇用主と合意し、基準価額を確認します。","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"この標準プランナーでは、同時出金の合計は 100% に制限されています。特別な多胎例外はこのチェックの対象外です。","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV 期間は通常、子供が 3 歳になる前、または養子縁組のための養育移管後 3 年以内に使用する必要があります。","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · 親の給付規定と期間表","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV・国民保険基本額(G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · 公式保護者特典プランナー","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"このプランナー以外のケースに対するオープン NAV ガイダンス","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"このイベントの日付は、ここに含まれる日付付きの NAV 表の範囲外です。該当するルール バージョンの NAV ガイダンスを開きます。","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"このバージョンは、両親が両方とも権利を獲得している標準的なケースをモデル化しています。その他の家族の状況にも NAV を使用してください。","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"ページの言語を変更するとルールも変わりますか?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"いいえ。インターフェースはさまざまな言語で読むことができますが、このプランナーは常に記載されているノルウェーの NAV 期間表を適用します。","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"これにより、NAV が私の請求を承認するかどうかがわかりますか?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"いいえ。資格と支払いは、個人の記録に基づいて NAV によって決定されます。このプランナーは、標準期間表と入力した日付のみを比較します。","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"両親が同時に給付を受けることはできますか?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"一部の取り決めは重複する可能性がありますが、標準プランナーでは合計引き出し額が 100% に制限されています。特別な多胎出産およびその他の例外については、NAV で確認する必要があります。"},"ko":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"노르웨이 육아 혜택 및 휴가 플래너","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"노르웨이 육아 휴가 플래너 2026 — 주, 할당량 및 달력","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"출생 또는 입양을 위한 노르웨이 부모 혜택 주간을 계획하세요. 80% 및 100% 적용 범위를 비교하고, 각 부모의 할당량을 할당하고, 부분 휴가를 예약하고, 개인 달력 파일을 내보냅니다.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"일자, 할당량 및 휴가 시간을 비교하는 가족을 위한 실용적인 노르웨이어 부모 혜택 플래너입니다. 인터페이스 언어를 선택하세요. 아래 규칙은 노르웨이 NAV 규칙으로 유지됩니다.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"이 장치에서 실행됩니다. 날짜와 가족 계획 세부 정보는 서버로 전송되거나 이 도구에 저장되지 않습니다.","Example":"예","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"1 11월 2026에 태어난 한 자녀의 경우 부모 모두 자격을 갖춘 표준 NAV 기간은 100%에서 49주 또는 61주 및 80%에서 1일입니다. 80% 선택은 일반적으로 장기간에 걸쳐 지불을 분산시킵니다. NAV는 총 지불액이 대략 동일하다고 말합니다.","How the planner works":"플래너 작동 방식","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"먼저 선택한 이벤트 날짜, 이벤트 유형, 어린이 수 및 적용 범위에 대한 공식 기간표를 비교하세요. 그런 다음 자신만의 휴가 기간을 추가하세요. 평일은 혜택일을 소비합니다. 부분철회는 평일 사용일수를 줄이고 달력을 연장합니다. 격차는 혜택 철회 없이 근무 또는 휴가를 나타낼 수 있습니다.","Common questions":"일반적인 질문","Scope and limits":"범위 및 제한","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"노르웨이에만 해당. 이는 계획 지원이지 자격 결정, 혜택 지급 계산, 고용주 휴가 권리 결정 또는 NAV 신청이 아닙니다. 표준 표에서는 두 부모 모두 권리를 얻었다고 가정합니다. 활동 규칙, 한부모 사례, 조산, 질병, 동시 휴가 예외, 국경 간 조정 및 개별 소득 계산에 따라 결과가 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 경우에는 NAV를 확인하세요.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"노르웨이어 규칙만 · NAV 기간 테이블 확인 17 10월 2026 · 언어는 국가 또는 규칙을 변경하지 않습니다.","Family event":"가족 행사","Birth":"탄생","Adoption":"채택","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"출생 또는 돌봄 양도 예정일","Number of children":"자녀 수","One child":"자녀 1명","Two children":"두 자녀","Three or more children":"자녀 3명 이상","Coverage choice":"범위 선택","100% coverage":"100% 적용 범위","80% coverage":"80% 적용 범위","Add a leave period":"휴직 기간 추가","Parent taking leave":"부모님이 휴가를 가십니다","Mother":"어머니","Other parent":"다른 상위","Benefit quota used":"사용된 혜택 할당량","Prenatal quota":"태아 할당량","Mother quota":"어머니 할당량","Other-parent quota":"다른 상위 할당량","Shared period":"공유 기간","First date":"첫 번째 데이트","Last date":"마지막 날짜","Benefit withdrawal, %":"혜택 인출, %","Calendar label":"캘린더 라벨","Add period to plan":"계획에 기간 추가","Remove":"제거","Check plan":"계획 확인","Clear plan":"명확한 계획","Download calendar (.ics)":"캘린더(.ics) 다운로드","Norway plan summary":"노르웨이 계획 요약","Total NAV period":"총 NAV 기간","Before birth":"출생 전","benefit days":"혜택일","weeks":"주","Unscheduled quota remaining":"예정되지 않은 남은 할당량","Total days not yet assigned":"아직 할당되지 않은 총 일수","Your dated periods":"귀하의 생리 기간","Parent":"상위","Quota":"할당량","Calendar dates":"달력 날짜","Withdrawal":"출금","Benefit days used":"사용된 혜택 일수","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"나머지 할당량 및 달력을 보려면 날짜가 지정된 기간을 추가하세요.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"이벤트 세부정보를 선택하고 비교하려는 기간을 추가하세요.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"이 장치에서 계획이 확인되었습니다. NAV는 개인의 권리를 결정합니다.","Period added to the plan.":"계획에 기간이 추가되었습니다.","Period removed.":"기간이 삭제되었습니다.","Plan cleared.":"계획이 삭제되었습니다.","Calendar file created on this device.":"이 장치에 달력 파일이 생성되었습니다.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"날짜, 상위, 할당량 및 철회 비율을 검토하십시오.","Compare the two coverage choices":"두 가지 적용 범위 선택 비교","Total period":"총 기간","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"보장 선택은 부모 모두에게 동일하며 나중에 변경할 수 없습니다. 수치는 지급 추정치가 아닌 기간입니다.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"귀하의 항목은 이 브라우저 탭에 남아 있습니다. 다운로드를 선택하면 캘린더 내보내기가 로컬로 생성됩니다.","Assumptions used":"사용된 가정","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"혜택 일수는 월요일부터 금요일까지 계산됩니다. 공휴일은 별도로 제외되지 않습니다.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"부분 철회 비율은 더 긴 일정과 혜택일 사용 감소를 모델로 합니다. 고용주와 실제 근무 비율을 합의하고 NAV를 확인하세요.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"이 표준 플래너에서는 동시 출금이 100%로 제한됩니다. 특별한 다출생 예외는 이 검사 범위에 포함되지 않습니다.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV 기간은 일반적으로 자녀가 3세가 되기 전 또는 입양을 위해 양육권을 양도한 후 3년 이내에 사용해야 합니다.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · 부모 혜택 규칙 및 기간표","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV·국민보험기본금액(G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · 공식 부모 혜택 플래너","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"이 플래너 외부의 경우에 대한 NAV 지침 열기","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"이 이벤트 날짜는 여기에 포함된 NAV 테이블 날짜와 다릅니다. 해당 규칙 버전에 대한 NAV 지침을 엽니다.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"이 버전은 부모 모두가 권리를 획득한 표준 사례를 모델로 합니다. 다른 가족 상황에는 NAV를 사용하십시오.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"페이지 언어를 변경하면 규칙이 변경됩니까?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"아니요. 인터페이스는 다양한 언어로 읽을 수 있지만 이 플래너는 항상 명시된 노르웨이 NAV 주기표를 적용합니다.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"NAV가 내 청구를 승인할지 여부를 알려주나요?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"아니요. 자격과 지급액은 귀하의 개인 기록을 바탕으로 NAV가 결정합니다. 이 플래너는 입력한 표준생리표와 날짜만 비교합니다.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"두 부모가 동시에 혜택을 받을 수 있습니까?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"일부 계획은 겹칠 수 있지만 표준 플래너는 통합 출금을 100%로 제한합니다. 특별한 다태출생 및 기타 예외 사항은 NAV를 통해 확인해야 합니다."},"mr":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"नॉर्वे पॅरेंटल बेनिफिट आणि लीव्ह प्लॅनर","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"नॉर्वे पॅरेंटल लीव्ह प्लॅनर 2026 — आठवडे, कोटा आणि कॅलेंडर","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"जन्म किंवा दत्तक घेण्यासाठी नॉर्वेजियन पालक-लाभ सप्ताहांची योजना करा. 80% आणि 100% कव्हरेजची तुलना करा, प्रत्येक पालकांचा कोटा नियुक्त करा, आंशिक रजा शेड्यूल करा आणि खाजगी कॅलेंडर फाइल निर्यात करा.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"तारखा, कोटा आणि कामापासून दूर असलेल्या कुटुंबांसाठी एक व्यावहारिक नॉर्वेजियन पालक-लाभ नियोजक. इंटरफेससाठी भाषा निवडा; खालील नियम नॉर्वेजियन एनएव्ही नियम आहेत.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"या उपकरणावर चालते. तारखा आणि कौटुंबिक योजनेचे तपशील सर्व्हरवर पाठवले जात नाहीत किंवा या साधनाद्वारे जतन केले जात नाहीत.","Example":"उदाहरण","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"रोजी जन्मलेल्या एका मुलासाठी1नोव्हेंबर2026, दोन्ही पालक पात्र असताना मानक NAV कालावधी आहे49आठवडे येथे100% किंवा61आठवडे आणि1येथे दिवस80% द80% निवड सामान्यत: जास्त काळ पेमेंट पसरवते; NAV म्हणते की एकूण पेमेंट अंदाजे समान आहे.","How the planner works":"नियोजक कसे कार्य करते","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"प्रथम निवडलेल्या कार्यक्रमाची तारीख, इव्हेंट प्रकार, मुलांची संख्या आणि कव्हरेजसाठी अधिकृत कालावधी सारणीची तुलना करा. नंतर तुमचा स्वतःचा दिनांकित सुट्टीचा कालावधी जोडा. आठवड्याचे दिवस लाभाचे दिवस वापरतात; आंशिक पैसे काढणे दर आठवड्याला वापरलेले दिवस कमी करते आणि कॅलेंडर वाढवते. लाभ काढून न घेता अंतर काम किंवा सुट्टीचे प्रतिनिधित्व करू शकते.","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Scope and limits":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"फक्त नॉर्वे. ही योजना मदत आहे, पात्रता निर्णय, लाभ-पेमेंट गणना, नियोक्ता रजा-अधिकार निर्धारण किंवा NAV अर्ज नाही. मानक सारणी गृहीत धरते की दोन्ही पालकांनी हक्क मिळवला आहे. क्रियाकलाप नियम, एक-पालक प्रकरणे, लवकर जन्म, आजारपण, एकाचवेळी रजा अपवाद, क्रॉस-बॉर्डर समन्वय आणि वैयक्तिक उत्पन्नाची गणना परिणाम बदलू शकते; त्या प्रकरणांसाठी एनएव्ही तपासा.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"केवळ नॉर्वेजियन नियम · NAV कालावधी सारणी 17 ऑक्टोबर 2026 तपासली · भाषा देश किंवा नियम बदलत नाही.","Family event":"कौटुंबिक कार्यक्रम","Birth":"जन्म","Adoption":"दत्तक","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"अपेक्षित जन्म किंवा काळजी-हस्तांतरण तारीख","Number of children":"मुलांची संख्या","One child":"एक मूल","Two children":"दोन मुले","Three or more children":"तीन किंवा अधिक मुले","Coverage choice":"कव्हरेज निवड","100% coverage":"100% कव्हरेज","80% coverage":"80% कव्हरेज","Add a leave period":"रजेचा कालावधी जोडा","Parent taking leave":"पालक रजा घेत आहेत","Mother":"आई","Other parent":"इतर पालक","Benefit quota used":"लाभ कोटा वापरला","Prenatal quota":"जन्मपूर्व कोटा","Mother quota":"मदर कोटा","Other-parent quota":"इतर-पालक कोटा","Shared period":"सामायिक कालावधी","First date":"पहिली तारीख","Last date":"अंतिम तारीख","Benefit withdrawal, %":"लाभ काढणे, %","Calendar label":"कॅलेंडर लेबल","Add period to plan":"प्लॅनमध्ये कालावधी जोडा","Remove":"काढा","Check plan":"प्लॅन तपासा","Clear plan":"प्लॅन साफ करा","Download calendar (.ics)":"कॅलेंडर डाउनलोड करा (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"नॉर्वे योजनेचा सारांश","Total NAV period":"एकूण NAV कालावधी","Before birth":"जन्मापूर्वी","benefit days":"लाभाचे दिवस","weeks":"आठवडे","Unscheduled quota remaining":"अनशेड्यूल कोटा शिल्लक आहे","Total days not yet assigned":"एकूण दिवस अद्याप नियुक्त केलेले नाहीत","Your dated periods":"तुमचा दिनांक कालावधी","Parent":"पालक","Quota":"कोटा","Calendar dates":"कॅलेंडर तारखा","Withdrawal":"पैसे काढणे","Benefit days used":"लाभ दिवस वापरले","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"उर्वरित कोटा आणि कॅलेंडर पाहण्यासाठी दिनांकित कालावधी जोडा.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"इव्हेंट तपशील निवडा आणि तुम्हाला तुलना करायची असलेली कोणतीही पूर्णविराम जोडा.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"या डिव्हाइसवर योजना तपासली. NAV वैयक्तिक हक्क ठरवते.","Period added to the plan.":"प्लॅनमध्ये कालावधी जोडला.","Period removed.":"कालावधी काढला.","Plan cleared.":"प्लॅन साफ ​​केला.","Calendar file created on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर कॅलेंडर फाइल तयार केली आहे.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"तारीखा, पालक, कोटा आणि पैसे काढण्याच्या टक्केवारीचे पुनरावलोकन करा.","Compare the two coverage choices":"दोन कव्हरेज निवडींची तुलना करा","Total period":"एकूण कालावधी","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"कव्हरेज निवड दोन्ही पालकांसाठी समान आहे आणि नंतर बदलता येणार नाही. आकडेवारी कालावधीची लांबी आहे, पेआउट अंदाज नाही.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"तुमच्या नोंदी या ब्राउझर टॅबमध्ये राहतात. तुम्ही डाउनलोड निवडता तेव्हा कॅलेंडर निर्यात स्थानिक पातळीवर तयार केले जाते.","Assumptions used":"गृहीतके वापरली","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"लाभाचे दिवस सोमवार ते शुक्रवार मोजले जातात; सार्वजनिक सुट्ट्या स्वतंत्रपणे वगळल्या जात नाहीत.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"अंशिक-विथड्रॉवल टक्केवारी मॉडेल दीर्घ वेळापत्रक आणि कमी लाभ-दिवस वापर. नियोक्त्याशी प्रत्यक्ष कामाच्या टक्केवारीशी सहमत व्हा आणि NAV तपासा.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"या स्टँडर्ड प्लॅनरमध्ये एकत्रित एकाचवेळी पैसे काढणे 100% पर्यंत मर्यादित आहे; विशेष बहु-जन्म अपवाद या तपासणीच्या बाहेर आहेत.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV कालावधी साधारणपणे मूल तीन वर्षांचे होण्याआधी किंवा दत्तक घेतल्यानंतर तीन वर्षांच्या आत वापरणे आवश्यक आहे.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · पालक लाभ नियम आणि कालावधी सारणी","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · राष्ट्रीय विमा मूळ रक्कम (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · अधिकृत पालक लाभ नियोजक","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"या प्लॅनरच्या बाहेरील प्रकरणांसाठी NAV मार्गदर्शन उघडा","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"ही इव्हेंटची तारीख येथे समाविष्ट केलेल्या दिनांकित NAV सारण्यांच्या बाहेर आहे. लागू नियम आवृत्तीसाठी NAV मार्गदर्शन उघडा.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"ही आवृत्ती मानक केस मॉडेल करते जिथे दोन्ही पालकांनी हक्क मिळवला आहे. इतर कौटुंबिक परिस्थितीसाठी NAV वापरा.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"पानाची भाषा बदलल्याने नियम बदलतात का?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"नं. इंटरफेस वेगवेगळ्या भाषांमध्ये वाचला जाऊ शकतो, परंतु हा प्लॅनर नेहमी नमूद केलेल्या नॉर्वेजियन एनएव्ही कालावधी सारणी लागू करतो.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"हे मला सांगते की NAV माझा दावा मंजूर करेल की नाही?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"नं. पात्रता आणि पेमेंट तुमच्या वैयक्तिक रेकॉर्डवरून NAV द्वारे ठरवले जाते. हा नियोजक फक्त मानक कालावधी सारणी आणि तुम्ही प्रविष्ट केलेल्या तारखांची तुलना करतो.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"दोन्ही पालक एकाच वेळी लाभ घेऊ शकतात का?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"काही व्यवस्था ओव्हरलॅप करू शकतात, परंतु मानक प्लॅनर एकत्रित पैसे काढणे 100% पर्यंत मर्यादित करते. विशेष बहु-जन्म आणि इतर अपवाद NAV सह तपासले जाणे आवश्यक आहे."},"ms":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Perancang Faedah dan Cuti Ibu Bapa Norway","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Perancang Cuti Ibu Bapa Norway 2026 — Minggu, Kuota dan Kalendar","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Rancang minggu manfaat ibu bapa Norway untuk kelahiran atau pengangkatan. Bandingkan liputan 80% dan 100%, tetapkan kuota setiap ibu bapa, jadualkan cuti separa dan eksport fail kalendar peribadi.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Perancang faedah ibu bapa Norway yang praktikal untuk keluarga yang membandingkan tarikh, kuota dan masa tidak bekerja. Pilih bahasa untuk antara muka; peraturan di bawah kekal sebagai peraturan NAV Norway.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berjalan pada peranti ini. Tarikh dan butiran pelan keluarga tidak dihantar ke pelayan atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Untuk seorang anak yang dilahirkan pada1November2026, tempoh NAB standard apabila kedua ibu bapa layak ialah49minggu pada100% atau61minggu dan1hari pada80%. The80% pilihan biasanya menyebarkan pembayaran dalam masa yang lebih lama; NAB mengatakan jumlah pembayaran adalah lebih kurang sama.","How the planner works":"Cara perancang berfungsi","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Mula-mula bandingkan jadual tempoh rasmi untuk tarikh acara, jenis acara, bilangan kanak-kanak dan liputan yang dipilih. Kemudian tambahkan tempoh cuti bertarikh anda sendiri. Hari bekerja menggunakan hari manfaat; pengeluaran separa mengurangkan hari yang digunakan setiap hari bekerja dan memanjangkan kalendar. Jurang boleh mewakili kerja atau percutian tanpa pengeluaran faedah.","Common questions":"Soalan biasa","Scope and limits":"Skop dan had","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Norway sahaja. Ini adalah bantuan perancangan, bukan keputusan kelayakan, pengiraan bayaran faedah, penentuan hak cuti majikan atau permohonan NAB. Jadual standard menganggap kedua ibu bapa telah mendapat hak. Peraturan aktiviti, kes satu ibu bapa, kelahiran awal, sakit, pengecualian cuti serentak, penyelarasan rentas sempadan dan pengiraan pendapatan individu boleh mengubah keputusan; semak NAB untuk kes tersebut.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Peraturan Norway sahaja · Jadual tempoh NAV disemak 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara atau peraturan.","Family event":"Acara keluarga","Birth":"Kelahiran","Adoption":"Penggunaan","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Jangkaan tarikh lahir atau pemindahan penjagaan","Number of children":"Bilangan kanak-kanak","One child":"Seorang anak","Two children":"Dua beranak","Three or more children":"Tiga atau lebih kanak-kanak","Coverage choice":"Pilihan perlindungan","100% coverage":"100% liputan\nPerlindungan","80% coverage":"80%.","Add a leave period":"Tambah tempoh cuti","Parent taking leave":"Ibu bapa mengambil cuti","Mother":"Ibu","Other parent":"Ibu bapa lain","Benefit quota used":"Kuota manfaat digunakan","Prenatal quota":"Kuota pranatal","Mother quota":"Kuota ibu","Other-parent quota":"Kuota ibu bapa lain","Shared period":"Tempoh dikongsi","First date":"Tarikh pertama","Last date":"Tarikh terakhir","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Pengeluaran faedah, %","Calendar label":"Label kalendar","Add period to plan":"Tambah tempoh untuk merancang","Remove":"Alih keluar","Check plan":"Semak pelan","Clear plan":"Pelan yang jelas","Download calendar (.ics)":"Muat turun kalendar (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Ringkasan rancangan Norway","Total NAV period":"Jumlah tempoh NAB","Before birth":"Sebelum lahir","benefit days":"hari manfaat","weeks":"minggu","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Tinggal kuota tidak berjadual","Total days not yet assigned":"Jumlah hari belum ditetapkan","Your dated periods":"Haid bertarikh anda","Parent":"Ibu bapa","Quota":"Kuota","Calendar dates":"Tarikh kalendar","Withdrawal":"Pengeluaran","Benefit days used":"Hari manfaat digunakan","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Tambahkan tempoh bertarikh untuk melihat baki kuota dan kalendar.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Pilih butiran acara dan tambahkan sebarang tempoh yang anda ingin bandingkan.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Pelan disemak pada peranti ini. NAB memutuskan hak individu.","Period added to the plan.":"Tempoh ditambah pada pelan.","Period removed.":"Tempoh dialih keluar.","Plan cleared.":"Pelan dibersihkan.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Fail Kalendar dibuat pada peranti ini.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Semak tarikh, ibu bapa, kuota dan peratusan pengeluaran.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Bandingkan dua pilihan perlindungan","Total period":"Jumlah tempoh","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Pilihan perlindungan adalah sama untuk kedua-dua ibu bapa dan tidak boleh ditukar kemudian. Angka-angka tersebut adalah panjang tempoh, bukan anggaran pembayaran.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Entri anda kekal dalam tab penyemak imbas ini. Eksport kalendar dibuat secara tempatan apabila anda memilih Muat turun.","Assumptions used":"Andaian yang digunakan","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Hari manfaat dikira Isnin hingga Jumaat; cuti umum tidak dikecualikan secara berasingan.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Peratusan pengeluaran separa memodelkan jadual yang lebih panjang dan mengurangkan penggunaan hari manfaat. Bersetuju peratusan kerja sebenar dengan majikan dan semak NAB.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Pengeluaran serentak gabungan terhad kepada 100% dalam perancang standard ini; pengecualian berbilang kelahiran khas adalah di luar semakan ini.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"Tempoh NAV biasanya mesti digunakan sebelum kanak-kanak berumur tiga tahun, atau dalam tempoh tiga tahun selepas pemindahan penjagaan untuk anak angkat.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · peraturan faedah ibu bapa dan jadual tempoh","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Amaun asas Insurans Nasional (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · perancang faedah ibu bapa rasmi","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Buka panduan NAV untuk kes di luar perancang ini","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Tarikh acara ini di luar jadual NAV bertarikh yang disertakan di sini. Buka panduan NAV untuk versi peraturan yang berkenaan.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Versi ini memodelkan kes standard di mana kedua-dua ibu bapa telah mendapat hak. Gunakan NAV untuk situasi keluarga yang lain.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Adakah menukar bahasa halaman mengubah peraturan?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No. Antara muka boleh dibaca dalam bahasa yang berbeza, tetapi perancang ini sentiasa menggunakan jadual tempoh NAV Norway yang dinyatakan.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Adakah ini memberitahu saya sama ada NAB akan meluluskan tuntutan saya?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"No. Kelayakan dan pembayaran diputuskan oleh NAB daripada rekod individu anda. Perancang ini hanya membandingkan jadual tempoh standard dan tarikh yang anda masukkan.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Bolehkah kedua-dua ibu bapa mengambil manfaat pada masa yang sama?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Sesetengah pengaturan boleh bertindih, tetapi perancang standard mengehadkan pengeluaran gabungan kepada 100%. Kelahiran berbilang istimewa dan pengecualian lain mesti disemak dengan NAB."},"nb":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norge foreldrepenger og permisjonsplanlegger","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norge Foreldrepermisjonsplanlegger 2026 — Uker, kvoter og kalender","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planlegg norske foreldrepengeuker for fødsel eller adopsjon. Sammenlign 80% og 100% dekning, tildel hver forelders kvoter, planlegg delvis permisjon og eksporter en privat kalenderfil.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"En praktisk norsk foreldrepengeplanlegger for familier som sammenligner datoer, kvoter og tid borte fra jobb. Velg et språk for grensesnittet; reglene nedenfor forblir norske NAV-regler.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Kjører på denne enheten. Datoer og familieplandetaljer sendes ikke til en server eller lagres av dette verktøyet.","Example":"Eksempel","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"For ett barn født på1november2026, standard NAV-perioden når begge foreldrene kvalifiserer er49uker kl100% eller61uker og1dag kl80%. De80% valg sprer generelt betalinger over lengre tid; NAV sier den totale utbetalingen er omtrent lik.","How the planner works":"Hvordan planleggeren fungerer","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Sammenlign først den offisielle periodetabellen for den valgte begivenhetens dato, begivenhetstype, antall barn og dekning. Legg deretter til dine egne daterte permisjonsperioder. Hverdager forbruker fordelsdager; delvis uttak reduserer antall dager brukt per ukedag og utvider kalenderen. Huller kan representere arbeid eller ferie uten ytelsesuttak.","Common questions":"Vanlige spørsmål","Scope and limits":"Omfang og begrensninger","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Kun Norge. Dette er et planleggingshjelpemiddel, ikke et valgbarhetsvedtak, utbetalingsberegning, fastsettelse av arbeidsgiverpermisjon eller NAV-søknad. Standardtabellen forutsetter at begge foreldrene har opptjent rett. Aktivitetsregler, enforsørgersaker, tidlig fødsel, sykdom, samtidige permisjonsunntak, grenseoverskridende samordning og individualiserte inntektsberegninger kan endre resultatet; sjekk NAV for de tilfellene.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"kun norske regler · NAV periodetabell sjekket 17 oktober 2026 · språk endrer ikke land eller regler.","Family event":"Familiearrangement","Birth":"Fødsel","Adoption":"Adopsjon","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Forventet fødselsdato eller dato for omsorgsoverføring","Number of children":"Antall barn","One child":"Ett barn","Two children":"To barn","Three or more children":"Tre eller flere barn","Coverage choice":"Dekningsvalg","100% coverage":"100 % dekning","80% coverage":"80 % dekning","Add a leave period":"Legg til en permisjonsperiode","Parent taking leave":"Foreldre tar permisjon","Mother":"Mor","Other parent":"Annen forelder","Benefit quota used":"Fordelskvote brukt","Prenatal quota":"Prenatal kvote","Mother quota":"Mødrekvote","Other-parent quota":"Annen overordnet kvote","Shared period":"Delt periode","First date":"Første dato","Last date":"Siste dato","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Uttak av fordel, %","Calendar label":"Kalenderetikett","Add period to plan":"Legg til periode i planen","Remove":"Fjern","Check plan":"Sjekk plan","Clear plan":"Klar plan","Download calendar (.ics)":"Last ned kalender (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Norge plansammendrag","Total NAV period":"Total NAV-periode","Before birth":"Før fødsel","benefit days":"fordelsdager","weeks":"uker","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Uplanlagt kvote gjenstår","Total days not yet assigned":"Totalt antall dager ennå ikke tildelt","Your dated periods":"Dine daterte perioder","Parent":"Forelder","Quota":"Kvote","Calendar dates":"Kalenderdatoer","Withdrawal":"Uttak","Benefit days used":"Fordelsdager brukt","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Legg til daterte perioder for å se gjenværende kvote og kalender.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Velg hendelsesdetaljene og legg til perioder du vil sammenligne.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan sjekket på denne enheten. NAV bestemmer individuelle rettigheter.","Period added to the plan.":"Periode lagt til planen.","Period removed.":"Periode fjernet.","Plan cleared.":"Planen er slettet.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Kalenderfil opprettet på denne enheten.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Se gjennom datoene, overordnet, kvoten og uttaksprosentene.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Sammenlign de to dekningsvalgene","Total period":"Total periode","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Dekningsvalget er det samme for begge foreldrene og kan ikke endres senere. Tallene er periodelengder, ikke et utbetalingsestimat.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Oppføringene dine forblir i denne nettleserfanen. Kalendereksport opprettes lokalt når du velger Last ned.","Assumptions used":"Forutsetninger brukt","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Fordelsdager telles mandag til fredag; helligdager er ikke separat ekskludert.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"En delvis uttaksprosent modellerer en lengre tidsplan og redusert nyttedagbruk. Avtal faktisk arbeidsprosent med arbeidsgiver og sjekk NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Kombinert samtidig uttak er begrenset til 100 % i denne standardplanleggeren; spesielle flerfødselsunntak er utenfor denne kontrollen.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV-perioder skal normalt brukes før barnet fyller tre år, eller innen tre år etter omsorgsoverføring for adopsjon.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · foreldrepengerregler og periodetabeller","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Folketrygdens grunnbeløp (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · offisiell foreldrepengeplanlegger","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Åpne NAV-veiledning for saker utenfor denne planleggeren","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Denne hendelsesdatoen er utenfor de daterte NAV-tabellene som er inkludert her. Åpne NAV-veiledning for gjeldende regelversjon.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Denne versjonen modellerer standardkofferten der begge foreldrene har opptjent en rettighet. Bruk NAV til andre familiesituasjoner.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Endres reglene ved å endre sidespråket?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Nr. Grensesnittet kan leses på forskjellige språk, men denne planleggeren bruker alltid oppgitt norsk NAV periodetabell.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Sier dette meg om NAV vil godkjenne kravet mitt?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Nr. Kvalifikasjon og betaling avgjøres av NAV fra dine individuelle journaler. Denne planleggeren sammenligner bare standardperiodetabellen og datoene du angir.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Kan begge foreldrene ta fordeler samtidig?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Noen arrangementer kan overlappe hverandre, men standardplanleggeren begrenser kombinert uttak til 100%. Spesielle flerfødsler og andre unntak må sjekkes med NAV."},"nl":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Noorwegen Ouderschapsuitkering en verlofplanner","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Ouderschapsverlofplanner voor Noorwegen 2026 — Weken, quota's en kalender","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Plan Noorse ouderschapsuitkeringsweken voor geboorte of adoptie. Vergelijk de dekking 80% en 100%, wijs de quota van elke ouder toe, plan gedeeltelijk verlof en exporteer een privéagendabestand.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Een praktische Noorse ouderschapsuitkeringsplanner voor gezinnen die data, quota's en vrije tijd vergelijkt. Kies een taal voor de interface; de onderstaande regels blijven de Noorse NAV-regels.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Werkt op dit apparaat. Datums en gezinsabonnementgegevens worden niet naar een server verzonden of door deze tool opgeslagen.","Example":"Voorbeeld","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Voor één kind geboren op 1 november 2026 is de standaard NAV-periode waarin beide ouders in aanmerking komen 49 weken bij 100% of 61 weken en 1 dag bij 80%. Met de keuze 80% worden betalingen over het algemeen over langere tijd gespreid; NAV zegt dat de totale betaling ongeveer gelijk is.","How the planner works":"Hoe de planner werkt","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Vergelijk eerst de officiële periodetabel voor de geselecteerde evenementdatum, evenementtype, aantal kinderen en dekking. Voeg dan uw eigen gedateerde verlofperiodes toe. Weekdagen verbruiken voordeeldagen; gedeeltelijke opname vermindert het aantal gebruikte dagen per weekdag en verlengt de kalender. Hiaten kunnen werk of vakantie vertegenwoordigen zonder intrekking van de uitkering.","Common questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Scope and limits":"Reikwijdte en limieten","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Alleen Noorwegen. Dit is een planningshulpmiddel, geen beslissing om in aanmerking te komen, een berekening van de uitkering, het vaststellen van verlofrechten door de werkgever of een NAV-aanvraag. In de standaardtabel wordt ervan uitgegaan dat beide ouders een recht hebben verdiend. Activiteitenregels, eenoudergevallen, vroeggeboorte, ziekte, gelijktijdige verlofuitzonderingen, grensoverschrijdende coördinatie en geïndividualiseerde inkomensberekeningen kunnen het resultaat veranderen; controleer NAV voor die gevallen.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Alleen Noorse regels · NAV-periodetabel gecontroleerd 17 Oktober 2026 · Taal verandert het land of de regels niet.","Family event":"Familie-evenement","Birth":"Geboorte","Adoption":"Adoptie","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Verwachte geboorte- of zorgoverdrachtdatum","Number of children":"Aantal kinderen","One child":"Eén kind","Two children":"Twee kinderen","Three or more children":"Drie of meer kinderen","Coverage choice":"Dekkingskeuze","100% coverage":"100% dekking","80% coverage":"80% dekking","Add a leave period":"Voeg een verlofperiode toe","Parent taking leave":"Ouder neemt verlof","Mother":"Moeder","Other parent":"Andere ouder","Benefit quota used":"Voordeelquotum gebruikt","Prenatal quota":"Prenatale quota","Mother quota":"Moederquotum","Other-parent quota":"quotum voor andere ouders","Shared period":"Gedeelde periode","First date":"Eerste date","Last date":"Laatste datum","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Voordeelopname, %","Calendar label":"Kalenderlabel","Add period to plan":"Periode toevoegen aan planning","Remove":"Verwijderen","Check plan":"Controleer plan","Clear plan":"Duidelijke planning","Download calendar (.ics)":"Agenda downloaden (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Samenvatting van het plan voor Noorwegen","Total NAV period":"Totale NAV-periode","Before birth":"Voor de geboorte","benefit days":"uitkeringsdagen","weeks":"weken","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Ongeplande quota resterend","Total days not yet assigned":"Totaal nog niet toegewezen dagen","Your dated periods":"Je gedateerde menstruaties","Parent":"Ouder","Quota":"Quotum","Calendar dates":"Kalenderdata","Withdrawal":"Intrekking","Benefit days used":"Verbruikte voordeeldagen","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Voeg gedateerde perioden toe om de resterende quota en kalender te zien.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Kies de evenementdetails en voeg eventuele periodes toe die u wilt vergelijken.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan gecontroleerd op dit apparaat. NAV beslist over individuele rechten.","Period added to the plan.":"Periode toegevoegd aan het plan.","Period removed.":"Periode verwijderd.","Plan cleared.":"Plan gewist.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Agendabestand gemaakt op dit apparaat.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Bekijk de data, parent, quota en opnamepercentages.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Vergelijk de twee dekkingskeuzes","Total period":"Totale periode","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"De dekkingskeuze is voor beide ouders hetzelfde en kan later niet meer gewijzigd worden. De cijfers zijn periodelengtes en geen schatting van de uitbetaling.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Uw invoer blijft op dit browsertabblad staan. De agenda-export wordt lokaal gemaakt als u Downloaden kiest.","Assumptions used":"Gebruikte aannames","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Voordeeldagen worden geteld van maandag tot en met vrijdag; Feestdagen worden niet afzonderlijk uitgesloten.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Een gedeeltelijk opnamepercentage modelleert een langer schema en een verminderd gebruik van voordeeldagen. Spreek het feitelijke werkpercentage af met de werkgever en controleer de NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Gecombineerde gelijktijdige opname is in deze standaardplanner beperkt tot 100%; speciale uitzonderingen op het gebied van meerlingen vallen buiten deze controle.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV-perioden moeten normaal gesproken worden gebruikt voordat het kind drie jaar wordt, of binnen drie jaar na de zorgoverdracht voor adoptie.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · Regels voor ouderschapsuitkeringen en periodetabellen","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Basisbedrag volksverzekeringen (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · officiële ouderschapsuitkeringsplanner","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Open NAV begeleiding voor zaken buiten deze planner","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Deze evenementdatum valt buiten de gedateerde NAV-tabellen die hier zijn opgenomen. Open NAV-richtlijnen voor de toepasselijke regelversie.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Deze versie modelleert het standaardgeval waarin beide ouders een recht hebben verdiend. Gebruik NAV voor andere gezinssituaties.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Verandert het veranderen van de paginataal de regels?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Nr. De interface is in verschillende talen te lezen, maar deze planner hanteert altijd de aangegeven Noorse NAV-periodetabel.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Vertelt dit mij of NAV mijn claim zal goedkeuren?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Nr. Of u in aanmerking komt en wordt betaald, wordt door NAV bepaald op basis van uw individuele gegevens. Deze planner vergelijkt alleen de standaard periodetabel en datums die u invoert.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Kunnen beide ouders tegelijkertijd een uitkering krijgen?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Sommige regelingen kunnen elkaar overlappen, maar de standaardplanner beperkt de gecombineerde opname tot 100%. Speciale meerlingen en andere uitzonderingen moeten bij NAV worden gecontroleerd."},"pl":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norweskie narzędzie do planowania świadczeń rodzicielskich i urlopów","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norwegia Planer urlopów rodzicielskich 2026 — tygodnie, limity i kalendarz","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Zaplanuj norweskie tygodnie świadczeń rodzicielskich z tytułu porodu lub adopcji. Porównaj pokrycie 80% i 100%, przypisz limity każdemu z rodziców, zaplanuj częściowy urlop i wyeksportuj prywatny plik kalendarza.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Praktyczny norweski planer świadczeń rodzicielskich dla rodzin porównujący daty, limity i czas wolny od pracy. Wybierz język interfejsu; poniższe zasady pozostają przepisami norweskiej NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Działa na tym urządzeniu. Daty i szczegóły planu rodzinnego nie są wysyłane na serwer ani zapisywane przez to narzędzie.","Example":"Przykład","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"W przypadku jednego dziecka urodzonego 1 listopada 2026 standardowy okres NAV, w którym kwalifikują się oboje rodzice, wynosi 49 tygodni przy 100% lub 61 tygodni i 1 dnia przy 80%. Wybór 80% generalnie rozkłada płatności na dłuższy okres; NAV twierdzi, że całkowita płatność jest w przybliżeniu równa.","How the planner works":"Jak działa planista","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Najpierw porównaj oficjalną tabelę okresów dla wybranej daty wydarzenia, rodzaju wydarzenia, liczby dzieci i zasięgu. Następnie dodaj własne datowane okresy urlopu. Dni powszednie pochłaniają dni świadczeń; częściowe wycofanie zmniejsza liczbę wykorzystanych dni w tygodniu i wydłuża kalendarz. Luki mogą oznaczać pracę lub urlop bez wycofania świadczenia.","Common questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Scope and limits":"Zakres i ograniczenia","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Tylko Norwegia. Jest to pomoc w planowaniu, a nie decyzja o uprawnieniach, obliczenie wypłaty świadczenia, ustalenie prawa pracodawcy do urlopu lub wniosek o NAV. W standardowej tabeli zakłada się, że oboje rodzice nabyli prawo. Zasady dotyczące działalności, przypadki samotnego rodzica, wczesny poród, choroba, wyjątki w zakresie równoczesnych urlopów, koordynacja transgraniczna i zindywidualizowane obliczanie dochodów mogą zmienić wynik; sprawdź NAV pod kątem tych przypadków.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Tylko reguły norweskie · Sprawdzono tabelę okresów NAV 17 Październik 2026 · Język nie zmienia kraju ani zasad.","Family event":"Wydarzenie rodzinne","Birth":"Narodziny","Adoption":"Adopcja","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Oczekiwana data urodzenia lub przekazania opieki","Number of children":"Liczba dzieci","One child":"Jedno dziecko","Two children":"Dwoje dzieci","Three or more children":"Troje lub więcej dzieci","Coverage choice":"Wybór zasięgu","100% coverage":"100% pokrycia","80% coverage":"80% pokrycia","Add a leave period":"Dodaj okres urlopu","Parent taking leave":"Rodzic bierze urlop","Mother":"Matka","Other parent":"Inny element nadrzędny","Benefit quota used":"Wykorzystano limit świadczeń","Prenatal quota":"Kwota prenatalna","Mother quota":"Kwota macierzysta","Other-parent quota":"Limit innego elementu nadrzędnego","Shared period":"Wspólny okres","First date":"Pierwsza randka","Last date":"Ostatnia data","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Wycofanie świadczenia,%","Calendar label":"Etykieta kalendarza","Add period to plan":"Dodaj okres do planu","Remove":"Usuń","Check plan":"Sprawdź plan","Clear plan":"Przejrzysty plan","Download calendar (.ics)":"Pobierz kalendarz (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Podsumowanie planu w Norwegii","Total NAV period":"Całkowity okres NAV","Before birth":"Przed porodem","benefit days":"dni korzyści","weeks":"tygodnie","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Pozostał niezaplanowany limit","Total days not yet assigned":"Nie przydzielono jeszcze wszystkich dni","Your dated periods":"Twoje datowane okresy","Parent":"Nadrzędny","Quota":"Przydział","Calendar dates":"Daty kalendarzowe","Withdrawal":"Wycofanie","Benefit days used":"Wykorzystane dni świadczeń","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Dodaj datowane okresy, aby zobaczyć pozostały limit i kalendarz.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Wybierz szczegóły wydarzenia i dodaj okresy, które chcesz porównać.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan sprawdzony na tym urządzeniu. NAV decyduje o prawach jednostki.","Period added to the plan.":"Okres dodany do planu.","Period removed.":"Usunięto kropkę.","Plan cleared.":"Plan wyczyszczony.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Plik kalendarza utworzony na tym urządzeniu.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Przejrzyj daty, elementy nadrzędne, kwoty i procenty wypłat.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Porównaj dwie możliwości pokrycia","Total period":"Całkowity okres","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Wybór zakresu ubezpieczenia jest taki sam dla obojga rodziców i nie można go później zmienić. Liczby dotyczą długości okresów, a nie szacunkowej wypłaty.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Twoje wpisy pozostają na tej karcie przeglądarki. Eksport kalendarza jest tworzony lokalnie po wybraniu opcji Pobierz.","Assumptions used":"Zastosowano założenia","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Dni świadczeń liczone są od poniedziałku do piątku; święta państwowe nie są osobno wyłączone.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Procent częściowej wypłaty modeluje dłuższy harmonogram i zmniejszone wykorzystanie dni świadczeń. Uzgodnij z pracodawcą faktyczny procent pracy i sprawdź NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"W tym standardowym planiście łączne jednoczesne wypłaty są ograniczone do 100%; specjalne wyjątki związane z porodami mnogimi nie podlegają tej kontroli.\nOkresy","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV zwykle należy wykorzystać przed ukończeniem przez dziecko trzech lat lub w ciągu trzech lat po przekazaniu opieki do adopcji.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · Regulamin świadczeń rodzicielskich i tabele okresowe","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Podstawowa kwota ubezpieczenia społecznego (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · oficjalny planista świadczeń rodzicielskich","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Wytyczne Open NAV dla przypadków spoza tego planisty","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Data tego zdarzenia jest poza zawartymi tutaj tabelami NAV z datą. Otwórz wytyczne NAV dla obowiązującej wersji przepisów.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Ta wersja modeluje standardowy przypadek, w którym oboje rodzice nabyli prawo. Używaj NAV w innych sytuacjach rodzinnych.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Czy zmiana języka strony zmienia zasady?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Nie. Interfejs można czytać w różnych językach, ale ten planista zawsze stosuje podaną tabelę okresów norweskiej NAV.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Czy to informuje mnie, czy NAV zatwierdzi moje roszczenie?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Nie. O kwalifikowalności i płatności decyduje NAV na podstawie indywidualnych danych. Ten planista porównuje jedynie standardową tabelę okresów i wprowadzone przez Ciebie daty.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Czy oboje rodzice mogą pobierać świadczenia w tym samym czasie?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Niektóre ustalenia mogą się pokrywać, ale standardowy planista ogranicza łączną wypłatę do 100%. Specjalne porody mnogie i inne wyjątki należy sprawdzić w NAV."},"pt":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Planejador de licenças e benefícios parentais da Noruega","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Planejador de licença parental da Noruega 2026 — Semanas, cotas e calendário","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planeje semanas de benefícios parentais noruegueses para nascimento ou adoção. Compare a cobertura 80% e 100%, atribua as cotas de cada pai, agende férias parciais e exporte um arquivo de calendário privado.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Um planejador prático de benefícios parentais norueguês para famílias que compara datas, cotas e tempo fora do trabalho. Escolha um idioma para a interface; as regras abaixo permanecem como regras NAV norueguesas.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Executa neste dispositivo. Datas e detalhes do plano familiar não são enviados para um servidor nem salvos por esta ferramenta.","Example":"Exemplo","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Para uma criança nascida em 1 novembro 2026, o período NAV padrão quando ambos os pais se qualificam é 49 semanas a 100% ou 61 semanas e 1 dias a 80%. A opção 80% geralmente distribui os pagamentos por um período mais longo; NAV diz que o pagamento total é aproximadamente igual.","How the planner works":"Como funciona o planner","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Primeiro compare a tabela de período oficial para a data do evento selecionado, tipo de evento, número de filhos e cobertura. Em seguida, adicione seus próprios períodos de licença datados. Os dias da semana consomem dias de benefício; a retirada parcial reduz os dias utilizados por dia da semana e amplia o calendário. As lacunas podem representar trabalho ou férias sem saque do benefício.","Common questions":"Perguntas comuns","Scope and limits":"Escopo e limites","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Somente Noruega. Este é um auxílio de planejamento, não uma decisão de elegibilidade, cálculo de pagamento de benefícios, determinação de direitos de licença do empregador ou aplicação de NAV. A tabela padrão pressupõe que ambos os pais conquistaram um direito. Regras de atividade, casos de monoparentalidade, nascimento prematuro, doença, exceções simultâneas de licença, coordenação transfronteiriça e cálculos de rendimentos individualizados podem alterar o resultado; verifique o NAV para esses casos.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Somente regras norueguesas · Tabela de período NAV verificada 17 Outubro 2026 · idioma não altera o país ou as regras.","Family event":"Evento familiar","Birth":"Nascimento","Adoption":"Adoção","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Data prevista de nascimento ou transferência de cuidados","Number of children":"Número de filhos","One child":"Um filho","Two children":"Dois filhos","Three or more children":"Três ou mais filhos","Coverage choice":"Escolha de cobertura","100% coverage":"100% de cobertura","80% coverage":"80% de cobertura","Add a leave period":"Adicionar um período de licença","Parent taking leave":"Pais em licença","Mother":"Mãe","Other parent":"Outro pai","Benefit quota used":"Cota de benefícios usada","Prenatal quota":"Cota pré-natal","Mother quota":"Cota mãe","Other-parent quota":"Cota de outros pais","Shared period":"Período compartilhado","First date":"Primeiro encontro","Last date":"Última data","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Retirada de benefício, %","Calendar label":"Etiqueta de calendário","Add period to plan":"Adicionar período ao plano","Remove":"Remover","Check plan":"Verificar plano","Clear plan":"Plano claro","Download calendar (.ics)":"Baixar calendário (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Resumo do plano da Noruega","Total NAV period":"Período total de NAV","Before birth":"Antes do nascimento","benefit days":"dias de benefício","weeks":"semanas","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Cota não programada restante","Total days not yet assigned":"Total de dias ainda não atribuídos","Your dated periods":"Seus períodos datados","Parent":"Pai","Quota":"Cota","Calendar dates":"Datas do calendário","Withdrawal":"Retirada","Benefit days used":"Dias de benefício utilizados","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Adicione períodos datados para ver a cota e o calendário restantes.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Escolha os detalhes do evento e adicione os períodos que deseja comparar.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plano verificado neste dispositivo. NAV decide os direitos individuais.","Period added to the plan.":"Período adicionado ao plano.","Period removed.":"Período removido.","Plan cleared.":"Plano liberado.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Arquivo de calendário criado neste dispositivo.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Revise as datas, pai, cota e porcentagens de retirada.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Compare as duas opções de cobertura","Total period":"Período total","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"A escolha da cobertura é a mesma para ambos os pais e não pode ser alterada posteriormente. Os números são durações de períodos, não uma estimativa de pagamento.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Suas entradas permanecem nesta aba do navegador. A exportação do calendário é criada localmente quando você escolhe Baixar.","Assumptions used":"Suposições usadas","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Os dias de benefício são contados de segunda a sexta; feriados não são excluídos separadamente.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Uma porcentagem de retirada parcial modela um cronograma mais longo e uso reduzido em dias de benefício. Combine a porcentagem real de trabalho com o empregador e verifique o NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"A retirada simultânea combinada está limitada a 100% neste planejador standard; exceções especiais de nascimentos múltiplos estão fora desta verificação.\nOs períodos","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV normalmente devem ser usados ​​antes da criança completar três anos ou dentro de três anos após a transferência de cuidados para adoção.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · regras de benefícios parentais e tabelas de período","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Valor básico do Seguro Nacional (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · planejador oficial de benefícios parentais","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Orientação NAV aberta para casos fora deste planejador","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Esta data do evento está fora das tabelas NAV datadas incluídas aqui. Orientação NAV aberta para a versão da regra aplicável.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Esta versão modela o caso padrão em que ambos os pais conquistaram um direito. Use NAV para outras situações familiares.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Alterar o idioma da página altera as regras?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Não. A interface pode ser lida em diferentes idiomas, mas este planejador sempre aplica a tabela de período NAV norueguesa indicada.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Isso me diz se a NAV aprovará minha reivindicação?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Não. A elegibilidade e o pagamento são decididos pela NAV a partir de seus registros individuais. Este planejador compara apenas a tabela de período padrão e as datas inseridas.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Ambos os pais podem receber benefícios ao mesmo tempo?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Alguns arranjos podem se sobrepor, mas o planejador padrão limita a retirada combinada a 100%. Nascimentos múltiplos especiais e outras exceções devem ser verificadas com o NAV."},"ru":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Родительское пособие и планировщик отпусков в Норвегии","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Планировщик отпусков по уходу за ребенком в Норвегии 2026 — недели, квоты и календарь","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Запланируйте норвежские недели родительских пособий в случае рождения или усыновления. Сравните покрытие 80% и 100%, назначьте квоты каждому родителю, запланируйте частичный отпуск и экспортируйте файл личного календаря.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Практический норвежский планировщик родительских пособий для семей, сравнивающий даты, квоты и время отсутствия на работе. Выберите язык интерфейса; приведенные ниже правила остаются норвежскими правилами NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Работает на этом устройстве. Даты и сведения о семейном плане не отправляются на сервер и не сохраняются с помощью этого инструмента.","Example":"Пример","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Для одного ребенка, родившегося 1 ноября 2026, стандартный период NAV, когда оба родителя соответствуют критериям, составляет 49 недель в 100% или 61 недель и 1 дней в 80%. Выбор 80% обычно распределяет платежи на более длительный период времени; В NAV говорят, что общая сумма выплат примерно равна.","How the planner works":"Как работает планировщик","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Сначала сравните официальную таблицу периодов для выбранной даты мероприятия, типа мероприятия, количества детей и охвата. Затем добавьте свои собственные периоды отпуска. Будние дни поглощают дни льгот; частичный вывод сокращает количество использованных дней в будние дни и расширяет календарь. Пробелы могут обозначать работу или отпуск без выплаты пособия.","Common questions":"Общие вопросы","Scope and limits":"Объем и ограничения","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Только для Норвегии. Это помощь при планировании, а не решение о праве на пособие, расчет размера пособия, определение права на отпуск у работодателя или заявление NAV. Стандартная таблица предполагает, что оба родителя заслужили право. Правила деятельности, случаи с одним родителем, ранние роды, болезни, исключения из одновременного отпуска, трансграничная координация и индивидуальный расчет доходов могут изменить результат; проверьте NAV для этих случаев.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Только норвежские правила · Таблица периодов NAV проверена 17 Октябрь 2026 · язык не меняет страну или правила.","Family event":"Семейное мероприятие","Birth":"Рождение","Adoption":"Принятие","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Ожидаемая дата рождения или передачи опеки","Number of children":"Количество детей","One child":"Один ребенок","Two children":"Двое детей","Three or more children":"Трое и более детей","Coverage choice":"Выбор покрытия","100% coverage":"100% покрытия","80% coverage":"80% покрытия","Add a leave period":"Добавить период отпуска","Parent taking leave":"Родитель уходит в отпуск","Mother":"Мать","Other parent":"Другой родительский элемент","Benefit quota used":"Использованная квота льгот","Prenatal quota":"Пренатальная квота","Mother quota":"Материнская квота","Other-parent quota":"Квота для другого родителя","Shared period":"Общий период","First date":"Первое свидание","Last date":"Последняя дата","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Вывод пособия, %","Calendar label":"Ярлык календаря","Add period to plan":"Добавить период в план","Remove":"Удалить","Check plan":"Проверить план","Clear plan":"Четкий план","Download calendar (.ics)":"Загрузить календарь (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Сводка плана Норвегии","Total NAV period":"Общий период NAV","Before birth":"До рождения","benefit days":"выгодные дни","weeks":"недели","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Оставшаяся незапланированная квота","Total days not yet assigned":"Всего еще не назначенных дней","Your dated periods":"Ваши месячные","Parent":"Родительский","Quota":"Квота","Calendar dates":"Календарные даты","Withdrawal":"Вывод","Benefit days used":"Использованные льготные дни","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Добавьте датированные периоды, чтобы увидеть оставшуюся квоту и календарь.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Выберите детали события и добавьте периоды, которые хотите сравнить.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"План проверен на этом устройстве. NAV решает индивидуальные права.","Period added to the plan.":"Период добавлен в план.","Period removed.":"Точка удалена.","Plan cleared.":"План очищен.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Файл календаря, созданный на этом устройстве.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Просмотрите даты, родительскую базу, квоту и процент вывода средств.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Сравните два варианта покрытия","Total period":"Общий период","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Выбор покрытия одинаков для обоих родителей и не может быть изменен позднее. Цифры представляют собой продолжительность периода, а не оценку выплат.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Ваши записи останутся на этой вкладке браузера. Экспорт календаря создается локально, когда вы выбираете «Загрузить».","Assumptions used":"Использованные предположения","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Дни льгот учитываются с понедельника по пятницу; праздничные дни отдельно не исключаются.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Процент частичного снятия средств моделирует более длительный график и сокращение использования льготных дней. Согласуйте фактический процент работы с работодателем и проверьте NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"В этом стандартном планировщике комбинированный одновременный вывод ограничен 100%; особые исключения, связанные с рождением нескольких детей, не входят в эту проверку.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV периоды обычно необходимо использовать до того, как ребенку исполнится три года, или в течение трех лет после передачи под опеку на усыновление.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · правила родительских пособий и таблицы периодов","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Базовая сумма национального страхования (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · официальный планировщик родительских пособий","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Открыть руководство по NAV для случаев, не входящих в этот планировщик","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Дата этого события находится за пределами включенных здесь датированных таблиц NAV. Откройте руководство по NAV для применимой версии правила.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Эта версия моделирует стандартный случай, когда оба родителя имеют право. Используйте NAV для других семейных ситуаций.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Изменяет ли изменение языка страницы правила?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Нет. Интерфейс можно читать на разных языках, но в этом планировщике всегда применяется указанная норвежская таблица периодов NAV.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Означает ли это, что NAV одобрит мое заявление?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Нет. Право на участие и оплата определяются NAV на основании ваших индивидуальных записей. Этот планировщик сравнивает только стандартную таблицу периодов и введенные вами даты.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Могут ли оба родителя получать пособие одновременно?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Некоторые соглашения могут перекрываться, но стандартный планировщик ограничивает комбинированный вывод 100%. Особые случаи многоплодия и другие исключения необходимо уточнять в NAV."},"sv":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norge föräldrapenning och ledighetsplanerare","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norge Föräldraledighetsplanerare 2026 — veckor, kvoter och kalender","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Planera norska föräldrapenningsveckor för födelse eller adoption. Jämför 80% och 100% täckning, tilldela varje förälders kvoter, schemalägg partiell ledighet och exportera en privat kalenderfil.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"En praktisk norsk föräldrapenningsplanerare för familjer som jämför datum, kvoter och tid borta från jobbet. Välj ett språk för gränssnittet; reglerna nedan förblir norska NAV-regler.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Körs på den här enheten. Datum och familjeplansdetaljer skickas inte till en server eller sparas av det här verktyget.","Example":"Exempel","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"För ett barn född på1november2026, standard NAV-perioden när båda föräldrarna kvalificerar sig är49veckor kl100% eller61veckor och1dag kl80%. De80% val sprider i allmänhet betalningar över längre tid; NAV säger att den totala betalningen är ungefär lika stor.","How the planner works":"Hur planeraren fungerar","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Jämför först den officiella periodtabellen för valt evenemangsdatum, evenemangstyp, antal barn och täckning. Lägg sedan till dina egna daterade ledighetsperioder. Vardagar konsumerar förmånsdagar; partiellt uttag minskar antalet använda dagar per vardag och förlänger kalendern. Luckor kan representera arbete eller semester utan förmånsuttag.","Common questions":"Vanliga frågor","Scope and limits":"Omfattning och begränsningar","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Endast Norge. Detta är ett planeringsstöd, inte ett behörighetsbeslut, beräkning av förmånsbetalning, fastställande av arbetsgivarens ledighet eller NAV-ansökan. Standardtabellen förutsätter att båda föräldrarna har förtjänat en rättighet. Aktivitetsregler, enförälderfall, tidig födsel, sjukdom, samtidiga ledighetsundantag, gränsöverskridande samordning och individualiserade inkomstberäkningar kan förändra resultatet; kolla NAV för de fallen.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Endast norska regler · NAV periodtabell kontrollerad 17 Oktober 2026 · språket ändrar inte landet eller reglerna.","Family event":"Familjeevenemang","Birth":"Födelse","Adoption":"Adoption","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Förväntat födelse- eller vårdöverlåtelsedatum","Number of children":"Antal barn","One child":"Ett barn","Two children":"Två barn","Three or more children":"Tre eller fler barn","Coverage choice":"Täckningsval","100% coverage":"100 % täckning","80% coverage":"80 % täckning","Add a leave period":"Lägg till en ledighetsperiod","Parent taking leave":"Förälder tar ledigt","Mother":"Mamma","Other parent":"Annan förälder","Benefit quota used":"Använd förmånskvot","Prenatal quota":"Prenatal kvot","Mother quota":"Mödrakvot","Other-parent quota":"Andra förälderkvot","Shared period":"Delad period","First date":"Första dejten","Last date":"Sista datum","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Förmånsuttag, %","Calendar label":"Kalenderetikett","Add period to plan":"Lägg till period i planen","Remove":"Ta bort","Check plan":"Kontrollera plan","Clear plan":"Klar plan","Download calendar (.ics)":"Ladda ner kalender (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Norge plansammanfattning","Total NAV period":"Total NAV-period","Before birth":"Före födseln","benefit days":"förmånsdagar","weeks":"veckor","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Oschemalagd kvot kvar","Total days not yet assigned":"Totalt antal dagar ännu inte tilldelade","Your dated periods":"Dina daterade mens","Parent":"Förälder","Quota":"Kvot","Calendar dates":"Kalenderdatum","Withdrawal":"Uttag","Benefit days used":"Förmånsdagar används","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Lägg till daterade perioder för att se den återstående kvoten och kalendern.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Välj händelsedetaljer och lägg till eventuella perioder du vill jämföra.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan kontrollerad på den här enheten. NAV avgör individuella rättigheter.","Period added to the plan.":"Period har lagts till i planen.","Period removed.":"Perioden har tagits bort.","Plan cleared.":"Planen rensades.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Kalenderfil skapad på den här enheten.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Granska datum, förälder, kvot och uttagsprocent.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Jämför de två täckningsalternativen","Total period":"Total period","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Täckningsvalet är detsamma för båda föräldrarna och kan inte ändras senare. Siffrorna är periodlängder, inte en utbetalningsuppskattning.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Dina poster stannar på den här webbläsarfliken. Kalenderexport skapas lokalt när du väljer Ladda ner.","Assumptions used":"Antagna antaganden","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Förmånsdagar räknas måndag till fredag; helgdagar är inte särskilt undantagna.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"En partiell uttagsprocent modellerar ett längre schema och minskad förmånsdagsanvändning. Kom överens om den faktiska arbetsprocenten med arbetsgivaren och kontrollera NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Kombinerat samtidigt uttag är begränsat till 100% i denna standardplanerare; särskilda undantag för flera födslar ligger utanför denna kontroll.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV-perioder ska normalt användas innan barnet fyller tre år, eller inom tre år efter vårdöverföring för adoption.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · regler för föräldrapenning och periodtabeller","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Folkförsäkringens grundbelopp (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · officiell föräldrapenningsplanerare","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Öppna NAV-vägledning för ärenden utanför denna planerare","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Detta händelsedatum ligger utanför de daterade NAV-tabellerna som ingår här. Öppna NAV-vägledning för den tillämpliga regelversionen.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Denna version modellerar standardfallet där båda föräldrarna har förtjänat en rättighet. Använd NAV för andra familjesituationer.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Ändrar ändring av sidspråket reglerna?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Nr. Gränssnittet kan läsas på olika språk, men denna planerare tillämpar alltid den angivna norska NAV-periodtabellen.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Säger detta mig om NAV kommer att godkänna mitt krav?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Nr. Behörighet och betalning bestäms av NAV från dina individuella register. Denna planerare jämför bara standardperiodtabellen och datum du anger.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Kan båda föräldrarna ta ut förmåner samtidigt?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Vissa arrangemang kan överlappa varandra, men standardplaneraren begränsar kombinerat uttag till 100%. Särskilda flerbarnsfödslar och andra undantag måste kontrolleras med NAV."},"sw":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norway Faida ya Wazazi na Mpangaji wa Kuondoka","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Mpangaji wa Likizo ya Wazazi wa Norwe 2026 — Wiki, Viwango na Kalenda","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Panga wiki za faida za wazazi za Norway kwa kuzaliwa au kuasili. Linganisha huduma ya 80% na 100%, weka upendeleo wa kila mzazi, ratibu likizo ya sehemu na utume faili ya kalenda ya faragha.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Mpangaji wa manufaa wa wazazi wa Kinorwe kwa ajili ya familia akilinganisha tarehe, viwango na muda wa mbali na kazi. Chagua lugha ya kiolesura; sheria zilizo hapa chini zinasalia kuwa sheria za NAV za Norway.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Hufanya kazi kwenye kifaa hiki. Tarehe na maelezo ya mpango wa familia hayatumwi kwa seva au kuhifadhiwa na zana hii.","Example":"Mfano","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Kwa mtoto mmoja aliyezaliwa tarehe 1 Novemba 2026, muda wa kawaida wa NAV wazazi wote wawili wanapohitimu ni wiki 49 katika 100% au wiki 61 na siku 1 kwa 80%. Chaguo la 80% kwa ujumla hueneza malipo kwa muda mrefu; NAV inasema jumla ya malipo ni takriban sawa.","How the planner works":"Jinsi mpangaji anavyofanya kazi","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Kwanza linganisha jedwali rasmi la kipindi kwa tarehe ya tukio iliyochaguliwa, aina ya tukio, idadi ya watoto na matukio. Kisha ongeza vipindi vyako vya likizo vya tarehe. Siku za wiki hutumia siku za faida; uondoaji wa sehemu hupunguza siku zinazotumiwa kwa siku ya wiki na kupanua kalenda. Mapengo yanaweza kuwakilisha kazi au likizo bila kuondolewa kwa faida.","Common questions":"Maswali ya kawaida","Scope and limits":"Upeo na mipaka","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Norway pekee. Huu ni usaidizi wa kupanga, si uamuzi wa kustahiki, hesabu ya malipo ya manufaa, uamuzi wa haki za kuondoka kwa mwajiri au ombi la NAV. Jedwali la kawaida huchukulia kwamba wazazi wote wawili wamepata haki. Sheria za shughuli, kesi za mzazi mmoja, kuzaliwa mapema, ugonjwa, vighairi vya kuondoka kwa wakati mmoja, uratibu wa mpaka na hesabu za mapato ya kibinafsi zinaweza kubadilisha matokeo; angalia NAV kwa kesi hizo.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Sheria za Norway pekee · Jedwali la kipindi la NAV limechaguliwa 17 Oktoba 2026 · lugha haibadilishi nchi au sheria.","Family event":"Tukio la familia","Birth":"Kuzaliwa","Adoption":"Kupitishwa","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Tarehe inayotarajiwa ya kuzaliwa au uhamisho wa matunzo","Number of children":"Idadi ya watoto","One child":"Mtoto mmoja","Two children":"Watoto wawili","Three or more children":"Watoto watatu au zaidi","Coverage choice":"Chaguo la chanjo","100% coverage":"100% chanjo","80% coverage":"80% chanjo","Add a leave period":"Ongeza muda wa likizo","Parent taking leave":"Mzazi anachukua likizo","Mother":"Mama","Other parent":"Mzazi mwingine","Benefit quota used":"Kiwango cha manufaa kimetumika","Prenatal quota":"Kiwango cha ujauzito","Mother quota":"Kiwango cha mama","Other-parent quota":"Kiwango cha mzazi mwingine","Shared period":"Kipindi cha pamoja","First date":"Tarehe ya kwanza","Last date":"Tarehe ya mwisho","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Uondoaji wa faida, %","Calendar label":"Lebo ya Kalenda","Add period to plan":"Ongeza kipindi ili kupanga","Remove":"Ondoa","Check plan":"Angalia mpango","Clear plan":"Mpango wazi","Download calendar (.ics)":"Pakua kalenda (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Muhtasari wa mpango wa Norwe","Total NAV period":"Jumla ya kipindi cha NAV","Before birth":"Kabla ya kuzaliwa","benefit days":"siku za manufaa","weeks":"wiki","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Kiasi ambacho hakijaratibiwa kimesalia","Total days not yet assigned":"Jumla ya siku bado haijakabidhiwa","Your dated periods":"Vipindi vyako vya tarehe","Parent":"Mzazi","Quota":"Nafasi","Calendar dates":"Tarehe za Kalenda","Withdrawal":"Kujitoa","Benefit days used":"Siku za manufaa zimetumika","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Ongeza vipindi vya tarehe ili kuona sehemu na kalenda iliyosalia.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Chagua maelezo ya tukio na uongeze vipindi vyovyote unavyotaka kulinganisha.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan imeangaliwa kwenye kifaa hiki. NAV huamua haki za mtu binafsi.","Period added to the plan.":"Kipindi kimeongezwa kwenye mpango.","Period removed.":"Kipindi kimeondolewa.","Plan cleared.":"Mpango umefutwa.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Faili ya Kalenda iliyoundwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Kagua tarehe, mzazi, asilimia ya kiasi na asilimia ya uondoaji.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Linganisha chaguo mbili za chanjo","Total period":"Jumla ya kipindi","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Chaguo la huduma ni sawa kwa wazazi wote wawili na haliwezi kubadilishwa baadaye. Takwimu ni urefu wa kipindi, si makadirio ya malipo.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Maingizo yako yasalie kwenye kichupo hiki cha kivinjari. Uhamishaji wa kalenda huundwa ndani ya nchi unapochagua Pakua.","Assumptions used":"Mawazo yaliyotumika","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Siku za manufaa huhesabiwa Jumatatu hadi Ijumaa; sikukuu za umma hazijatengwa tofauti.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Miundo ya asilimia ya uondoaji kiasi ya ratiba ndefu na matumizi yaliyopunguzwa ya siku ya manufaa. Kubali asilimia halisi ya kazi na mwajiri na uangalie NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Uondoaji uliojumuishwa kwa wakati mmoja umezuiwa kwa 100% katika mpangilio huu wa kawaida; vighairi maalum vya kuzaliwa mara nyingi viko nje ya hundi hii.\nVipindi vya","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV kwa kawaida lazima vitumike kabla mtoto hajafikisha miaka mitatu, au ndani ya miaka mitatu baada ya kuhamishwa kwa malezi ili kuasiliwa.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · sheria za manufaa ya mzazi na jedwali la muda","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Kiasi cha msingi cha Bima ya Kitaifa (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · mpangaji rasmi wa manufaa ya mzazi","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Fungua mwongozo wa NAV kwa kesi zilizo nje ya mpangilio huu","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Tarehe hii ya tukio iko nje ya majedwali ya tarehe ya NAV yaliyojumuishwa hapa. Fungua mwongozo wa NAV kwa toleo la sheria linalotumika.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Toleo hili ni mfano wa hali ya kawaida ambapo wazazi wote wawili wamepata haki. Tumia NAV kwa hali zingine za familia.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Je, kubadilisha lugha ya ukurasa hubadilisha sheria?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Na. Kiolesura kinaweza kusomwa katika lugha tofauti, lakini kipangaji hiki hutumia jedwali la muda la NAV la Norwe.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Je, hii inaniambia ikiwa NAV itaidhinisha dai langu?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Na. Kustahiki na malipo huamuliwa na NAV kutoka kwa rekodi zako binafsi. Kipanga hiki kinalinganisha jedwali la muda la kawaida pekee na tarehe unazoingiza.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Je, wazazi wote wawili wanaweza kuchukua manufaa kwa wakati mmoja?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Baadhi ya mipangilio inaweza kuingiliana, lakini mipaka ya kawaida ya kipangaji iliunganisha uondoaji hadi 100%. Vighairi maalum vya kuzaliwa mara nyingi na vingine vingine lazima vikaguliwe na NAV."},"ta":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"நார்வே பெற்றோர் நலன் மற்றும் லீவ் திட்டமிடுபவர்","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"நார்வே பெற்றோர் விடுப்பு திட்டமிடுபவர் 2026 — வாரங்கள், ஒதுக்கீடுகள் மற்றும் நாட்காட்டி","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"பிறப்பு அல்லது தத்தெடுப்புக்கான நோர்வே பெற்றோர்-பயன் வாரங்களைத் திட்டமிடுங்கள். 80% மற்றும் 100% கவரேஜை ஒப்பிடவும், ஒவ்வொரு பெற்றோரின் ஒதுக்கீட்டையும் ஒதுக்கவும், பகுதி விடுப்புகளை திட்டமிடவும் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட காலண்டர் கோப்பை ஏற்றுமதி செய்யவும்.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"குடும்பங்களுக்கான நடைமுறை நார்வேஜியன் பெற்றோர்-பயன் திட்டமிடுபவர் தேதிகள், ஒதுக்கீடுகள் மற்றும் வேலையில் இருந்து விலகி இருக்கும் நேரம் ஆகியவற்றை ஒப்பிடும். இடைமுகத்திற்கான மொழியைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்; கீழே உள்ள விதிகள் நார்வேஜியன் NAV விதிகளாகவே இருக்கும்.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"இந்த சாதனத்தில் இயங்குகிறது. தேதிகள் மற்றும் குடும்பத் திட்ட விவரங்கள் சேவையகத்திற்கு அனுப்பப்படுவதில்லை அல்லது இந்தக் கருவியால் சேமிக்கப்படாது.","Example":"உதாரணம்","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"அன்று பிறந்த ஒரு குழந்தைக்கு1நவம்பர்2026, பெற்றோர் இருவரும் தகுதிபெறும் நிலையான NAV காலம்49வாரங்களில்100% அல்லது61வாரங்கள் மற்றும்1நாள்80% தி80% தேர்வு பொதுவாக நீண்ட காலத்திற்கு பணம் செலுத்துகிறது; மொத்தக் கட்டணம் தோராயமாக சமமாக இருக்கும் என்று NAV கூறுகிறது.","How the planner works":"திட்டமிடுபவர் எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறார்","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட நிகழ்வு தேதி, நிகழ்வு வகை, குழந்தைகளின் எண்ணிக்கை மற்றும் கவரேஜ் ஆகியவற்றிற்கான அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கால அட்டவணையை முதலில் ஒப்பிடவும். பின்னர் உங்கள் சொந்த தேதியிட்ட விடுப்புக் காலங்களைச் சேர்க்கவும். வார நாட்கள் நன்மை நாட்களை நுகரும்; பகுதியளவு திரும்பப் பெறுதல் வாரத்தில் பயன்படுத்தப்படும் நாட்களைக் குறைக்கிறது மற்றும் காலெண்டரை நீட்டிக்கிறது. இடைவெளிகள் பலன் திரும்பப் பெறாமல் வேலை அல்லது விடுமுறையைக் குறிக்கும்.","Common questions":"பொதுவான கேள்விகள்","Scope and limits":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"நோர்வே மட்டும். இது ஒரு திட்டமிடல் உதவி, தகுதி முடிவு, நன்மை-கட்டணக் கணக்கீடு, முதலாளி விடுப்பு-உரிமைகள் நிர்ணயம் அல்லது NAV விண்ணப்பம் அல்ல. பெற்றோர் இருவரும் உரிமை பெற்றுள்ளனர் என்று நிலையான அட்டவணை கருதுகிறது. செயல்பாட்டு விதிகள், ஒரு பெற்றோர் வழக்குகள், ஆரம்ப பிறப்பு, நோய், ஒரே நேரத்தில் விடுப்பு விதிவிலக்குகள், எல்லை தாண்டிய ஒருங்கிணைப்பு மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட வருமான கணக்கீடுகள் முடிவை மாற்றலாம்; அந்த நிகழ்வுகளுக்கு NAV சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"நார்வேஜியன் விதிகள் மட்டும் · NAV கால அட்டவணை சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது 17 அக்டோபர் 2026 · மொழி நாடு அல்லது விதிகளை மாற்றாது.","Family event":"குடும்ப நிகழ்வு","Birth":"பிறப்பு","Adoption":"தத்தெடுப்பு","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"எதிர்பார்த்த பிறப்பு அல்லது பராமரிப்பு-பரிமாற்ற தேதி","Number of children":"குழந்தைகளின் எண்ணிக்கை","One child":"ஒரு குழந்தை","Two children":"இரண்டு குழந்தைகள்","Three or more children":"மூன்று அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட குழந்தைகள்","Coverage choice":"கவரேஜ் தேர்வு","100% coverage":"100% கவரேஜ்","80% coverage":"80% கவரேஜ்","Add a leave period":"விடுமுறை காலத்தைச் சேர்க்கவும்","Parent taking leave":"பெற்றோர் விடுப்பு எடுக்கிறார்கள்","Mother":"அம்மா","Other parent":"பிற பெற்றோர்","Benefit quota used":"பயன் ஒதுக்கீடு பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Prenatal quota":"மகப்பேறுக்கு முந்தைய ஒதுக்கீடு","Mother quota":"தாய் ஒதுக்கீடு","Other-parent quota":"பிற பெற்றோர் ஒதுக்கீடு","Shared period":"பகிரப்பட்ட காலம்","First date":"முதல் தேதி","Last date":"கடைசி தேதி","Benefit withdrawal, %":"பயன் திரும்பப் பெறுதல், %","Calendar label":"காலண்டர் லேபிள்","Add period to plan":"திட்டத்திற்கு காலத்தைச் சேர்க்கவும்","Remove":"நீக்கு","Check plan":"திட்டத்தைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்","Clear plan":"தெளிவான திட்டம்","Download calendar (.ics)":"காலண்டரைப் பதிவிறக்கு (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"நோர்வே திட்டத்தின் சுருக்கம்","Total NAV period":"மொத்த NAV காலம்","Before birth":"பிறப்பதற்கு முன்","benefit days":"பயன் நாட்கள்","weeks":"வாரங்கள்","Unscheduled quota remaining":"திட்டமிடப்படாத ஒதுக்கீடு மீதமுள்ளது","Total days not yet assigned":"மொத்த நாட்கள் இன்னும் ஒதுக்கப்படவில்லை","Your dated periods":"உங்கள் தேதியிட்ட காலங்கள்","Parent":"பெற்றோர்","Quota":"கோட்டா","Calendar dates":"காலண்டர் தேதிகள்","Withdrawal":"திரும்பப் பெறுதல்","Benefit days used":"பயன்படுத்தப்பட்ட நாட்கள்","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"மீதமுள்ள ஒதுக்கீடு மற்றும் காலெண்டரைப் பார்க்க, தேதியிட்ட காலங்களைச் சேர்க்கவும்.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"நிகழ்வு விவரங்களைத் தேர்வுசெய்து, நீங்கள் ஒப்பிட விரும்பும் எந்த காலகட்டங்களையும் சேர்க்கவும்.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் திட்டம் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது. NAV தனிப்பட்ட உரிமைகளை தீர்மானிக்கிறது.","Period added to the plan.":"திட்டத்தில் காலம் சேர்க்கப்பட்டது.","Period removed.":"காலம் அகற்றப்பட்டது.","Plan cleared.":"திட்டம் அழிக்கப்பட்டது.","Calendar file created on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் காலெண்டர் கோப்பு உருவாக்கப்பட்டது.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"தேதிகள், பெற்றோர், ஒதுக்கீடு மற்றும் திரும்பப் பெறும் சதவீதங்களை மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்.","Compare the two coverage choices":"இரண்டு கவரேஜ் தேர்வுகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Total period":"மொத்த காலம்","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"கவரேஜ் தேர்வு பெற்றோர் இருவருக்கும் ஒரே மாதிரியாக இருக்கும், பின்னர் மாற்ற முடியாது. புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் கால அளவுகள், பணம் செலுத்தும் மதிப்பீடு அல்ல.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"உங்கள் உள்ளீடுகள் இந்த உலாவி தாவலில் இருக்கும். பதிவிறக்கம் என்பதை நீங்கள் தேர்வு செய்யும் போது, ​​கேலெண்டர் ஏற்றுமதி உள்நாட்டில் உருவாக்கப்படும்.","Assumptions used":"அனுமானங்கள் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டன","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"பயன் நாட்கள் திங்கள் முதல் வெள்ளி வரை கணக்கிடப்படும்; பொது விடுமுறைகள் தனித்தனியாக விலக்கப்படவில்லை.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"ஒரு பகுதி திரும்பப் பெறுதல் சதவீதம் மாதிரிகள் நீண்ட கால அட்டவணை மற்றும் குறைக்கப்பட்ட நன்மை நாள் பயன்பாடு. முதலாளியுடன் உண்மையான வேலை சதவீதத்தை ஒப்புக்கொண்டு NAV சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"இந்த நிலையான திட்டத்தில் ஒரே நேரத்தில் திரும்பப் பெறுவது 100% மட்டுமே; சிறப்பு பல பிறப்பு விதிவிலக்குகள் இந்த சோதனைக்கு வெளியே உள்ளன.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV காலங்கள் பொதுவாக குழந்தைக்கு மூன்று வயதை அடையும் முன் அல்லது தத்தெடுப்புக்கான பராமரிப்பு மாற்றத்திற்குப் பிறகு மூன்று ஆண்டுகளுக்குள் பயன்படுத்தப்பட வேண்டும்.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · பெற்றோர் நன்மை விதிகள் மற்றும் கால அட்டவணைகள்","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · தேசிய காப்பீட்டு அடிப்படைத் தொகை (ஜி)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · அதிகாரப்பூர்வ பெற்றோர் நலன் திட்டமிடுபவர்","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"இந்த பிளானருக்கு வெளியே உள்ள வழக்குகளுக்கு NAV வழிகாட்டுதலைத் திறக்கவும்","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"இந்த நிகழ்வு தேதி இங்கு சேர்க்கப்பட்டுள்ள தேதியிட்ட NAV அட்டவணைகளுக்கு வெளியே உள்ளது. பொருந்தக்கூடிய விதி பதிப்பிற்கான NAV வழிகாட்டுதலைத் திறக்கவும்.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"இந்த பதிப்பு பெற்றோர் இருவரும் உரிமை பெற்றுள்ள நிலையான வழக்கை மாதிரியாகக் கொண்டுள்ளது. மற்ற குடும்ப சூழ்நிலைகளுக்கு NAV ஐப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"பக்க மொழியை மாற்றுவது விதிகளை மாற்றுமா?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"எண். இடைமுகத்தை வெவ்வேறு மொழிகளில் படிக்கலாம், ஆனால் இந்த திட்டமிடுபவர் எப்போதும் கூறப்பட்ட நார்வேஜியன் NAV கால அட்டவணையைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறார்.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"என் கோரிக்கையை என்ஏவி அங்கீகரிக்குமா என்பதை இது கூறுகிறதா?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"எண். தகுதி மற்றும் கட்டணம் உங்கள் தனிப்பட்ட பதிவுகளிலிருந்து NAV ஆல் தீர்மானிக்கப்படுகிறது. இந்த திட்டமிடுபவர் நிலையான கால அட்டவணை மற்றும் நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் தேதிகளை மட்டுமே ஒப்பிடுகிறார்.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"இரு பெற்றோர்களும் ஒரே நேரத்தில் பலன்களைப் பெறலாமா?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"சில ஏற்பாடுகள் ஒன்றுடன் ஒன்று சேரலாம், ஆனால் நிலையான திட்டமிடுபவர் ஒருங்கிணைந்த திரும்பப் பெறுதலை 100% வரை கட்டுப்படுத்துகிறார். சிறப்பு பல பிறப்பு மற்றும் பிற விதிவிலக்குகள் NAV மூலம் சரிபார்க்கப்பட வேண்டும்."},"te":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"నార్వే పేరెంటల్ బెనిఫిట్ మరియు లీవ్ ప్లానర్","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"నార్వే పేరెంటల్ లీవ్ ప్లానర్ 2026 — వారాలు, కోటాలు మరియు క్యాలెండర్","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"జననం లేదా దత్తత కోసం నార్వేజియన్ తల్లిదండ్రుల-ప్రయోజన వారాలను ప్లాన్ చేయండి. 80% మరియు 100% కవరేజీని సరిపోల్చండి, ప్రతి తల్లిదండ్రుల కోటాలను కేటాయించండి, పాక్షిక సెలవును షెడ్యూల్ చేయండి మరియు ప్రైవేట్ క్యాలెండర్ ఫైల్‌ను ఎగుమతి చేయండి.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"తేదీలు, కోటాలు మరియు పని నుండి దూరంగా ఉన్న సమయాన్ని పోల్చి చూసే ఒక ఆచరణాత్మక నార్వేజియన్ పేరెంటల్-బెనిఫిట్ ప్లానర్. ఇంటర్ఫేస్ కోసం భాషను ఎంచుకోండి; దిగువన ఉన్న నియమాలు నార్వేజియన్ NAV నియమాలుగా ఉంటాయి.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ఈ పరికరంలో నడుస్తుంది. తేదీలు మరియు కుటుంబ ప్రణాళిక వివరాలు సర్వర్‌కు పంపబడవు లేదా ఈ సాధనం ద్వారా సేవ్ చేయబడవు.","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"న జన్మించిన ఒక బిడ్డ కోసం1నవంబర్2026, తల్లిదండ్రులు ఇద్దరూ అర్హత పొందినప్పుడు ప్రామాణిక NAV వ్యవధి49వద్ద వారాల100% లేదా61వారాలు మరియు1రోజు వద్ద80%. ది80% ఎంపిక సాధారణంగా ఎక్కువ కాలం చెల్లింపులను వ్యాపింపజేస్తుంది; మొత్తం చెల్లింపు దాదాపు సమానంగా ఉంటుందని NAV చెబుతోంది.","How the planner works":"ప్లానర్ ఎలా పనిచేస్తుంది","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"మొదట ఎంచుకున్న ఈవెంట్ తేదీ, ఈవెంట్ రకం, పిల్లల సంఖ్య మరియు కవరేజ్ కోసం అధికారిక పీరియడ్ టేబుల్‌ను సరిపోల్చండి. ఆపై మీ స్వంత తేదీ సెలవు కాలాలను జోడించండి. వారపు రోజులు ప్రయోజన దినాలను వినియోగిస్తాయి; పాక్షిక ఉపసంహరణ వారానికి ఉపయోగించే రోజులను తగ్గిస్తుంది మరియు క్యాలెండర్‌ను పొడిగిస్తుంది. ఖాళీలు ప్రయోజనం ఉపసంహరణ లేకుండా పని లేదా సెలవులను సూచిస్తాయి.","Common questions":"సాధారణ ప్రశ్నలు","Scope and limits":"పరిధి మరియు పరిమితులు","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"నార్వే మాత్రమే. ఇది ప్రణాళికా సహాయం, అర్హత నిర్ణయం, ప్రయోజనం-చెల్లింపు గణన, యజమాని సెలవు-హక్కుల నిర్ణయం లేదా NAV దరఖాస్తు కాదు. తల్లిదండ్రులు ఇద్దరూ హక్కును సంపాదించారని ప్రామాణిక పట్టిక ఊహిస్తుంది. కార్యాచరణ నియమాలు, ఒక-తల్లిదండ్రుల కేసులు, ముందస్తు జననం, అనారోగ్యం, ఏకకాల సెలవు మినహాయింపులు, క్రాస్-బోర్డర్ కోఆర్డినేషన్ మరియు వ్యక్తిగత ఆదాయ గణనలు ఫలితాన్ని మార్చగలవు; ఆ కేసుల కోసం NAVని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు మాత్రమే · NAV పీరియడ్ టేబుల్ తనిఖీ చేయబడింది 17 అక్టోబర్ 2026 · భాష దేశం లేదా నియమాలను మార్చదు.","Family event":"కుటుంబ ఈవెంట్","Birth":"పుట్టుక","Adoption":"దత్తత","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"అంచనా పుట్టిన లేదా సంరక్షణ-బదిలీ తేదీ","Number of children":"పిల్లల సంఖ్య","One child":"ఒక బిడ్డ","Two children":"ఇద్దరు పిల్లలు","Three or more children":"ముగ్గురు లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ మంది పిల్లలు","Coverage choice":"కవరేజ్ ఎంపిక","100% coverage":"100% కవరేజ్","80% coverage":"80% కవరేజ్","Add a leave period":"సెలవు వ్యవధిని జోడించండి","Parent taking leave":"తల్లిదండ్రులు సెలవు తీసుకుంటున్నారు","Mother":"తల్లి","Other parent":"ఇతర తల్లిదండ్రులు","Benefit quota used":"బెనిఫిట్ కోటా ఉపయోగించబడింది","Prenatal quota":"ప్రీనేటల్ కోటా","Mother quota":"తల్లి కోటా","Other-parent quota":"ఇతర-పేరెంట్ కోటా","Shared period":"భాగస్వామ్య వ్యవధి","First date":"మొదటి తేదీ","Last date":"చివరి తేదీ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"బెనిఫిట్ ఉపసంహరణ, %","Calendar label":"క్యాలెండర్ లేబుల్","Add period to plan":"ప్లాన్‌కు వ్యవధిని జోడించండి","Remove":"తొలగించు","Check plan":"ప్లాన్‌ని తనిఖీ చేయండి","Clear plan":"ప్లాన్ క్లియర్ చేయండి","Download calendar (.ics)":"క్యాలెండర్‌ను డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"నార్వే ప్రణాళిక సారాంశం","Total NAV period":"మొత్తం NAV వ్యవధి","Before birth":"పుట్టుకకు ముందు","benefit days":"ప్రయోజనం రోజులు","weeks":"వారాలు","Unscheduled quota remaining":"అన్ షెడ్యూల్డ్ కోటా మిగిలి ఉంది","Total days not yet assigned":"మొత్తం రోజులు ఇంకా కేటాయించబడలేదు","Your dated periods":"మీ కాలవ్యవధులు","Parent":"తల్లిదండ్రులు","Quota":"కోటా","Calendar dates":"క్యాలెండర్ తేదీలు","Withdrawal":"ఉపసంహరణ","Benefit days used":"ప్రయోజన రోజులు ఉపయోగించబడ్డాయి","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"మిగిలిన కోటా మరియు క్యాలెండర్‌ను చూడడానికి తేదీ వ్యవధిని జోడించండి.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"ఈవెంట్ వివరాలను ఎంచుకోండి మరియు మీరు సరిపోల్చాలనుకునే ఏవైనా కాలాలను జోడించండి.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"ఈ పరికరంలో ప్లాన్ తనిఖీ చేయబడింది. NAV వ్యక్తిగత హక్కులను నిర్ణయిస్తుంది.","Period added to the plan.":"ప్లాన్‌కి వ్యవధి జోడించబడింది.","Period removed.":"కాలం తీసివేయబడింది.","Plan cleared.":"ప్లాన్ క్లియర్ చేయబడింది.","Calendar file created on this device.":"ఈ పరికరంలో క్యాలెండర్ ఫైల్ సృష్టించబడింది.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"తేదీలు, పేరెంట్, కోటా మరియు ఉపసంహరణ శాతాలను సమీక్షించండి.","Compare the two coverage choices":"రెండు కవరేజ్ ఎంపికలను సరిపోల్చండి","Total period":"మొత్తం వ్యవధి","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"కవరేజ్ ఎంపిక తల్లిదండ్రులిద్దరికీ ఒకేలా ఉంటుంది మరియు తర్వాత మార్చలేరు. గణాంకాలు వ్యవధి పొడవులు, చెల్లింపు అంచనా కాదు.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"మీ ఎంట్రీలు ఈ బ్రౌజర్ ట్యాబ్‌లో ఉంటాయి. మీరు డౌన్‌లోడ్‌ని ఎంచుకున్నప్పుడు క్యాలెండర్ ఎగుమతి స్థానికంగా సృష్టించబడుతుంది.","Assumptions used":"ఉపయోగించబడిన ఊహలు","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"ప్రయోజన దినాలు సోమవారం నుండి శుక్రవారం వరకు లెక్కించబడతాయి; ప్రభుత్వ సెలవులు ప్రత్యేకంగా మినహాయించబడలేదు.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"ఒక పాక్షిక-ఉపసంహరణ శాతం ఎక్కువ షెడ్యూల్ మరియు తగ్గిన ప్రయోజన-రోజు వినియోగాన్ని మోడల్ చేస్తుంది. యజమానితో వాస్తవ పని శాతాన్ని అంగీకరించి, NAVని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"ఈ ప్రామాణిక ప్లానర్‌లో కలిపి ఏకకాల ఉపసంహరణ 100%కి పరిమితం చేయబడింది; ప్రత్యేక బహుళ-జన్మ మినహాయింపులు ఈ తనిఖీకి వెలుపల ఉన్నాయి.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV పీరియడ్స్ సాధారణంగా బిడ్డకు మూడు సంవత్సరాలు వచ్చే ముందు లేదా దత్తత కోసం సంరక్షణ బదిలీ తర్వాత మూడు సంవత్సరాలలోపు తప్పనిసరిగా ఉపయోగించాలి.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · తల్లిదండ్రుల ప్రయోజన నియమాలు మరియు కాల పట్టికలు","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · జాతీయ బీమా ప్రాథమిక మొత్తం (జి)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · అధికారిక తల్లిదండ్రుల ప్రయోజన ప్లానర్","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"ఈ ప్లానర్ వెలుపలి కేసుల కోసం NAV మార్గదర్శకాన్ని తెరవండి","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"ఈ ఈవెంట్ తేదీ ఇక్కడ చేర్చబడిన తేదీ NAV పట్టికల వెలుపల ఉంది. వర్తించే నియమ సంస్కరణ కోసం NAV మార్గదర్శకాన్ని తెరవండి.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"తల్లిదండ్రులు ఇద్దరూ హక్కును సంపాదించుకున్న ప్రామాణిక కేసును ఈ వెర్షన్ మోడల్ చేస్తుంది. ఇతర కుటుంబ పరిస్థితుల కోసం NAVని ఉపయోగించండి.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"పేజీ భాషను మార్చడం నియమాలను మారుస్తుందా?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"నం. ఇంటర్‌ఫేస్‌ని వివిధ భాషల్లో చదవవచ్చు, కానీ ఈ ప్లానర్ ఎల్లప్పుడూ పేర్కొన్న నార్వేజియన్ NAV పీరియడ్ టేబుల్‌ని వర్తింపజేస్తుంది.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"నా క్లెయిమ్‌ని NAV ఆమోదిస్తుందో లేదో ఇది నాకు చెబుతుందా?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"నం. అర్హత మరియు చెల్లింపు మీ వ్యక్తిగత రికార్డుల నుండి NAV ద్వారా నిర్ణయించబడతాయి. ఈ ప్లానర్ మీరు నమోదు చేసే ప్రామాణిక కాల పట్టిక మరియు తేదీలను మాత్రమే సరిపోల్చుతుంది.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"తల్లిదండ్రులిద్దరూ ఒకేసారి ప్రయోజనాలను పొందవచ్చా?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"కొన్ని ఏర్పాట్లు అతివ్యాప్తి చెందుతాయి, కానీ ప్రామాణిక ప్లానర్ సంయుక్త ఉపసంహరణను 100%కి పరిమితం చేస్తుంది. ప్రత్యేక బహుళ-జన్మలు మరియు ఇతర మినహాయింపులు తప్పనిసరిగా NAVతో తనిఖీ చేయబడాలి."},"th":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"นอร์เวย์ ผลประโยชน์ของผู้ปกครองและผู้วางแผนการลา","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"นอร์เวย์ ผู้วางแผนการลาสำหรับผู้ปกครอง 2026 - สัปดาห์ โควต้า และปฏิทิน","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"วางแผนสัปดาห์ผลประโยชน์ของผู้ปกครองนอร์เวย์สำหรับการคลอดบุตรหรือการรับเลี้ยงบุตรบุญธรรม เปรียบเทียบความครอบคลุม 80% และ 100% กำหนดโควต้าของผู้ปกครองแต่ละคน กำหนดเวลาการลาบางส่วน และส่งออกไฟล์ปฏิทินส่วนตัว","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"เครื่องมือวางแผนผลประโยชน์สำหรับผู้ปกครองชาวนอร์เวย์สำหรับครอบครัวโดยเปรียบเทียบวันที่ โควต้า และเวลาลางาน เลือกภาษาสำหรับอินเทอร์เฟซ กฎด้านล่างนี้ยังคงเป็นกฎ NAV ของนอร์เวย์","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ทำงานบนอุปกรณ์นี้ วันที่และรายละเอียดแผนครอบครัวจะไม่ถูกส่งไปยังเซิร์ฟเวอร์หรือบันทึกโดยเครื่องมือนี้","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"สำหรับเด็กหนึ่งคนที่เกิดในวันที่ 1 พฤศจิกายน 2026 ระยะเวลา NAV มาตรฐานที่ผู้ปกครองทั้งสองคนมีคุณสมบัติคือ 49 สัปดาห์ที่ 100% หรือ 61 สัปดาห์และ 1 วันที่ 80% โดยทั่วไป ตัวเลือก 80% จะกระจายการชำระเงินในระยะเวลานานขึ้น NAV บอกว่ายอดชำระทั้งหมดประมาณเท่ากัน","How the planner works":"เครื่องวางแผนทำงานอย่างไร","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"ขั้นแรกให้เปรียบเทียบตารางระยะเวลาอย่างเป็นทางการสำหรับวันที่จัดงาน ประเภทเหตุการณ์ จำนวนเด็ก และความคุ้มครองที่เลือก จากนั้นเพิ่มระยะเวลาการลาของคุณเอง วันธรรมดาใช้วันผลประโยชน์ การถอนบางส่วนจะช่วยลดจำนวนวันที่ใช้ต่อวันธรรมดาและขยายปฏิทิน ช่องว่างสามารถแสดงถึงการทำงานหรือการลาพักร้อนโดยไม่ต้องถอนผลประโยชน์","Common questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Scope and limits":"ขอบเขตและขีดจำกัด","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"นอร์เวย์เท่านั้น นี่คือความช่วยเหลือในการวางแผน ไม่ใช่การตัดสินใจเกี่ยวกับคุณสมบัติ การคำนวณการจ่ายผลประโยชน์ การกำหนดสิทธิการลาของนายจ้าง หรือการยื่นคำขอ NAV ตารางมาตรฐานถือว่าทั้งผู้ปกครองได้รับสิทธิ์ กฎกิจกรรม กรณีผู้ปกครองคนเดียว การคลอดก่อนกำหนด การเจ็บป่วย ข้อยกเว้นการลาพร้อมกัน การประสานงานข้ามพรมแดน และการคำนวณรายได้รายบุคคล สามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงผลลัพธ์ได้ ตรวจสอบ NAV สำหรับกรณีดังกล่าว","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"กฎของนอร์เวย์เท่านั้น · ตรวจสอบตารางงวด NAV แล้ว 17 ตุลาคม 2026 · ภาษาไม่เปลี่ยนประเทศหรือกฎ","Family event":"งานครอบครัว","Birth":"เกิด","Adoption":"การยอมรับ","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"วันที่คาดว่าจะเกิดหรือย้ายการดูแล","Number of children":"จำนวนลูก","One child":"ลูกหนึ่งคน","Two children":"ลูกสองคน","Three or more children":"ลูกสามคนขึ้นไป","Coverage choice":"ทางเลือกความคุ้มครอง","100% coverage":"100% ความคุ้มครอง","80% coverage":"80% ความคุ้มครอง","Add a leave period":"เพิ่มระยะเวลาการลา","Parent taking leave":"ผู้ปกครองลา","Mother":"แม่","Other parent":"พาเรนต์อื่นๆ","Benefit quota used":"โควต้าผลประโยชน์ที่ใช้ไป","Prenatal quota":"โควต้าก่อนคลอด","Mother quota":"โควต้าแม่","Other-parent quota":"โควต้าพาเรนต์อื่นๆ","Shared period":"ช่วงเวลาที่ใช้ร่วมกัน","First date":"เดทแรก","Last date":"วันที่ล่าสุด","Benefit withdrawal, %":"การถอนผลประโยชน์, %","Calendar label":"ป้ายปฏิทิน","Add period to plan":"เพิ่มระยะเวลาในการวางแผน","Remove":"เอาออก","Check plan":"ตรวจสอบแผน","Clear plan":"เคลียร์แผน","Download calendar (.ics)":"ดาวน์โหลดปฏิทิน (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"สรุปแผนนอร์เวย์","Total NAV period":"ช่วง NAV ทั้งหมด","Before birth":"ก่อนเกิด","benefit days":"วันสวัสดิการ","weeks":"สัปดาห์","Unscheduled quota remaining":"โควต้าที่ไม่ได้กำหนดไว้ยังเหลืออยู่","Total days not yet assigned":"จำนวนวันยังไม่ได้กำหนด","Your dated periods":"ประจำเดือนของคุณ","Parent":"พาเรนต์","Quota":"โควต้า","Calendar dates":"วันที่ในปฏิทิน","Withdrawal":"การถอนเงิน","Benefit days used":"วันสิทธิประโยชน์ที่ใช้","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"เพิ่มช่วงเวลาที่ลงวันที่เพื่อดูโควต้าและปฏิทินที่เหลือ","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"เลือกรายละเอียดกิจกรรมและเพิ่มช่วงเวลาที่คุณต้องการเปรียบเทียบ","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"ตรวจสอบแผนบนอุปกรณ์นี้แล้ว NAV เป็นผู้กำหนดสิทธิส่วนบุคคล","Period added to the plan.":"ระยะเวลาที่เพิ่มในแผน","Period removed.":"ลบระยะเวลาแล้ว","Plan cleared.":"ล้างแผนแล้ว","Calendar file created on this device.":"ไฟล์ปฏิทินที่สร้างบนอุปกรณ์นี้","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"ตรวจสอบวันที่ ผู้ปกครอง โควต้า และเปอร์เซ็นต์การถอน","Compare the two coverage choices":"เปรียบเทียบตัวเลือกความคุ้มครองทั้งสองแบบ","Total period":"ระยะเวลารวม","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"ตัวเลือกความคุ้มครองจะเหมือนกันสำหรับทั้งผู้ปกครองและไม่สามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงได้ในภายหลัง ตัวเลขดังกล่าวเป็นช่วงระยะเวลา ไม่ใช่ประมาณการการจ่ายเงิน","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"รายการของคุณจะอยู่ในแท็บเบราว์เซอร์นี้ การส่งออกปฏิทินจะถูกสร้างขึ้นภายในเครื่องเมื่อคุณเลือกดาวน์โหลด","Assumptions used":"สมมติฐานที่ใช้","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"วันสิทธิประโยชน์จะถูกนับตั้งแต่วันจันทร์ถึงวันศุกร์ วันหยุดนักขัตฤกษ์จะไม่แยกออกจากกัน","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"แบบจำลองเปอร์เซ็นต์การถอนออกบางส่วนมีกำหนดการที่ยาวขึ้นและลดการใช้วันได้รับประโยชน์ ตกลงเปอร์เซ็นต์การทำงานจริงกับนายจ้างและตรวจสอบ NAV","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"การถอนพร้อมกันแบบรวมถูกจำกัดไว้ที่ 100% ในเครื่องมือวางแผนมาตรฐานนี้ ข้อยกเว้นการเกิดหลายครั้งแบบพิเศษอยู่นอกเหนือการตรวจสอบนี้","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"ปกติต้องใช้ช่วง NAV ก่อนที่เด็กอายุจะครบสามขวบ หรือภายในสามปีหลังจากโอนการดูแลเพื่อรับเลี้ยงบุตรบุญธรรม","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · กฎผลประโยชน์ของผู้ปกครองและตารางช่วงเวลา","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · จำนวนเงินประกันสังคมขั้นพื้นฐาน (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · ผู้วางแผนผลประโยชน์ผู้ปกครองอย่างเป็นทางการ","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"เปิดคำแนะนำ NAV สำหรับกรณีที่อยู่นอกการวางแผนนี้","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"วันที่ของเหตุการณ์นี้อยู่นอกตาราง NAV ที่ลงวันที่รวมไว้ที่นี่ เปิดคำแนะนำ NAV สำหรับเวอร์ชันกฎที่เกี่ยวข้อง","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"เวอร์ชันนี้จำลองเคสมาตรฐานที่ผู้ปกครองทั้งสองได้รับสิทธิ์ ใช้ NAV สำหรับสถานการณ์ครอบครัวอื่นๆ","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"การเปลี่ยนภาษาของหน้าเปลี่ยนกฎหรือไม่","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No. อินเทอร์เฟซสามารถอ่านได้ในภาษาต่างๆ แต่เครื่องมือวางแผนนี้จะใช้ตารางรอบระยะเวลา NAV ของนอร์เวย์ที่ระบุไว้เสมอ","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"สิ่งนี้บอกฉันหรือไม่ว่า NAV จะอนุมัติการเคลมของฉันหรือไม่?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"No. คุณสมบัติและการชำระเงินจะถูกกำหนดโดย NAV จากบันทึกส่วนบุคคลของคุณ เครื่องมือวางแผนนี้จะเปรียบเทียบเฉพาะตารางช่วงเวลามาตรฐานและวันที่ที่คุณป้อนเท่านั้น","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"ผู้ปกครองสามารถรับสิทธิประโยชน์พร้อมกันได้หรือไม่?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"การเตรียมการบางอย่างสามารถทับซ้อนกันได้ แต่ผู้วางแผนมาตรฐานจำกัดการถอนรวมไว้ที่ 100% ต้องตรวจสอบการคลอดบุตรแบบพิเศษและข้อยกเว้นอื่นๆ ด้วย NAV"},"tl":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Mga Linggo, Quota at Kalendaryo","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Magplano ng Norwegian na mga linggo ng benepisyo ng magulang para sa kapanganakan o pag-aampon. Ihambing ang 80% at 100% na saklaw, magtalaga ng mga quota ng bawat magulang, mag-iskedyul ng bahagyang bakasyon at mag-export ng pribadong file ng kalendaryo.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Isang praktikal na tagaplano ng benepisyo ng magulang ng Norwegian para sa mga pamilyang naghahambing ng mga petsa, quota at oras na wala sa trabaho. Pumili ng wika para sa interface; ang mga patakaran sa ibaba ay nananatiling mga panuntunan ng Norwegian NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Gumagana sa device na ito. Ang mga petsa at mga detalye ng family-plan ay hindi ipinadala sa isang server o nai-save ng tool na ito.","Example":"Halimbawa","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Para sa isang batang ipinanganak noong1Nobyembre2026, ang karaniwang panahon ng NAV kapag ang parehong mga magulang ay kwalipikado ay49linggo sa100% o61linggo at1araw sa80%. Ang80Ang % na pagpipilian ay karaniwang nagkakalat ng mga pagbabayad sa mas mahabang panahon; Sinasabi ng NAV na ang kabuuang bayad ay tinatayang katumbas.","How the planner works":"Paano gumagana ang tagaplano","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Ikumpara muna ang opisyal na talahanayan ng panahon para sa napiling petsa ng kaganapan, uri ng kaganapan, bilang ng mga bata at saklaw. Pagkatapos ay idagdag ang sarili mong may petsang mga panahon ng bakasyon. Ang mga araw ng linggo ay gumagamit ng mga araw ng benepisyo; ang bahagyang pag-withdraw ay binabawasan ang mga araw na ginagamit sa bawat karaniwang araw at pinapahaba ang kalendaryo. Maaaring kumatawan ang mga gaps sa trabaho o bakasyon nang walang pag-withdraw ng benepisyo.","Common questions":"Mga karaniwang tanong","Scope and limits":"Saklaw at limitasyon","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Norway lang. Ito ay isang tulong sa pagpaplano, hindi isang desisyon sa pagiging karapat-dapat, pagkalkula ng benepisyo sa pagbabayad, pagpapasiya ng mga karapatan sa pag-iwan ng employer o aplikasyon ng NAV. Ipinapalagay ng karaniwang talahanayan na ang parehong mga magulang ay nakakuha ng karapatan. Ang mga panuntunan sa aktibidad, kaso ng isang magulang, maagang kapanganakan, pagkakasakit, mga pagbubukod sa sabay-sabay na bakasyon, koordinasyon sa cross-border at mga indibidwal na kalkulasyon ng kita ay maaaring magbago ng resulta; suriin ang NAV para sa mga kasong iyon.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Norwegian rules lang · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · hindi binabago ng wika ang bansa o mga panuntunan.","Family event":"Kaganapan ng pamilya","Birth":"Kapanganakan","Adoption":"Pag-ampon","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Inaasahang petsa ng kapanganakan o paglipat ng pangangalaga","Number of children":"Bilang ng mga bata","One child":"Isang anak","Two children":"Dalawang bata","Three or more children":"Tatlo o higit pang bata","Coverage choice":"Pagpipilian sa saklaw","100% coverage":"100% coverage","80% coverage":"80% coverage","Add a leave period":"Magdagdag ng panahon ng bakasyon","Parent taking leave":"Magulang na kumukuha ng bakasyon","Mother":"Ina","Other parent":"Ibang magulang","Benefit quota used":"Nagamit na quota ng benepisyo","Prenatal quota":"Cota sa prenatal","Mother quota":"Cota ng ina","Other-parent quota":"quota ng ibang magulang","Shared period":"Nakabahaging panahon","First date":"Unang petsa","Last date":"Huling petsa","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Pag-withdraw ng benepisyo, %","Calendar label":"Etiketa ng kalendaryo","Add period to plan":"Magdagdag ng panahon sa plano","Remove":"Alisin","Check plan":"Suriin ang plano","Clear plan":"I-clear ang plano","Download calendar (.ics)":"I-download ang kalendaryo (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Buod ng plano sa Norway","Total NAV period":"Kabuuang panahon ng NAV","Before birth":"Bago ipanganak","benefit days":"mga araw ng benepisyo","weeks":"linggo","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Hindi nakaiskedyul na quota ang natitira","Total days not yet assigned":"Kabuuang mga araw na hindi pa nakatalaga","Your dated periods":"Ang iyong mga napetsahan na panahon","Parent":"Magulang","Quota":"Quota","Calendar dates":"Mga petsa sa kalendaryo","Withdrawal":"Withdrawal","Benefit days used":"Nagamit na araw ng benepisyo","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Magdagdag ng mga may petsang panahon upang makita ang natitirang quota at kalendaryo.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Piliin ang mga detalye ng kaganapan at magdagdag ng anumang mga panahon na gusto mong ihambing.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Nasuri ang plano sa device na ito. Ang NAV ang nagpapasya sa mga indibidwal na karapatan.","Period added to the plan.":"Idinagdag ang panahon sa plano.","Period removed.":"Inalis ang panahon.","Plan cleared.":"Na-clear ang plano.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Clendar file na ginawa sa device na ito.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Suriin ang mga petsa, magulang, quota at porsyento ng withdrawal.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Ihambing ang dalawang pagpipilian sa saklaw","Total period":"Kabuuang panahon","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Ang pagpipilian sa saklaw ay pareho para sa parehong mga magulang at hindi na mababago sa ibang pagkakataon. Ang mga numero ay mga haba ng panahon, hindi isang pagtatantya ng payout.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Nananatili ang iyong mga entry sa tab ng browser na ito. Ang pag-export ng kalendaryo ay nilikha nang lokal kapag pinili mo ang I-download.","Assumptions used":"Mga ginamit na pagpapalagay","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Ang mga araw ng benepisyo ay binibilang mula Lunes hanggang Biyernes; ang mga pampublikong pista opisyal ay hindi hiwalay na ibinukod.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Ang bahagyang-withdrawal na porsyento ay nagmomodelo ng mas mahabang iskedyul at pinababang paggamit sa araw ng benepisyo. Sumang-ayon sa aktwal na porsyento ng trabaho sa employer at suriin ang NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Ang pinagsamang sabay-sabay na withdrawal ay limitado sa 100% sa karaniwang planner na ito; Ang mga espesyal na pagbubukod sa maramihang kapanganakan ay nasa labas ng tseke na ito.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"Ang mga panahon ng NAV ay karaniwang dapat gamitin bago ang bata ay maging tatlo, o sa loob ng tatlong taon pagkatapos ng paglipat ng pangangalaga para sa pag-aampon.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · mga patakaran sa benepisyo ng magulang at mga talahanayan ng panahon","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Pangunahing halaga ng National Insurance (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · opisyal na tagaplano ng benepisyo ng magulang","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Buksan na gabay sa NAV para sa mga kaso sa labas ng planner na ito","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Ang petsa ng kaganapang ito ay nasa labas ng napetsahan na mga talahanayan ng NAV na kasama rito. Buksan ang gabay ng NAV para sa naaangkop na bersyon ng panuntunan.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Ang bersyon na ito ay modelo ng karaniwang kaso kung saan ang parehong mga magulang ay nakakuha ng karapatan. Gamitin ang NAV para sa ibang mga sitwasyon ng pamilya.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Nababago ba ng pagpapalit ng wika ng pahina ang mga panuntunan?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Hindi. Maaaring basahin ang interface sa iba't ibang wika, ngunit palaging inilalapat ng tagaplanong ito ang nakasaad na talahanayan ng panahon ng Norwegian NAV.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Sinasabi ba nito sa akin kung aaprubahan ng NAV ang aking paghahabol?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Hindi. Ang pagiging karapat-dapat at pagbabayad ay napagpasyahan ng NAV mula sa iyong mga indibidwal na tala. Inihahambing lamang ng tagaplanong ito ang karaniwang talahanayan ng panahon at mga petsa na iyong ilalagay.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Maaari bang kumuha ng mga benepisyo ang parehong mga magulang nang sabay?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Maaaring mag-overlap ang ilang pagsasaayos, ngunit nililimitahan ng karaniwang tagaplano ang pinagsamang withdrawal sa 100%. Ang espesyal na maramihang-kapanganakan at iba pang mga pagbubukod ay dapat suriin sa NAV."},"tr":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Norveç Ebeveyn Yardımı ve İzin Planlayıcısı","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Norveç Ebeveynlik İzni Planlayıcı 2026 — Haftalar, Kotalar ve Takvim","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Doğum veya evlat edinme için Norveç ebeveyn yardımı haftalarını planlayın. 80% ve 100% kapsamını karşılaştırın, her ebeveynin kotalarını atayın, kısmi izin planlayın ve özel bir takvim dosyasını dışa aktarın.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Tarihleri, kotaları ve işten uzakta geçirilen zamanı karşılaştıran aileler için pratik bir Norveç ebeveyn yardımı planlayıcısı. Arayüz için bir dil seçin; Aşağıdaki kurallar Norveç NAV kuralları olarak kalmaktadır.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Bu cihazda çalışır. Tarihler ve aile planı ayrıntıları bu araç tarafından bir sunucuya gönderilmez veya kaydedilmez.","Example":"Örnek","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"1 Kasım 2026 tarihinde doğan bir çocuk için, her iki ebeveynin de hak kazandığı standart NAV dönemi 100% veya 61 haftada 49 hafta ve 80%'de 1 gündür. 80% seçeneği genellikle ödemeleri daha uzun bir zamana yayar; NAV, toplam ödemenin yaklaşık olarak eşit olduğunu söylüyor.","How the planner works":"Planlayıcı nasıl çalışır?","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Öncelikle seçilen etkinlik tarihi, etkinlik türü, çocuk sayısı ve kapsam için resmi dönem tablosunu karşılaştırın. Daha sonra kendi tarihli izin dönemlerinizi ekleyin. Hafta içi günler yardım günlerini tüketir; kısmi çekilme hafta içi kullanılan günleri azaltır ve takvimi uzatır. Boşluklar, yardımdan çekilme olmaksızın iş veya tatili temsil edebilir.","Common questions":"Genel sorular","Scope and limits":"Kapsam ve sınırlar","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Yalnızca Norveç. Bu bir planlama yardımıdır; bir uygunluk kararı, sosyal yardım ödemesi hesaplaması, işveren izin hakları tespiti veya NAV başvurusu değildir. Standart tablo her iki ebeveynin de hak kazandığını varsayar. Faaliyet kuralları, tek ebeveyn vakaları, erken doğum, hastalık, eş zamanlı izin istisnaları, sınır ötesi koordinasyon ve bireyselleştirilmiş gelir hesaplamaları sonucu değiştirebilir; bu durumlar için NAV'ı kontrol edin.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Yalnızca Norveç kuralları · NAV dönem tablosu kontrol edildi 17 Ekim 2026 · dil, ülkeyi veya kuralları değiştirmez.","Family event":"Aile etkinliği","Birth":"Doğum","Adoption":"Evlat Edinme","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Beklenen doğum veya bakım transfer tarihi","Number of children":"Çocuk sayısı","One child":"Bir çocuk","Two children":"İki çocuk","Three or more children":"Üç veya daha fazla çocuk","Coverage choice":"Kapsama seçeneği","100% coverage":"100% kapsama alanı","80% coverage":"80% kapsam","Add a leave period":"İzin süresi ekle","Parent taking leave":"Ebeveyn izin alıyor","Mother":"Anne","Other parent":"Diğer üst öğe","Benefit quota used":"Kullanılan fayda kotası","Prenatal quota":"Doğum öncesi kotası","Mother quota":"Anne kotası","Other-parent quota":"Diğer-ebeveyn kotası","Shared period":"Paylaşılan dönem","First date":"İlk tarih","Last date":"Son tarih","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Faydanın geri çekilmesi, %","Calendar label":"Takvim etiketi","Add period to plan":"Plana dönem ekle","Remove":"Kaldır","Check plan":"Planı kontrol et","Clear plan":"Planı temizle","Download calendar (.ics)":"Takvimi indir (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Norveç planı özeti","Total NAV period":"Toplam NAV dönemi","Before birth":"Doğumdan önce","benefit days":"fayda günleri","weeks":"hafta","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Planlanmamış kota kaldı","Total days not yet assigned":"Henüz atanmamış toplam gün sayısı","Your dated periods":"Tarihli dönemleriniz","Parent":"Ebeveyn","Quota":"Kota","Calendar dates":"Takvim tarihleri","Withdrawal":"Para Çekme","Benefit days used":"Kullanılan fayda günleri","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Kalan kotayı ve takvimi görmek için tarihli dönemler ekleyin.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Etkinlik ayrıntılarını seçin ve karşılaştırmak istediğiniz dönemleri ekleyin.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Plan bu cihazda kontrol edildi. NAV bireysel haklara karar verir.","Period added to the plan.":"Dönem plana eklendi.","Period removed.":"Nokta kaldırıldı.","Plan cleared.":"Plan temizlendi.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Takvim dosyası bu cihazda oluşturuldu.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Tarihleri, ebeveyni, kotayı ve para çekme yüzdelerini inceleyin.","Compare the two coverage choices":"İki kapsama seçeneğini karşılaştırın","Total period":"Toplam süre","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Kapsam seçimi her iki ebeveyn için de aynıdır ve daha sonra değiştirilemez. Rakamlar dönem uzunluklarıdır, ödeme tahmini değildir.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Girişleriniz bu tarayıcı sekmesinde kalır. İndir'i seçtiğinizde takvim dışa aktarımı yerel olarak oluşturulur.","Assumptions used":"Kullanılan varsayımlar","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Avantaj günleri Pazartesi'den Cuma'ya kadar sayılır; resmi tatiller ayrıca hariç tutulmaz.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Kısmi para çekme yüzdesi, daha uzun bir programı ve daha az yardım günü kullanımını modeller. Fiili çalışma yüzdesini işverenle kabul edin ve NAV'ı kontrol edin.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Birleşik eşzamanlı para çekme, bu standart planlayıcıda %100 ile sınırlıdır; özel çoklu doğum istisnaları bu kontrolün dışındadır.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV dönemleri normalde çocuk üç yaşını doldurmadan önce veya evlat edinme için bakımın devredilmesinden sonraki üç yıl içinde kullanılmalıdır.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · ebeveyn parası kuralları ve dönem tabloları","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Ulusal Sigorta temel tutarı (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · resmi ebeveyn yardımı planlayıcısı","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Bu planlayıcının dışındaki durumlar için NAV kılavuzunu aç","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Bu etkinlik tarihi, burada yer alan tarihli NAV tablolarının dışındadır. Geçerli kural sürümü için NAV kılavuzunu açın.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Bu versiyon, her iki ebeveynin de hak kazandığı standart durumu modelliyor. Diğer aile durumları için NAV'ı kullanın.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Sayfa dilini değiştirmek kuralları değiştirir mi?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Hayır. Arayüz farklı dillerde okunabilir ancak bu planlayıcı her zaman belirtilen Norveç NAV dönem tablosunu uygular.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Bu bana NAV'ın talebimi onaylayıp onaylamayacağını gösteriyor mu?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Hayır. Uygunluk ve ödeme, kişisel kayıtlarınızdan NAV tarafından kararlaştırılır. Bu planlayıcı yalnızca standart dönem tablosunu ve girdiğiniz tarihleri ​​karşılaştırır.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Her iki ebeveyn de yardımlardan aynı anda yararlanabilir mi?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Bazı düzenlemeler çakışabilir, ancak standart planlayıcı birleşik çekilmeyi %100 ile sınırlandırıyor. Özel çoklu doğum ve diğer istisnalar NAV'dan kontrol edilmelidir."},"uk":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Планувальник батьківської допомоги та відпустки в Норвегії","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Норвезький планувальник батьківської відпустки 2026 — тижні, квоти та календар","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Плануйте норвезькі тижні батьківської допомоги на народження або усиновлення. Порівняйте охоплення 80% і 100%, призначте квоти для кожного з батьків, заплануйте часткову відпустку та експортуйте приватний файл календаря.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Практичний норвезький планувальник батьківських допомог для сімей, які порівнюють дати, квоти та час, коли не працюють. Виберіть мову для інтерфейсу; наведені нижче правила залишаються норвезькими правилами NAV.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Працює на цьому пристрої. Дати та деталі сімейного плану не надсилаються на сервер і не зберігаються цим інструментом.","Example":"Приклад","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Для однієї дитини, народженої 1 листопада 2026, стандартний період NAV, коли обоє батьків відповідають вимогам, становить 49 тижнів при 100% або 61 тижнів і 1 днів при 80%. Вибір 80% зазвичай розподіляє платежі на довший час; NAV каже, що загальний платіж приблизно рівний.","How the planner works":"Як працює планувальник","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Спочатку порівняйте офіційну таблицю періодів для вибраної дати події, типу події, кількості дітей і покриття. Потім додайте власні датовані періоди відпустки. Будні поглинають пільгові дні; часткове скасування скорочує кількість днів тижня та розширює календар. Прогалини можуть означати роботу або відпустку без вилучення допомоги.","Common questions":"Поширені запитання","Scope and limits":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Лише Норвегія. Це допомога в плануванні, а не рішення щодо відповідності вимогам, розрахунок виплати допомоги, визначення прав роботодавця на відпустку чи заява NAV. Стандартна таблиця передбачає, що обоє батьків заслужили право. Правила діяльності, випадки з одним із батьків, раннє народження, хвороба, винятки щодо одночасної відпустки, транскордонна координація та індивідуальні розрахунки доходу можуть змінити результат; перевірте NAV для цих випадків.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Лише для норвезьких правил · Таблицю періодів NAV перевірено 17 Жовтень 2026 · мова не змінює країну чи правила.","Family event":"Сімейна подія","Birth":"Народ","Adoption":"Усиновлення","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Очікувана дата народження або передачі","Number of children":"Кількість дітей","One child":"Одна дитина","Two children":"Двоє дітей","Three or more children":"Троє і більше дітей","Coverage choice":"Вибір покриття","100% coverage":"100% покриття","80% coverage":"80% покриття","Add a leave period":"Додати період відпустки","Parent taking leave":"Батьки у відпустці","Mother":"Мати","Other parent":"Інший батько","Benefit quota used":"Використана квота пільг","Prenatal quota":"Пренатальна квота","Mother quota":"Материнська квота","Other-parent quota":"Інша батьківська квота","Shared period":"Спільний період","First date":"Перше побачення","Last date":"Остання дата","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Зняття пільг, %","Calendar label":"Календарний ярлик","Add period to plan":"Додати період до плану","Remove":"Видалити","Check plan":"План перевірки","Clear plan":"Чіткий план","Download calendar (.ics)":"Завантажити календар (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Резюме плану Норвегії","Total NAV period":"Загальний період ВЧА","Before birth":"До народження","benefit days":"пільгові дні","weeks":"тижн","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Залишилася незапланована квота","Total days not yet assigned":"Загальна кількість днів ще не призначена","Your dated periods":"Ваші датовані місячні","Parent":"Батьківський","Quota":"Квота","Calendar dates":"Календарні дати","Withdrawal":"Вилучення","Benefit days used":"Використані пільгові дні","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Додайте датовані періоди, щоб побачити залишок квоти та календар.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Виберіть деталі події та додайте періоди, які хочете порівняти.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"План перевірено на цьому пристрої. NAV вирішує індивідуальні права.","Period added to the plan.":"Період доданий до плану.","Period removed.":"Вилучено крапку.","Plan cleared.":"План очищено.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Файл календаря, створений на цьому пристрої.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Перегляньте дати, батьківську частку, квоту та відсотки вилучення.","Compare the two coverage choices":"Порівняйте два варіанти покриття","Total period":"Загальний період","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Вибір покриття однаковий для обох батьків і не може бути змінений пізніше. Цифри є тривалістю періоду, а не оцінкою виплат.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Ваші записи залишаються на цій вкладці браузера. Експорт календаря створюється локально, коли ви вибираєте «Завантажити».","Assumptions used":"Використані припущення","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Пільгові дні враховуються з понеділка по п’ятницю; державні свята не виключаються окремо.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Відсоток часткового вилучення моделює довший графік і скорочене використання пільгового дня. Узгодьте фактичний відсоток роботи з роботодавцем і перевірте NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Комбіноване одночасне зняття коштів обмежено 100% у цьому стандартному планувальнику; спеціальні винятки щодо багаторазових пологів не підпадають під цю перевірку.","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"Періоди NAV зазвичай повинні бути використані до того, як дитині виповниться три роки, або протягом трьох років після передачі під опіку для усиновлення.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · правила батьківської допомоги та таблиці періодів","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Основна сума національного страхування (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · офіційний планувальник батьківських виплат","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Відкрити вказівки NAV для випадків, що не входять до цього планувальника","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Ця дата події не входить до датованих таблиць NAV, які тут включені. Відкрийте вказівки NAV для відповідної версії правила.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Ця версія моделює стандартний випадок, коли обидва батьки заслужили право. Використовуйте NAV для інших сімейних ситуацій.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Чи зміна мови сторінки змінює правила?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"№ Інтерфейс можна читати різними мовами, але цей планувальник завжди застосовує зазначену норвезьку таблицю періодів NAV.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Це говорить мені, чи NAV схвалить мою претензію?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"№ Відповідність вимогам і оплата визначається NAV на основі ваших особистих записів. Цей планувальник порівнює лише стандартну таблицю періодів і дати, які ви вводите.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Чи можуть обоє батьків отримувати пільги одночасно?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Деякі домовленості можуть збігатися, але стандартний планувальник обмежує сумарне зняття 100%. Спеціальні випадки багатоплідності та інші винятки повинні бути перевірені NAV."},"ur":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"ناروے پیرنٹل بینیفٹ اور لیو پلانر","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"ناروے میں والدین کی چھٹی کا منصوبہ ساز 2026 — ہفتے، کوٹے اور کیلنڈر","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"پیدائش یا گود لینے کے لیے نارویجن پیرنٹل بینیفٹ ہفتوں کا منصوبہ بنائیں۔ 80% اور 100% کوریج کا موازنہ کریں، ہر والدین کا کوٹہ تفویض کریں، جزوی چھٹی کا شیڈول بنائیں اور نجی کیلنڈر فائل برآمد کریں۔","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"کام سے دور تاریخوں، کوٹے اور وقت کا موازنہ کرنے والے خاندانوں کے لیے ایک عملی نارویجن والدین کے فائدے کا منصوبہ ساز۔ انٹرفیس کے لیے ایک زبان کا انتخاب کریں؛ ذیل کے قوانین نارویجن NAV کے قوانین برقرار ہیں۔","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"اس ڈیوائس پر چلتا ہے۔ تاریخیں اور فیملی پلان کی تفصیلات کسی سرور کو نہیں بھیجی جاتی ہیں یا اس ٹول کے ذریعے محفوظ نہیں کی جاتی ہیں۔","Example":"مثال","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"پر پیدا ہونے والے ایک بچے کے لیے1نومبر2026، معیاری NAV مدت جب والدین دونوں اہل ہوتے ہیں۔49ہفتوں میں100% یا61ہفتے اور1دن80% دی80% انتخاب عام طور پر ادائیگیوں کو زیادہ وقت تک پھیلاتا ہے۔ NAV کا کہنا ہے کہ کل ادائیگی تقریباً برابر ہے۔","How the planner works":"منصوبہ ساز کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"پہلے منتخب تقریب کی تاریخ، تقریب کی قسم، بچوں کی تعداد اور کوریج کے لیے آفیشل پیریڈ ٹیبل کا موازنہ کریں۔ پھر اپنی تاریخ کی چھٹی کی مدت شامل کریں۔ ہفتے کے دن فائدہ مند دن استعمال کرتے ہیں؛ جزوی واپسی فی ہفتہ استعمال ہونے والے دنوں کو کم کر دیتی ہے اور کیلنڈر کو بڑھا دیتی ہے۔ گیپس کام یا چھٹیوں کی نمائندگی کر سکتے ہیں بغیر فائدہ واپس لینے کے۔","Common questions":"عام سوالات","Scope and limits":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"صرف ناروے یہ منصوبہ بندی کی امداد ہے، اہلیت کا فیصلہ نہیں، فائدہ کی ادائیگی کا حساب، آجر کی چھٹی کے حقوق کا تعین یا NAV درخواست۔ معیاری جدول فرض کرتا ہے کہ والدین دونوں نے حق حاصل کیا ہے۔ سرگرمی کے قواعد، ایک والدین کے معاملات، ابتدائی پیدائش، بیماری، بیک وقت چھٹیوں کی مستثنیات، سرحد پار کوآرڈینیشن اور انفرادی آمدنی کا حساب نتیجہ بدل سکتا ہے۔ ان کیسز کے لیے NAV چیک کریں۔","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"صرف ناروے کے اصول · NAV پیریڈ ٹیبل 17 اکتوبر 2026 چیک کیا گیا · زبان ملک یا قواعد کو تبدیل نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Family event":"خاندانی تقریب","Birth":"پیدائش","Adoption":"گود لینا","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"متوقع پیدائش یا دیکھ بھال کی منتقلی کی تاریخ","Number of children":"بچوں کی تعداد","One child":"ایک بچہ","Two children":"دو بچے","Three or more children":"تین یا زیادہ بچے","Coverage choice":"کوریج کا انتخاب","100% coverage":"100% کوریج","80% coverage":"80% کوریج","Add a leave period":"چھوٹی کی مدت شامل کریں۔","Parent taking leave":"والدین چھٹی لے رہے ہیں۔","Mother":"ماں","Other parent":"دیگر والدین","Benefit quota used":"بینیفٹ کوٹہ استعمال کیا گیا۔","Prenatal quota":"قبل از پیدائش کوٹہ","Mother quota":"مدر کوٹہ","Other-parent quota":"دیگر والدین کوٹہ","Shared period":"مشترکہ دورانیہ","First date":"پہلی تاریخ","Last date":"آخری تاریخ","Benefit withdrawal, %":"فائدہ واپس لینا، %","Calendar label":"کیلنڈر لیبل","Add period to plan":"پلان میں مدت شامل کریں۔","Remove":"ہٹائیں","Check plan":"پلان چیک کریں۔","Clear plan":"کلیئر پلان","Download calendar (.ics)":"کیلنڈر ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"ناروے پلان کا خلاصہ","Total NAV period":"کل NAV پیریڈ","Before birth":"پیدائش سے پہلے","benefit days":"فائدے کے دن","weeks":"ہفتے","Unscheduled quota remaining":"غیر شیڈول شدہ کوٹہ باقی ہے۔","Total days not yet assigned":"کل دن ابھی تفویض نہیں کیے گئے ہیں۔","Your dated periods":"آپ کی تاریخ کی مدت","Parent":"والدین","Quota":"کوٹہ","Calendar dates":"کیلنڈر کی تاریخیں۔","Withdrawal":"واپسی","Benefit days used":"استعمال شدہ فائدہ کے دن","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"بقیہ کوٹہ اور کیلنڈر دیکھنے کے لیے تاریخ کی مدت شامل کریں۔","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"ایونٹ کی تفصیلات کا انتخاب کریں اور کوئی بھی وقفہ شامل کریں جس کا آپ موازنہ کرنا چاہتے ہیں۔","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"اس ڈیوائس پر پلان چیک کیا گیا۔ NAV انفرادی حقوق کا فیصلہ کرتا ہے۔","Period added to the plan.":"پلان میں مدت شامل کی گئی۔","Period removed.":"مدت ہٹا دی گئی۔","Plan cleared.":"پلان صاف ہو گیا۔","Calendar file created on this device.":"کیلنڈر فائل اس ڈیوائس پر بنائی گئی۔","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"تاریخوں، والدین، کوٹہ اور واپسی کے فیصد کا جائزہ لیں۔","Compare the two coverage choices":"کوریج کے دو انتخاب کا موازنہ کریں۔","Total period":"کل مدت","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"کوریج کا انتخاب دونوں والدین کے لیے یکساں ہے اور بعد میں تبدیل نہیں کیا جا سکتا۔ اعداد و شمار مدت کی لمبائی ہیں، ادائیگی کا تخمینہ نہیں۔","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"آپ کے اندراجات اس براؤزر ٹیب میں رہتے ہیں۔ جب آپ ڈاؤن لوڈ کا انتخاب کرتے ہیں تو کیلنڈر ایکسپورٹ مقامی طور پر بن جاتا ہے۔","Assumptions used":"مفروضے استعمال کیے گئے۔","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"سوموار سے جمعہ تک فائدہ کے دن شمار کیے جاتے ہیں۔ عام تعطیلات کو الگ سے خارج نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"جزوی واپسی کا فیصد ایک طویل شیڈول اور کم فائدہ والے دن کے استعمال کا ماڈل ہے۔ آجر کے ساتھ کام کے اصل فیصد سے اتفاق کریں اور NAV چیک کریں۔","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"اس معیاری منصوبہ ساز میں مشترکہ بیک وقت واپسی 100% تک محدود ہے۔ خصوصی کثیر پیدائش مستثنیات اس چیک سے باہر ہیں۔","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV پیریڈز عام طور پر بچے کے تین سال کے ہونے سے پہلے، یا گود لینے کے لیے نگہداشت کی منتقلی کے بعد تین سال کے اندر استعمال کیے جائیں۔","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · والدین کے فائدے کے قواعد اور مدت کی میزیں۔","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · نیشنل انشورنس بنیادی رقم (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · سرکاری والدین کے فائدے کا منصوبہ ساز","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"اس منصوبہ ساز سے باہر کے معاملات کے لیے NAV رہنمائی کھولیں۔","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"یہ ایونٹ کی تاریخ یہاں شامل NAV ٹیبلز سے باہر ہے۔ قابل اطلاق اصول ورژن کے لیے NAV رہنمائی کھولیں۔","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"یہ ورژن معیاری کیس کو ماڈل کرتا ہے جہاں دونوں والدین نے حق حاصل کیا ہے۔ خاندان کے دیگر حالات کے لیے NAV استعمال کریں۔","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"کیا صفحہ کی زبان تبدیل کرنے سے اصول بدل جاتے ہیں؟","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"No انٹرفیس کو مختلف زبانوں میں پڑھا جا سکتا ہے، لیکن یہ منصوبہ ساز ہمیشہ بیان کردہ نارویجن NAV پیریڈ ٹیبل کا اطلاق کرتا ہے۔","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"کیا یہ مجھے بتاتا ہے کہ کیا NAV میرے دعوے کو منظور کرے گا؟","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"No اہلیت اور ادائیگی کا فیصلہ آپ کے انفرادی ریکارڈ سے NAV کے ذریعے کیا جاتا ہے۔ یہ منصوبہ ساز صرف معیاری پیریڈ ٹیبل اور آپ کی داخل کردہ تاریخوں کا موازنہ کرتا ہے۔","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"کیا دونوں والدین ایک ہی وقت میں فوائد لے سکتے ہیں؟","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"کچھ انتظامات اوورلیپ ہوسکتے ہیں، لیکن معیاری منصوبہ ساز مشترکہ واپسی کو 100% تک محدود کرتا ہے۔ خصوصی کثیر پیدائش اور دیگر مستثنیات کو NAV کے ساتھ چیک کرنا ضروری ہے۔"},"vi":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"Công cụ lập kế hoạch nghỉ phép và phúc lợi cha mẹ của Na Uy","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"Công cụ lập kế hoạch nghỉ phép nuôi con của Na Uy 2026 — Tuần, hạn ngạch và lịch","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"Lên kế hoạch cho các tuần trợ cấp dành cho cha mẹ ở Na Uy khi sinh con hoặc nhận con nuôi. So sánh mức độ bao phủ 80% và 100%, chỉ định hạn ngạch của từng phụ huynh, lên lịch nghỉ phép một phần và xuất tệp lịch riêng tư.","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"Một công cụ lập kế hoạch phúc lợi dành cho phụ huynh thực tế của Na Uy dành cho các gia đình so sánh ngày, hạn ngạch và thời gian nghỉ làm. Chọn ngôn ngữ cho giao diện; các quy tắc dưới đây vẫn là quy tắc NAV của Na Uy.","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Chạy trên thiết bị này. Ngày tháng và chi tiết về gói gia đình không được gửi đến máy chủ hoặc được công cụ này lưu lại.","Example":"Ví dụ","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"Đối với một đứa trẻ sinh vào 1 tháng 11 2026, khoảng thời gian NAV tiêu chuẩn khi cả cha và mẹ đều đủ điều kiện là 49 tuần ở 100% hoặc 61 tuần và 1 ngày ở 80%. Lựa chọn 80% thường dàn trải các khoản thanh toán trong thời gian dài hơn; NAV cho biết tổng số tiền thanh toán xấp xỉ bằng nhau.","How the planner works":"Cách thức hoạt động của công cụ lập kế hoạch","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"Trước tiên hãy so sánh bảng thời gian chính thức về ngày diễn ra sự kiện đã chọn, loại sự kiện, số lượng trẻ em và phạm vi phủ sóng. Sau đó thêm thời gian nghỉ phép theo ngày của riêng bạn. Ngày thường tiêu thụ ngày phúc lợi; rút tiền một phần làm giảm số ngày sử dụng mỗi ngày trong tuần và kéo dài lịch. Khoảng trống có thể đại diện cho công việc hoặc kỳ nghỉ mà không cần rút tiền trợ cấp.","Common questions":"Các câu hỏi thường gặp","Scope and limits":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"Chỉ ở Na Uy. Đây là hỗ trợ lập kế hoạch, không phải là quyết định về tính đủ điều kiện, tính toán thanh toán phúc lợi, xác định quyền nghỉ phép của người sử dụng lao động hoặc đơn đăng ký NAV. Bảng tiêu chuẩn giả định cả cha và mẹ đều có quyền. Các quy tắc hoạt động, trường hợp cha/mẹ đơn thân, sinh non, bệnh tật, ngoại lệ nghỉ phép đồng thời, phối hợp xuyên biên giới và tính toán thu nhập cá nhân có thể thay đổi kết quả; kiểm tra NAV cho những trường hợp đó.","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Chỉ quy tắc của Na Uy · Bảng thời gian NAV đã được kiểm tra 17 Tháng 10 2026 · ngôn ngữ không thay đổi quốc gia hoặc quy tắc.","Family event":"Sự kiện gia đình","Birth":"Sinh","Adoption":"Nhận con nuôi","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"Ngày dự kiến sinh hoặc ngày chuyển giao chăm sóc","Number of children":"Số lượng con","One child":"Một con","Two children":"Hai đứa con","Three or more children":"Ba con trở lên","Coverage choice":"Lựa chọn vùng phủ sóng\nĐộ phủ","100% coverage":"100%\nĐộ phủ","80% coverage":"80%","Add a leave period":"Thêm thời gian nghỉ phép","Parent taking leave":"Phụ huynh nghỉ phép","Mother":"Mẹ","Other parent":"Phụ huynh khác","Benefit quota used":"Hạn mức phúc lợi đã sử dụng","Prenatal quota":"Hạn ngạch trước khi sinh","Mother quota":"Hạn ngạch mẹ","Other-parent quota":"Hạn ngạch cha mẹ khác","Shared period":"Thời gian chia sẻ","First date":"Ngày hẹn hò đầu tiên","Last date":"Ngày cuối cùng","Benefit withdrawal, %":"Rút tiền trợ cấp, %","Calendar label":"Nhãn lịch","Add period to plan":"Thêm thời gian vào kế hoạch","Remove":"Xóa","Check plan":"Kiểm tra kế hoạch","Clear plan":"Kế hoạch rõ ràng","Download calendar (.ics)":"Tải xuống lịch (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"Tóm tắt kế hoạch của Na Uy","Total NAV period":"Tổng thời gian NAV","Before birth":"Trước khi sinh","benefit days":"ngày hưởng quyền lợi","weeks":"tuần","Unscheduled quota remaining":"Hạn ngạch đột xuất còn lại","Total days not yet assigned":"Tổng số ngày chưa được chỉ định","Your dated periods":"Kỳ kinh nguyệt của bạn","Parent":"Phụ huynh","Quota":"Hạn ngạch","Calendar dates":"Ngày dương lịch","Withdrawal":"Rút tiền","Benefit days used":"Số ngày hưởng quyền lợi đã sử dụng","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"Thêm khoảng thời gian ngày để xem hạn ngạch và lịch còn lại.","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"Chọn chi tiết sự kiện và thêm bất kỳ khoảng thời gian nào bạn muốn so sánh.","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"Đã kiểm tra kế hoạch trên thiết bị này. NAV quyết định quyền cá nhân.","Period added to the plan.":"Giai đoạn được thêm vào kế hoạch.","Period removed.":"Đã xóa khoảng thời gian.","Plan cleared.":"Đã xóa kế hoạch.","Calendar file created on this device.":"Tệp lịch được tạo trên thiết bị này.","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"Xem lại ngày, gốc, hạn ngạch và tỷ lệ rút tiền.","Compare the two coverage choices":"So sánh hai lựa chọn vùng phủ sóng","Total period":"Tổng thời gian","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"Lựa chọn bảo hiểm là giống nhau cho cả cha lẫn mẹ và không thể thay đổi sau này. Các số liệu này là khoảng thời gian, không phải là ước tính khoản thanh toán.","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"Bài viết của bạn vẫn ở trong tab trình duyệt này. Xuất lịch được tạo cục bộ khi bạn chọn Tải xuống.","Assumptions used":"Các giả định được sử dụng","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"Ngày hưởng trợ cấp được tính từ thứ Hai đến thứ Sáu; ngày lễ không được loại trừ riêng biệt.","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"Tỷ lệ phần trăm rút tiền một phần mô hình lịch trình dài hơn và giảm thời gian sử dụng trong ngày hưởng phúc lợi. Thống nhất tỷ lệ phần trăm công việc thực tế với người sử dụng lao động và kiểm tra NAV.","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"Việc rút tiền đồng thời kết hợp được giới hạn ở 100% trong công cụ lập kế hoạch tiêu chuẩn này; các trường hợp ngoại lệ đặc biệt về sinh nhiều con nằm ngoài kiểm tra này.\nGiai đoạn","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV thường phải được sử dụng trước khi trẻ tròn ba tuổi hoặc trong vòng ba năm sau khi chuyển giao quyền chăm sóc để nhận con nuôi.","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · quy tắc phúc lợi của cha mẹ và bảng thời gian","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV · Số tiền bảo hiểm quốc gia cơ bản (G)","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV · Người lập kế hoạch phúc lợi chính thức cho phụ huynh","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"Hướng dẫn NAV mở cho các trường hợp nằm ngoài kế hoạch này","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"Ngày diễn ra sự kiện này nằm ngoài bảng NAV ngày được nêu ở đây. Mở hướng dẫn NAV cho phiên bản quy tắc hiện hành.","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"Phiên bản này mô phỏng trường hợp tiêu chuẩn trong đó cả cha và mẹ đều có quyền. Sử dụng NAV cho các tình huống khác của gia đình.","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"Việc thay đổi ngôn ngữ trang có làm thay đổi các quy tắc không?","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"Không. Giao diện có thể được đọc bằng nhiều ngôn ngữ khác nhau, nhưng công cụ lập kế hoạch này luôn áp dụng bảng chu kỳ NAV của Na Uy đã nêu.","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"Điều này có cho tôi biết liệu NAV có chấp thuận yêu cầu bồi thường của tôi không?","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"Không. Tính đủ điều kiện và thanh toán được NAV quyết định từ hồ sơ cá nhân của bạn. Công cụ lập kế hoạch này chỉ so sánh bảng thời gian tiêu chuẩn và ngày bạn nhập.","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"Cả cha và mẹ có thể nhận trợ cấp cùng một lúc không?","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"Một số thỏa thuận có thể trùng lặp, nhưng trình lập kế hoạch tiêu chuẩn giới hạn số tiền rút kết hợp ở mức 100%. Việc sinh nhiều con đặc biệt và các trường hợp ngoại lệ khác phải được kiểm tra bằng NAV."},"zh":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"挪威家长福利和休假计划表","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"挪威育儿假计划 2026 — 周数、配额和日历","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"为出生或收养计划挪威父母福利周。比较 80% 和 100% 覆盖率、分配每个家长的配额、安排部分休假并导出私人日历文件。","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"一款实用的挪威父母福利计划工具，适合家庭比较日期、配额和休假时间。选择界面语言；以下规则仍然是挪威 NAV 规则。","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"在此设备上运行。此工具不会将日期和家庭计划详细信息发送到服务器或保存。","Example":"示例","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"对于在 1 11 月 2026 出生的一名孩子，父母双方均符合资格的标准 NAV 期为 49 周（100%）或 61 周以及 1 天（80%）。 80% 选择通常会延长付款时间； NAV 表示支付总额大致相等。","How the planner works":"规划器的工作原理","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"首先比较官方周期表中选定的活动日期、活动类型、儿童人数和覆盖范围。然后添加您自己的休假日期。工作日消耗福利日；部分提款减少了每个工作日的使用天数并延长了日历。缺口可以代表工作或休假而不提取福利。","Common questions":"常见问题","Scope and limits":"范围和限制","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"仅限挪威。这是一项规划援助，而不是资格决定、福利支付计算、雇主休假权利确定或资产净值申请。标准表假设父母双方都享有权利。活动规则、单亲案例、早产、疾病、同时休假例外、跨境协调和个性化收入计算都可能改变结果；检查这些情况下的资产净值。","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"仅限挪威规则 · NAV 周期表已检查 17 10 月 2026 · 语言不会更改国家或规则。","Family event":"家庭活动","Birth":"诞生","Adoption":"采用","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"预产期或护理转移日期","Number of children":"儿童数量","One child":"一个孩子","Two children":"两个孩子","Three or more children":"三个或更多儿童","Coverage choice":"覆盖范围选择","100% coverage":"100% 覆盖率","80% coverage":"80% 覆盖率","Add a leave period":"添加休假时间","Parent taking leave":"家长请假","Mother":"母亲","Other parent":"其他亲","Benefit quota used":"已使用的福利配额","Prenatal quota":"产前配额","Mother quota":"母配额","Other-parent quota":"其他父配额","Shared period":"共享期","First date":"第一次约会","Last date":"最后日期","Benefit withdrawal, %":"福利提取，%","Calendar label":"日历标签","Add period to plan":"在计划中添加周期","Remove":"删除","Check plan":"检查计划","Clear plan":"清晰平面图","Download calendar (.ics)":"下载日历 (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"挪威计划摘要","Total NAV period":"总资产净值周期","Before birth":"出生前","benefit days":"受益日","weeks":"周","Unscheduled quota remaining":"剩余计划外配额","Total days not yet assigned":"尚未分配的总天数","Your dated periods":"您指定的经期","Parent":"父级","Quota":"配额","Calendar dates":"日历日期","Withdrawal":"提款","Benefit days used":"已使用的福利天数","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"添加日期期间以查看剩余配额和日历。","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"选择事件详细信息并添加您想要比较的任何时间段。","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"在此设备上检查的计划。 NAV决定个人权利。","Period added to the plan.":"已将期间添加到计划中。","Period removed.":"句点已删除。","Plan cleared.":"计划已清除。","Calendar file created on this device.":"在此设备上创建的日历文件。","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"查看日期、父级、配额和提款百分比。","Compare the two coverage choices":"比较两种覆盖范围选择","Total period":"总周期","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"父母双方的承保选择相同，以后无法更改。这些数字是周期长度，而不是支出估计。","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"您的条目保留在此浏览器选项卡中。当您选择“下载”时，日历导出将在本地创建。","Assumptions used":"使用的假设","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"受益天数为周一至周五；公共假期不单独排除。","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"部分提款百分比模拟了更长的时间表和减少的福利日使用。与雇主商定实际工作百分比并检查资产净值。","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"本标准计划器中组合同时提款限制为100%；特殊的多胞胎例外情况不在此项检查范围内。","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV 期通常必须在孩子三岁之前或在照顾转移收养后三年内使用。","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · 父母福利规则和周期表","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV·国民保险基本金额（G）","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV·官方父母福利规划师","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"针对本计划之外的情况开放 NAV 指南","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"此事件日期超出了此处包含的 NAV 表的日期。打开适用规则版本的 NAV 指南。","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"此版本模拟了父母双方都获得权利的标准情况。将 NAV 用于其他家庭情况。","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"更改页面语言是否会改变规则？","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"编号该界面可以用不同的语言阅读，但该规划器始终应用规定的挪威 NAV 周期表。","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"这是否告诉我 NAV 是否​​会批准我的索赔？","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"编号资格和付款由 NAV 根据您的个人记录决定。该计划程序仅比较标准期间表和您输入的日期。","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"父母双方可以同时领取福利吗？","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"某些安排可以重叠，但标准规划器将合并提款限制为 100%。特殊的多胞胎和其他例外情况必须通过 NAV 进行检查。"},"zh_tw":{"Norway Parental Benefit and Leave Planner":"挪威育兒福利與休假計劃","Norway Parental Leave Planner 2026 — Weeks, Quotas and Calendar":"挪威產假計畫 2026 — 週數、配額和日曆","Plan Norwegian parental-benefit weeks for birth or adoption. Compare 80% and 100% coverage, assign each parent’s quotas, schedule partial leave and export a private calendar file.":"為出生或收養計劃挪威父母福利週。比較 80% 和 100% 覆蓋率、分配每位家長的配額、安排部分休假並匯出私人日曆文件。","A practical Norwegian parental-benefit planner for families comparing dates, quotas and time away from work. Choose a language for the interface; the rules below remain Norwegian NAV rules.":"實用的挪威父母福利計畫工具，適合家庭比較日期、配額和休假時間。選擇介面語言；以下規則仍然是挪威 NAV 規則。","Runs on this device. Dates and family-plan details are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"在此設備上運作。此工具不會將日期和家庭計劃詳細資訊傳送到伺服器或儲存。","Example":"例子","For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.":"對於出生於1十一月2026，父母雙方均符合資格時的標準資產淨值期限為49幾週在100％ 或者61幾週和1一天在80%。這80% 選擇通常會在更長的時間內分期付款； NAV 表示支付總額大致相等。","How the planner works":"計劃者如何工作","First compare the official period table for the selected event date, event type, number of children and coverage. Then add your own dated leave periods. Weekdays consume benefit days; partial withdrawal reduces the days used per weekday and extends the calendar. Gaps can represent work or vacation without benefit withdrawal.":"首先比較官方週期表中選定的活動日期、活動類型、兒童人數和覆蓋範圍。然後添加您自己的休假日期。工作日消耗福利日；部分提款減少了每個工作日的使用天數並延長了日曆。缺口可以代表工作或休假而不提取福利。","Common questions":"常見問題","Scope and limits":"範圍和限制","Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.":"僅限挪威。這是一項規劃援助，而不是資格決定、福利支付計算、雇主休假權利確定或資產淨值申請。標準表假設父母雙方都享有權利。活動規則、單親案例、早產、疾病、同時休假例外、跨境協調和個人化收入計算都可能改變結果；檢查這些情況下的資產淨值。","Norwegian rules only · NAV period table checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"僅限挪威規則 · NAV 週期表已檢查 17 10 月 2026 · 語言不會更改國家或規則。","Family event":"家庭活動","Birth":"出生","Adoption":"採用","Expected birth or care-transfer date":"預產期或護理轉移日期","Number of children":"兒童數量","One child":"一個孩子","Two children":"兩個孩子","Three or more children":"三個或更多兒童","Coverage choice":"覆蓋範圍選擇","100% coverage":"100% 覆蓋率","80% coverage":"80% 覆蓋率","Add a leave period":"新增休假時間","Parent taking leave":"家長請假","Mother":"母親","Other parent":"其他親","Benefit quota used":"已使用的福利配額","Prenatal quota":"產前配額","Mother quota":"母配額","Other-parent quota":"其他父配額","Shared period":"共享期","First date":"第一次約會","Last date":"最後日期","Benefit withdrawal, %":"福利提取，%","Calendar label":"日曆標籤","Add period to plan":"在計劃中新增週期","Remove":"刪除","Check plan":"檢查計劃","Clear plan":"清晰平面圖","Download calendar (.ics)":"下載行事曆 (.ics)","Norway plan summary":"挪威計畫摘要","Total NAV period":"總淨值週期","Before birth":"出生前","benefit days":"受益日","weeks":"週","Unscheduled quota remaining":"剩餘計畫外配額","Total days not yet assigned":"尚未分配的總天數","Your dated periods":"您指定的經期","Parent":"父級","Quota":"配額","Calendar dates":"日曆日期","Withdrawal":"提款","Benefit days used":"已使用的福利天數","Add dated periods to see the remaining quota and calendar.":"新增日期期間以查看剩餘配額和日曆。","Choose the event details and add any periods you want to compare.":"選擇事件詳細資訊並新增您想要比較的任何時間段。","Plan checked on this device. NAV decides individual rights.":"在此設備上檢查的計劃。 NAV決定個人權利。","Period added to the plan.":"已將期間新增至計畫中。","Period removed.":"句點已刪除。","Plan cleared.":"計劃已清除。","Calendar file created on this device.":"在此裝置上建立的日曆檔案。","Review the dates, parent, quota and withdrawal percentages.":"查看日期、父級、配額和提款百分比。","Compare the two coverage choices":"比較兩種覆蓋範圍選擇","Total period":"總週期","The coverage choice is the same for both parents and cannot be changed later. The figures are period lengths, not a payout estimate.":"父母雙方的核保選擇相同，以後無法更改。這些數字是周期長度，而不是支出估計。","Your entries stay in this browser tab. Calendar export is created locally when you choose Download.":"您的條目保留在此瀏覽器標籤中。當您選擇“下載”時，日曆匯出將在本機上建立。","Assumptions used":"使用的假設","Benefit days are counted Monday through Friday; public holidays are not separately excluded.":"受益天數為週一至週五；公共假期並非單獨排除。","A partial-withdrawal percentage models a longer schedule and reduced benefit-day use. Agree the actual work percentage with the employer and check NAV.":"部分提款百分比模擬了更長的時間表和減少的福利日使用。與雇主商定實際工作百分比並檢查資產淨值。","Combined simultaneous withdrawal is limited to 100% in this standard planner; special multiple-birth exceptions are outside this check.":"本標準計劃器中組合同時提款限制為100%；特殊的多胞胎例外情況不在此項檢查範圍內。","NAV periods normally must be used before the child turns three, or within three years after care transfer for adoption.":"NAV 期通常必須在孩子三歲之前或在照顧轉移收養後三年內使用。","NAV · parental benefit rules and period tables":"NAV · 父母福利規則與週期表","NAV · National Insurance basic amount (G)":"NAV·國民保險基本金額（G）","NAV · official parental benefit planner":"NAV·官方父母福利規劃師","Open NAV guidance for cases outside this planner":"針對本計劃之外的情況開放 NAV 指南","This event date is outside the dated NAV tables included here. Open NAV guidance for the applicable rule version.":"此事件日期超出了此處包含的 NAV 表的日期。開啟適用規則版本的 NAV 指南。","This version models the standard case where both parents have earned a right. Use NAV for other family situations.":"此版本模擬了父母雙方都獲得權利的標準情況。將 NAV 用於其他家庭情況。","Does changing the page language change the rules?":"更改頁面語言是否會改變規則？","No. The interface can be read in different languages, but this planner always applies the stated Norwegian NAV period table.":"編號此介面可以用不同的語言閱讀，但此規劃器始終會應用規定的挪威 NAV 週期表。","Does this tell me whether NAV will approve my claim?":"這是否告訴我 NAV 是否​​會批准我的索賠？","No. Eligibility and payment are decided by NAV from your individual records. This planner only compares the standard period table and dates you enter.":"編號資格和付款由 NAV 根據您的個人記錄決定。此計劃程序僅比較標準期間表和您輸入的日期。","Can both parents take benefits at the same time?":"父母雙方可以同時領取福利嗎？","Some arrangements can overlap, but the standard planner limits combined withdrawal to 100%. Special multiple-birth and other exceptions must be checked with NAV.":"某些安排可以重疊，但標準規劃器將合併提款限制為 100%。特殊的多胞胎和其他例外情況必須透過 NAV 進行檢查。"}});
